<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EZK" style="id">Ezekiel</book>
  <para style="h">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiel</para>
  <para style="mt">Ezekiel</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sawmthumna, thla lina, ni nganaah chuan, kei Ezekiela, puithiam Buzia fapa chu Babulon rama Kebar lui kama Juda sal tângte zîngah ka awm a, vân a lo inhawng a, Pathian inlârna ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal Jehoiakina sala a tân kum ngana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Babulon rama Kebar lui kamah chuan Lalpa thusawi ka hria a, a thiltihtheihna chuan mi tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a, hmâr lam ata thlipui nasa tak lo thawk ka hmu a. Chhûmpui nasa tak aṭang hian kâwl hi a lo phe zawr zawr a, a kiang vêlte chu a êng pup mai a. Kâwl a phêtnaah chuan êng eng emaw, dâr tle mi ang hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thlipui lai takah chuan thil nung pali ang, mihring ruangâm pu ka hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />hmai pali leh thla pali an nei ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An ke an thluang a, bâwng tin ang an nei a, dâr tle mi angin an êng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hmai pali leh thla pali bâkah chuan mihring kut ang pali an nei ṭheuh va, an thla hnuaiah zêl a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil nungte chuan an thla pahnih an zâr pharh ṭheuh chuan an thla hmâwrte chu a intawk pha a. Kil li neiin an ding a, an chêt sawn pawhin an zain an taksa her chuang lovin an che sawn ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil nung palite chuan hmai pali an nei ṭheuh va, an hma lamah mihring hmêl an pu a; ding lamah sakeibaknei hmêl ang, vei lamah bâwngpa hmêl ang, hnung lamah mupui hmêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thil nung paliten an thla pahnih ṭheuh chu a hmâwr intawk phain an zâr ṭheuh va, a dangte chu an taksa hrûlah an khup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil nungte chuan khawi lam pawh an hawi sa vek a ni, inher lovin thlarauvin a duhna lam apiangah an kal ho thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil nungte zîngah chuan, êng eng emaw, meichher alh deuh ang mai hi a awm a, eng lai pawhin a che a. Mei chu a alh êng pup a, kâwlphe angin a êng chhuak zuai zuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil nungte chu kâwlphe angin an vir tawn zawk zawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thil nung palite chu ka en reng lai chuan, tawlailîr ke pali thil nung pali zâwn ṭheuhva awm, leia innghat ka hmu bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tawlailîr ke palite chu inang vek a ni a, lunghlu angin an êng ṭheuh va, tawlailîr ke pakhat chhûnga tawlailîr ke dang awm ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Inher lovin khawi lam hawi pawhin an che sawn thei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tawlailîr ke bial tlângte chu kual kung mai, râpthlâk tak a ni a, mitin a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thil nungte chu an kal sawn apiangin tawlailîrte pawh chuan an zui ve zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil nungte chu thlarau duhna lam lamah an kal a, tawlailîrte pawhin thil nungte tih ang chiahin an ti ve a, thil nungte thlarau chu tawlailîr keahte a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tichuan, thil nungte chu an kalin emaw, an dinin emaw, boruaka chawikân an nihin emaw, tawlailîrte pawh chutiang bawk chuan an awm ṭhîn, thil nungte thlarau chu tawlailîr keahte chuan a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, thil nungte lû chung chu thil eng emaw, krustal lung tle mia siam ang hian a khuh kulh mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu thil awm kulh hnuaiah chuan thil nungte chu an ding a; an dawta mite lamah chuan an thla pahnih an zâr a, an thla pahnih dangin an taksa an khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An thlawh laia an thla zâp ri chu ka hria a, tuifinriat fâwn ri ang leh sipai rual thâwm anga mipui ri mur mur thâwm leh Engkimtithei Pathian aw ang a ni. An thlawh loh chuan an thlate an khup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An thlawh loh lai pawhin an lû chung zâwn chung lama thil awm aṭang khân thil ri hum hum a awm tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, an lû chunga vân dum chungah khân lalṭhutthlêng ang tak, sapphir lung ang maia lang hi a awm a; tin, lalṭhutthlêng ang tak chungah chuan mihring ang taka lang hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, a kâwng achin chung lam chu ṭhihna puak sur ang maiin ka hmu a, a kâwng ni âwm achin hnuai lam chu mei ang mai hi niin ka hmu a, a êng vêl pup mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ruah sûr nia chhûm chunga chhimbâl lan dân ang mai hi a vêla êng lan dân chu a ni a. Hei hi Lalpa ropuina lan dân chu a ni. Tin, ka hmuhin bawkkhupin ka tlu a, thusawitu aw chu ka hria a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, i kein ding rawh, i hnênah thu ka sawi dâwn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ka hnêna thu a sawi lai chuan thlarau chu keimahah a lo lût a, ka kein mi dintîr a; tin, mi betu chu ka ngaithla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, Israel fate hnênah, hel hmang hnam, ka chunga hel ṭhînte hnênah chuan ka tîr a che: anmahni leh an thlahtute pawhin vawiin thleng hian ka chungah an bawhchhe ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhuan luhlul leh tihmawhte an ni a, an hnênah ka tirh che hi; tin, an hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti,’ i ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, annin an ngaithla emaw, an ngaithla lo emaw (hel hmang an ni si a), an zîngah zâwlnei a awm tih an hre reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, nang, mihring fapa, anmahni hlau suh la, an thûah pawh zâm hek suh, i hnênah chuan lênhlîng leh hnimhlîngneite awmin, khawmualkaikuang zînga chêng ni mah la; hel hmang mi ni mah sela, an thu chu hlau suh la, an lan dânah zâm hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, an ngaithla emaw, ngaithla lo emaw, an hnênah ka thu i sawi tûr a ni; hel hmang tak an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, nang mihring fapa, i hnêna ka sawi hi ngaithla rawh; mi hel hmangte angin hel hmang ni ve suh, i kâ âng la, ka pêk che chu ei rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a, ngai teh, kutin mi rawn ban a; tin, ngai teh, kutah chuan lehkhabu zial a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hmaah a han pharh a, a chhûng lam leh a pâwn lama ziak a ni a; ṭahna te, lusûnna te, chungpikna te ziakin a awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, i hmuh kha ei rawh; lehkhabu zial hi ei la, Israela chhûngte hnênah chuan thu va sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka kâ ka âng a, lehkhabu zial chu mi eitîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, i pumah pai la, he lehkhabu zial ka pêk che hian i kawchhûng tikhat rawh,” a ti a. Tichuan, ka ei ta a, a thlumzia chu ka kâah chuan khawizu ang mai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, kal la, Israel chhûngte hnênah chuan ka thute hi hmangin va sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ṭawng hrang leh ṭawng harsate hnênah tirh i ni lo va, Israel chhûngte hnênah tirh i ni zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam ropui tak, an ṭawng i hriat loh, ṭawng harsa pui pui hmangtute zîngah pawh tîr che ila chuan i thu an ngaithla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mahse, Israel chhûngte chuan an ngaithla lo vang che, kei mi ngaithla dâwn si lo va, Israel chhûngte zawng luhlul tak leh tihmawh takte an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah hian luhlul tak leh deh khirh takin anmahni ang maiin ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lung chang tak, meilung aia changa deh khirhin ka siam a che, hlau suh la, an mitmelhah zâm hek suh, hel hmang mi ni mah sela,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu lo chu ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, i hnêna ka thu sawi tûr zawng zawng chu i bengin ngaithla la, i thinlungah khung rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kal la, i chipui sal tângte hnên va thleng la; an ngaithla emaw, ngaithla lo emaw, ‘Hetiang hi Lalpa thuchhuak chu a ni e,’ tiin sawi la, hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, thlarauvin mi chawi kâng ta a, ka hnung lamah chuan thâwm ri sung sung hi ka hria a, “A hmun aṭang hian Lalpa ropuina chu malsâwmin awm rawh se,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, thil nungte thla intawk ri te, an bula tawlailîr ri te, thâwm ri sung sung te chu ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutichuan, thlarauvin mi chawi kâng a, mi la bo ta a; thinrim tak leh hreh tak chungin ka kal ta a, Lalpa kut chu ka chungah a chak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tichuan, Tel-abib-a sal tângho, Kebar luia chêngte hnên chu ka lo thleng a, an ṭhutnaah chuan ka ṭhu a; mak ti takin tah chuan ni sarih ka ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, ni sarih tâwpah chuan heti hi a ni a, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte vêngtuah ka ruat che a ni; tichuan, ka kâa thu i hria angin keima aiah i vaukhâng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi suaksual hnêna ka thu, ‘I thi ngei tûr a ni,’ ka tiha, chu mi suaksual chu a nunna hum tûra a sualna kawng kalsan tûra vauna i neih lohva, vaukhânna thu i hrilh bawk si lohva, chu mi suaksual chu a khawlohnaah a thih chuan, a thisen mawh chu i lakah ka phût ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chu mi suaksual chu i vauva, a suahsualna a kalsan lohva, a sualna kawng a hawisan bawk loh chuan a khawlohnaah a thi ang a, nang erawh chuan i nun i chhan him a ni zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mi fel chuan a felna hawisana khawlohna a tiha, a hmaa tlûkna ka lo dah chuanin, a thi ang; vaukhânna i neih loh avângin ama sualah a thi ang a, a thil fel tih tawhte chu hriat reng a ni lo vang; a thisen mawh erawh chu i lakah ka phût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi fel chu sual lo tûra i vaukhâna a sual loh chuan, vauna a pawisak avângin a nung ang; nang pawhin i nun i humhim ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, tah chuan Lalpa kut chu ka chungah a awm a, ka hnênah, “Tho la, phaizâwlah kal la, tah chuan ka bia ang che,” a ti a. Tichuan, ka tho va, phaizâwlah chuan ka kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, tah chuan Lalpa ropuina chu, ropuina, Kebar luia ka hmuh ang mai khân a lo ding a, kei chu bawkkhupin ka tlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, thlarau chu keimahah a lo lût a, ka kein mi dintîr a, mi bia a, “Kal la, i inah inkhâr khung rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang zawng e, mihring fapa, hruizênin an hlîng ang chia, an phuar ang che, an zîngah i lêng chhuak tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I lei chu i dangah ka behtîr ang a, i ṭawng tawh lo vang a, anmahni zilhtu i ni tawh lo vang, hel hmang chhûng an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mahsela, i hnêna thu ka sawi hunah chuan i kâ ka ântîr ang chia, an hnênah chuan Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘A ngaithlain ngaithla sela, a ngaithla lovin ngaithla lo mai rawh se, hel hmang chhûng an ni si a, a ti e,’ tiin i sawi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang mihring fapa, leirawhchan phêk la la, i hmaah dah la, chumiah chuan khawpui, Jerusalem khawpui lem ziak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vêla hualin kulh siam hnan la, mual pâwng siam hnan rawh, sipai riah bûkte siam hnan la, kulh sut chhiatnate a vêlin siam hnan rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, nangin thîr phêk la la, nangmah leh khawpui inkârah chuan thîr bang atân chhawng rawh; chu lam chu hmachhawn la, hualin a awm ang a, nangman i hual tûr a ni. Hei hi Israel chhûngte tân entîr lâwkna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, nang chu vei lam delhin mu la, i chungah Israel chhûngte khawlohna nghat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An khawlohna tuarin ni zathum leh ni sawmkaw chhûng mu rawh. Kum khat hrem an tuar aiah ni khat zêl i tuar dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi zawhah inlet la, i ding lam delhin mu leh rawh; Juda chhûngte khawlohna chu ni sawmli i tuar leh tûr a ni, hrem an tuar tûr kum khat zêlah ni khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bân hlîm têl tâwlin Jerusalem hual lam kha hawi la, a chung thu sawi chhuak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, hruizênin ka hlîng che a, i hual ni i tlingtlâk hma loh chuan khawi lamah mah i inher tûr a ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Buh te, barli te, bê te, dailuah te, buhtun te, vaibuhtun te la la, bêl pakhatah dah la, chhangah siam rawh; i pangkhing delha i mut chhûng zawng, ni zathum leh sawmkaw chhûng chuan chu chu i ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I chaw ei tûr chu teh vek tûr a ni a, ni khatah sekel sawmhnih a ni tûr a ni; hunbi nei takin i ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, tui te pawh teh vekin i in tûr a ni a, hin khat hmun ruka ṭhena hmun khat a ni tûr a ni; hunbi nei takin i in tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an mit hmuh ngeiah mihring êk rovin i ur ang a, barli chhang eiin i ei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Hetiang chaw bawlhhlawh hi Israel fate chuan ka hnawh bona tûr hnamte zîngah chuan an ei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tah chuan kei chuan, “A! Lalpa Pathian, ngawi teh, ka nun chu tihbawlhhlawh a ni ngai lo va, ka tleirâwl tirh ata tûn thleng pawhin, amaha thi emaw, ramsa seh emaw chu ka la ei ngai si lo va, sa tenawm ka kâah a lût ngai bawk hek lo,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tah chuan ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hei le, mihring êk aiah bâwng êk ka pe chia, i ei tûr chu hêng hian i siam tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu ka hnênah, ani chuan, “Mihring fapa, ngai teh, Jerusalem-ah chuan chaw, nunna bul chu ka tichhia ang a, an chaw chu teh vekin fîmkhur takin an ei ang; tui pawh teh vekin lunghnûr takin an in ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />chaw te, tui te an tlâkchhama, an inlungtena, an khawlohnaa an rîral zawh nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, nang mihring fapa, khandaih hriam tak la la, i lû leh i khabe hmul meh nân lu mêttu bakmeh chemah hmang rawh; tin, bûkna la la, sam chu ṭhen ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu huala a awm chhûng nite a kim hunah chuan khawpui laia meiah i rawh tûr a ni a, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat leh chu i la ang a, a vêlah khandaihin i sât sawm tûr a ni; tin, hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat dang chu thli len tûrin i theh darh tûr a ni a, keiin khandaihin ka ûm zui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, tlêm tê chu i la ang a, i kawrfual hmâwrah i bâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hênga mi hi i la ang a, meiah chuan i theh lût tûr a ni a, a kâng ang; chumi aṭang chuan Israel chhûngte zawng zawngah mei a lo chhuak ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Hei hi Jerusalem khua a ni: hnamte zîngah chuan ka dah a, a vêlah ramte a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hnamte aia nasa zâwka suahsualna tiin ka thurêl chungah a hel a, a vêla ramte aia nasain ka dân siam chungahte pawh a hel a ni. Ka thurêlte chu an paih thla si a, ka dân siamte ang pawhin an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘In vêla hnamte aia buai hmang zâwkin in awm a, ka dân siam anga in awm lohva, ka thurêlte in vawn lohva, hnamte tâna ka thuruatte in tih hek loh avângin,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ngai rawh u, kei meuh pawh hian ka dodâl che u a ni, hnamte mit hmuh ngeiin in zîngah rorêlna ka hlen dâwn e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tin, in tenawmna zawng zawngte avângin thil ka la tih ngai loh, tih pawh ka tih leh ngai tawh loh tûr chu i chungah ka ti dâwn e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, paten i chhûngah an fate an ei ang a, fate pawhin an pate an ei ang; nangma mi la awm chhun zawng zawng chu ka tidarhsarh vek ang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, hei hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni: ‘I bawlhhlawhna leh i tenawmnatein ka biak in i tihbawlhhlawh avângin, a nuna ka nun chhûng chu, ka suat ang che u a, ka mitin a hmaih hlek lo vang che u a, ka khawngaih hlek lo vang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu hriin emaw, ṭâmin emaw in zîngah an thi ang; hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat chu i vêlah khandaihin an thi ang; hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat dang chu ka tidarhsarh vek ang a, khandaihin ka ûm zui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hetiang hian ka thinurna ka hlen ang a, an chungah ka thinrimna ka hrithla ang a, ka ngaih a ṭha tawh ang; tin, kei Lalpa hian an chunga ka thinurna ka hrîkthlâk hunah chuan, dichim takin ka sawi tawh tih an hre chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu lovah chuan, i vêla hnamte zîngah leh veivâk zawng zawngte mit hmuhah chuan, khaw ram leh hmuhsitawmah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, thinur tak leh thinrim êm êma nasa taka zilha, i chunga thurêlte ka hlen hunah, i vêla hnamte mit hmuhah chuan chêksawlhna leh tihelna leh vaukhânna leh thil râpthlâk i ni ang. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An chungah ṭâmna thalfang ṭha lo tak, boralna tûr, nangmahni boralna tûr chu ka rawn tlâktîr ang; in chungah ṭâm ka tizual ang a, in chaw, nunna bul chu ka tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, in hnênah ṭâmna leh ramsa kawlhte ka rawn tîr ang a, fanau chânin an siam ang che. Hripui leh thisen chhuahna in zîngah a lêng ang; tin, in lakah khandaih ka rawn lek ang. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh hi,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel tlâng lamte chu hawi la, an hnênah thu sawi la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘Israel tlângte u, Lalpa Pathian thu hi ngaithla rawh u: Lalpa Pathian chuan tlângte leh mualte hnênah leh, ruamte leh kawrte hnênah chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, kei, keimah ngei hian in lakah khandaih ka rawn lek ang a, in bâwlhmunte chu ka tichhe vek dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />In maichâmte chu a ram ang a, in ni pathian lemte chu a keh sawm ang; tin, in mi thah ruangte chu in milimte bulah ka paih ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Israel fate ruang chu an milim bulahte chuan ka dah ang a, in ruhte chu in maichâm vêlah chuan ka theh darh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In chênna hmun zawng zawngahte chuan khawpuite chu a chhia ang a, bâwlhmunte chu a ram ang; in maichâmte tihchhiat leh tihram a nih theih nân leh in milimte a keh sawma, a bo theih nân leh in ni pathian lemte chu râwt thlûka an awma, in hnathawhte chu a boral theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, mi thahte chu in zîngah an tlu ang a; tichuan, Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ram tina in darhsarh hunah chuan hnamte zînga khandaih pumpelhte an la awm dâwn avângin, a ṭhen chu ka la zuah cheu vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, in zîng ata chhuakte chuan sala an hruaina hnamte zîngah chuan min hre reng ang a, an uirêna thinlung ka lâk bo tawh leh an mit, an milim lama uirête chu ka tihchhiatsakziate an hria ang; tin, an tenawmnatea thil sual, anmahni hmuh ngeia an lo tih tâk thûahte chuan an inten tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang a, hêng thil ṭha lo hi an hnênah ka ti dâwn a, a thlâwn maiin ka sawi lo tih an hria ang,” ’ tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a: “I kut bêngin i kê per la, ‘E hei! Israel chhûngte tenawmna sual avânga maw! Khandaihin, ṭâmin, hripuiin an tlu dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hla taka awm chu hripuiin an thi ang a, a hnaia awm chu khandaihin an tlu ang a, a bâng, huala awmte chu ṭâmin an thi tho vang; hetiang hian ka thinrimna nasa tak chu an chungah ka hrithla dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, tlâng sângah te, tlâng chhîp zawng zawngahte leh, thing hring apiang hnuaiah leh, sasaw buk tin hnuaia an milimte hnêna rimtui an hlanna hmunah, an maichâm vêla an milimte bula an mitthi ruangte a awm hunah chuan, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an chungah ka kut ka lek ang a, thlalêr aṭanga Dibla lama an chênna hmun zawng zawngah ram chu ka tiramin ka tichhia ang. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang mihring fapa, Lalpa Pathian chuan Israel ram hnênah chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Tâwpna, tâwpna chu ram kil liah a lo thleng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tûn hi i tân tâwpna a ni, i chungah ka thinurna ka rawn thlen ang a, i awm dân ang zêlin ro ka rêl ang chia, i tenawmna zawng zawng chu i chungah ka rawn thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ka mitin a hmaih lo vang chia, ka khawngaih hek lo vang che; i awm dânte chu i chungah ka rawn thlen zâwk ang a, i tenawmnate chu i chungah a awm ang; tin, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a: “Thil ṭha lo, thil ṭha lo takzet, ngai teh, a lo thleng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tâwpna a lo thleng e, tâwpna a lo thleng e, i chungah a lo tho ta, ngai rawh, a lo thleng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ram luahtu, i chhiatna tûr i chungah a lo thleng e, hun chu a lo thleng a, ni chu a hnai ta; buaina ni, lâwma tlâng chunga auna ni ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûnah hian ka thinrimna chu i chungah ka rawn leih thuai dâwn e, i chungah ka thinurna chu ka hrithla ang; i awm dân ang zêlin ro ka rêl ang che; i tenawmnate zawng zawng chu i chungah ka rawn thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka mitin a hmaih lo vang a, ka khawngaih hek lo vang: i awm dân ang zêlin i chungah ka rawn thlen ang a, i tenawmnate pawh chu in zîngah a awm ang. Tichuan, kei Lalpa hi hrem thei ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngai rawh, ni chu, ngai rawh, a lo thleng e, i chhiatna tûr chu a chhuak ta, tiang chu a pâr ta, chapona chu a kuhmûm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pâwngnêkna chu suahsualna tiangah a chang ta a ni; a tua mah an awm tawh lo vang a, an thâwm emaw, an hausakna emaw pawh; tu mahin an ui hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hun chu a lo thleng ta a, ni chu a lo hnai zêl e. Leitu chu hlim suh sela, hralhtu chu lungngai hek suh se; thinurna chu an zavaia chungah a thleng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hralhtu chuan, la dam mah sela, a thil hralh chu a hmu leh tawh dâwn si lo va; inlârna chu an zavaia chung thu tûr a ni a, tu mah an kîr lo vang, tu mah an nun khawlohnaah hian an nung khawchhuak hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt chu an hâm a, engkim a inpeih tawh a; mahse, indonaah chuan tu mah an kal lo; ka thinurna chu an zavaia chungah a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pâwnah khandaih, a chhûngah hripui leh ṭâm. Rama awm chu khandaihin a thi ang a, khawpuia awm chu ṭâm leh hripuiin a ei zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, a tlân chhuakte chu, an chhuak na ang a, tlângahte chuan chul ram ṭhûro ang maiin an awm ang; an vaiin khawhar takin, mahni khawlohna ṭheuhvah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kut zawng zawngte chu a zâwi ang a, khûp zawng zawngte chu tui angin a nêm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Saiip puan an fêng ang a, râpnain anmahni a tuam ang a, hmêl zawng zawngah zahna a lang ang a, an lû zawng zawng a kâwng fai vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An tangkarua leh an rangkachakte chuan Lalpa thinurna nîah chuan a chhan chhuak thei lo vang a, an nun a titlai lo vang a, an pum a tipuar hek lo vang, an khawlohna tlûkna a nih tawh ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An incheina mawina chu an chapopui a, an tenawmna milemah leh an bawlhhlawhna thilah an chantîr chauh zâwk a ni; chumi avâng chuan an tân thil tenawmah ka lo siam ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, râllâk atân hnam dang kutah ka pe ang a, leia mi suaksualte hnênah râllâk atân ka pe bawk ang a, annin an lo tibawlhhlawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anmahni chu ka hawisan ang a, ka hmun serh chu an tibawlhhlawh ang; rûk hmangte an lût ang a, an tibawlhhlawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khaidiat chu siam rawh u, ram chu thisen chhuah hmang rorêlnain a khat a, khawpui chu pâwngnêknain a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, hnam dang sual berte ka rawn hruai lût ang a, an inte an neihsak ang; an chakna, an uanpui chu ka titâwp ang a, an hmun serhte chu tihbawlhhlawhin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Manganna a lo thleng a, muanna an zawng a, a awm miah si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chhiatna chungah chhiat lehzualna, thuthang chungah thuthang a lo awm ang a, zâwlnei lakah inlârna an zawng ang a; mahse, dânte chu puithiam lakah a bo vang a, upate lakah thurâwn a awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lal chu a lungngai ang a, hotu chu beidawnna silhfênin a inthuam ang a, vântlâng kutte pawh a khûr ang. An hnênah chuan an awm dân athuin ka ti ang a, an thiltih ang zêlin ro ka rêlsak ang; tin, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hre tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kum rukna, thla rukna, chumi thla ni nga nîah chuan heti hi a ni a, ka inah ka ṭhuta, Juda upate ka hmaa an ṭhut lai chuan Lalpa Pathian kut chu ka chungah a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, ka han en a, ngai teh, mi, mei anga lang hi a lo awm a; a kâwng achin hnuai lam ni âwma lang chu mei a ni a; a kâwng achin chung lam chu ṭhihna zia ang, êng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, kut ang hian a rawn zen chhuak a, ka chal samah mi man ta a, thlarau chuan lei leh vân kârah mi chawi kâng ta daih mai a, Pathian inlârnain Jerusalem-ah mi hruai a. Jerusalem hmâr lam hung chhûngnung kawngka khârna bulah chuan mi thlen ta a; tah chuan thîkna lim ṭhuthmun a awm a, chu chuan a thîktîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ngai rawh, phaizâwla ka hmuh ang zêl khân chutah chuan Israel Pathian ropuina chu a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, hmâr lam hawiin i mit han lên teh le,” a ti a. Chutichuan, hmâr lam hawia ka mit ka han lên chuan, ngai teh, maichâm kawngka hmâr lam luhnaah chuan he thîkna lim hi a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, an thiltih kha i hmu em? Israel chhûngten thil tenawm nasa tak, heta an tih ngei, ka in thianghlim ata hla taka ka kal bo nân an tih kha? Mahse, thil dang tenawm zaw mah i la hmu leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûng luhnaah chuan mi hruai a; tin, ka han en a, bangah hian âwng zuk lo awm a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, bang kha han ker teh,” a ti a. Tin, ka han ker tâkah chuan kawngkhâr a lo awm reng mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Lût la, heta sual tenawm tak an tih hi en teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, ka lût a, ka hmu a, ngai rawh, thil nung chi tinrêng lem te, ramsa tenawm lem te, Israel chhûngte milim zawng zawngte chu bangah chuan a vêlin a lo chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an hmaah chuan Israel chhûng upate zînga mi sawmsarihte chu an ding a, an laiah chuan Saphana fapa Jaazania a ding a, mi tin chuan berhbu an keng ṭheuh va; tin, rimtui khu rim chu a chho ta mup mup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngkuaa upate thim hnuaia thiltih chu i hmu em, mi tinin milim pindana an tih chu? ‘ Lalpa chuan min hmu lo va, Lalpa chuan ram chu a kalsan tawh alâwm,’ an ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An thiltih tenawm nasa lehzual dang pawh i la hmu leh ang,” ka hnênah chuan a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa in hmâr lampang luhna kawngkhârah mi hruai a; tin, ngai teh, tah chuan hmeichhiate chu Tammuz ngaia ṭapin an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Aw mihring fapa, hei hi i hmu em? Hei aia tenawm nasa hi i la hmu ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa in hung chhûngnung zâwkah chuan mi hruai lût a; ngai teh, Lalpa in thianghlim kawngkhârah chuan, hulhliap leh maichâm inkârah hian, mi sawmhnih leh panga Lalpa in thianghlim lam hnuchhawna, an hmaite khawchhak lam hawiin an lo awm a, khawchhak lama ni chu zuk lo bia a!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hei hi i hmu em, aw mihring fapa? An thil tenawm tih, heta an tiha hi Juda chhûngte tân thil tênau em ni? Ram chu pâwngnêknain an tikhat a, mi tithinur leh ta nghâl si a, an hnâr chu chhâwlin an hup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, kei pawhin thinur takin ka ti dâwn a ni: ka mitin a hmaih lo vang a, ka khawngaih hek lo vang; aw ring takin ka bengah rawn au mah sela, ka ngaithla lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, ka beng hriatah chuan, “Khawpui enkawltute chu mi tin tihboralna hriamhrei kengin lo hnai rawh se,” tiin ring takin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai rawh, hmâr lam kawngka chungnung kalna aṭang chuan mi paruk an lo kal a, mi tinin tihhlumna hriamhrei chu an keng ṭheuh va; tin, an laia mi pakhat puanzaisîn sin chuan lehkhatui bûr a pai a. Tin, an lût ta a, dâr maichâm bulah chuan an ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Israel-te Pathian ropuina chu a awmna cherub aṭang chuan, chu in kawngka bulah chuan a chho va; tin, puanzaisîn sin, lehkhatui bûr paitu kha a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Khawpui chu fang la, Jerusalem chu fang chhuak rawh: a chhûnga thil tenawm tih tawhte avânga thawpika ṭap ṭhînte chu an chalah chhinchhiah ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mi dangte hnênah chuan ka hriat ngeiin, “A hnungah sâwn khawpui chu fang chhuak ula, kut thlâk rawh u, in mitin hmuh hmaih suh sela, khawngaih hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Putar te, tlangvâl te, nula te, naupangte leh nute that fai vek rawh u. Chhinchhiahna neite erawh chu rawn hnaih suh u; ka hmun thianghlimah ṭan rawh u,” a ti a. Tichuan, biak in kawta upahovah chuan an ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “In chu tibawrhbâng ula, a hung chhûng te chu mi ruangin tikhat ula, chhuak rawh u,” a ti a. Tin, an chhuak ta a, khawpuiah chuan an che ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, khawpuia an chêt lai chuan kei chu hnutchhiahin ka lo awm a, ka tlu bawkkhup a, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, Jerusalem chunga i thinur leihbuakah hian Israel la awm chhunte pawh i tiboral vek dâwn em ni?” tiin ka au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Israel leh Juda chhûngte khawlohna chu a nasa êm a ni. Ram chu thisenin a khat a, khawpui chu hlemhle rorêlnain a khat a: ‘ Lalpan ram chu a kalsan tawh a, Lalpan eng mah a hmu hlei nêm!’ an ti si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kei pawh hian ka hmuh hmaih lo vang a, ka khawngaih hek lo vang; an sual mawh chu a bûrin ka khumtîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, puanzaisîn sina lehkhatui bûr pai khân thu chu a thlen a, “I thu mi pêk ang khân ka ti zo ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, ka han en a, ngai teh, cherub-ho lû chunga vân dum awmah khian sapphir lung ni âwm tak, lalṭhutthlêng ang taka lang hi a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan puanzaisîn sin hnênah khân, “Cherub hnuaia tawlailîr virte keah sâwn va lût la, cherub-ho inkâra meivâm saw i kut khinghnih khatin va lâwk la, khawpui chungah theh darh rawh,” a ti a. Tin, ka hmuh lai ngeiin a kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mi a luh lai khân cherub-ho chu in pui ding lampangah an ding a; tin, hung chhûngnung chu chhûmin a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ropuina chu cherub-ho aṭang chuan a chho va, biak in kawngka chungah chuan a han ding ta a, in chu chhûmin a khat a, hung chhûng chu Lalpa ropuina êng chuan a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, cherub-ho thla zâp ri te chu hung chhûng pâwnta zâwkah te pawh chuan Pathian Engkimtitheian mi a biak laia a aw ang maiin a hriat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, puanzaisîn sin hnêna, “Cherub-ho inkâra tawlailîr vir kâr ata mei va la rawh,” tia thu a pêkin, ani chu a va lut a, tawlaitîr ke bulah chuan a ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, cherub chuan cherub-ho inkâr aṭang chuan cherub-ho inkâra mei awm chu a han ban a, a la a, puanzaisîn sin kutah chuan a pe a, ani chuan a lo la a, a chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, cherub-ho thla hnuaiah chuan mihring kut ang mai hi a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka han en a, ngai teh, cherub-ho sîrah chuan tawlailîr ke pali, cherub pakhat kiangah tawlailîr ke pakhat, cherub dang kiangah tawlailîr ke dang ka hmu a; tin, tawlailîr ke lan dân chu Tarsis lung zia ang hi a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an lanziaah chuan an paliin ang khat an ni a, tawlailîr ke pakhat chhûnga tawlailîr ke dang awm ang mai hi a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An kal chuan sîr liah an kal thei a, an kal pawhin an her ngai lo; amaherawhchu, a hmasa hawi lam apiang an zui a ni, an kalin an her chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an taksa pum chu, an hnung te, an kut te, an thlate leh tawlailîr kete pawh kha, a vêlin mitin a khat a, an palia tawlailîr kete pawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tawlailîr kete kha chu ka beng hriat ngeiah, “Tawlailîr ke vir” tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mi tinin hmêl pali ṭheuh an nei a, hmêl pakhat chu cherub hmêl a ni a, pahnihna chu mihring hmêl a ni a, pathumna chu sakeibaknei hmêl, palina chu mupui hmêl a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, cherub-ho chu an chho ta a; hei hi Kebar lui kama thil nung ka hmuh chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, cherub-ho an kal chuan tawlailîr kête chu an kiangah a kal ve a; tin, cherub-ho khân lei ata chho tûra an thlate an zâr chuan tawlailîr kête chuan a hransan ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An din chuan hêngte hi an ding ve a, an chhoh chuan hêngte hi an chho ve ṭhîn a, thil nung thlarau chu anmahniah a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ropuina chu in pui kawngka chung aṭang chuan a chhuak a, cherub-ho chungah chuan a ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, cherub-ho chuan an thla an zâr a, an chhuahin ka mit hmuh ngeiah lei ata an chho va, tawlailîr kete chu an kiangah a awm zêl a; tin, Lalpa in luhna chhak lam kawngkhâr bulah chuan an ding ta a, Israel Pathian ropuina chu an chungah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hei hi Kebar luia Israel Pathian hnuaia ka thil nung hmuh chu a ni; cherub-ho an ni tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi tinin hmêl hrang pali leh thla pali an nei ṭheuh va, an thla hnuaiah chuan mihring kut ang mai hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, an hmêl lam thûah chuan Kebar luia ka hmuh hmêlte ang bawk kha an lan dân leh anmahni ngeite pawh an ni a; tin, an hma zâwng zêlin an kal ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, thlarauvin mi chawi kâng a, Lalpa in chhak lam luhna, khawchhak chhawngah chuan mi thlen a; tin, ngai teh, luhna kawngkhâr bulah chuan mi sawmhnih leh panga an lo awm a; an zîngah chuan Azura fapa Jaazania leh Benaia fapa Pelatia, mipui hotute chu ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah “Mihring fapa, hêng hi khawlohna phiar chhuaktute an ni a, he khawpuiah hian sual rawt chhuaktute an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘In sak hun a la ni lo ve; he khawpui hi saso bêl a ni a, keini hi sa chu kan ni,’ titute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, thu sawi la, aw mihring fapa, an chungah thu sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thlarau chu ka chungah a lo thleng a, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Sawi rawh, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti e: “Hetiangin in ti ṭhîn a, aw Israel chhûngte u, in rilrua thil lo thlengte chu ka hre fai vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He khawpuiah hian in thlahte chu in tipung tulh tulh a, a kawtthlêrte chu in mi thahin in tikhat ta a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “I mi thah, a laia in dahte chu a sa chu a ni a; he khawpui hi a saso bêl chu a ni; mahse, a lai ata sawn chhuahin in awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khandaih chu in hlau va, in chungah khandaih ka rawn thlen ang,” Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A lai ata ka tichhuak ang che u a, hnam dangte kutah ka mantîr ang che u a, in chung thu an rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khandaihin in thi ang a, Israel ramri lamah chuan in chung thu ka rêl ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He khawpui hi in saso bêl a ni lo vang a, nangni lah a chhûnga sa in ni hek lo vang; Israel ramri lamah chuan in chung thu ka rêl ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hre tawh ang; ka dân siam chu in zawh lo va, ka thuchhuak pawh in zâwm hek lo; in vêla hnamte tih dân chu in zâwm ta zâwk a,” a ti e,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, thu ka han sawi chuan Benaia fapa Pelatia chu a lo thi ta mai a. Tichuan, ka tlu bawkkhup a, aw ring takin ka au va, “A, Lalpa Pathian! Israel awm chhunte chimihna i siam dâwn em ni?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, i unaute, i chi leh kuangte ngei leh Israel chhûngte zawng zawng, an zain, Jerusalem luahtuten, ‘ Lalpa lak ata kal daih rawh u, he ram hi kan ta tûra pêk a ni tawh e,’ an tihate kha an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Hla takah hnamte zîngah ka sawn bo va, ram tam takah ka tidarh na a, rei lo te chhûngin an lo thlenna ramah chuan an tân hmun thianghlim ka ni ang,” ’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Hnam dangte lak ata chu ka hruai khâwm leh ang che u a, in darhna ram ata ka khâwm chhuak leh ang che u a, Israel ram chu ka pe ang che u.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chutah chuan an lo kal ang a, thil bawlhhlawh zawng zawng leh thil tenawm zawng zawngte chu chuta ta chu an la bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, thinlung hmun khat ka siamsak ang che u a, rilru thar ka pe ang che u. Tin, an tîsa ata thinlung sak chu ka la bo vang a, thinlung nêm an hnênah ka pe ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ka dân siamte an zawma, ka thuruatte an vawna, an tih theih nân. Tichuan, ka mite an ni ang a, kei pawh an Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An bawlhhlawhna leh an tenawmna rilru, thinlunga la zâwmte erawh chu, an sual mawh chu a bûrin ka khumtîr ang,” Lalpan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tichuan, cherub-ho chuan an thlate an zâr a, an kiangah chuan tawlailîr kête a awm a; tin, Israel-te Pathian ropuina chu an chungah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa ropuina chu khawpui lai aṭangin a chho va, khawpui chhak lampanga tlâng sângah chuan a han ding ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, thlarau chuan mi chawi kâng ta a, inlârnaah chuan Pathian thlarauvin Kaldai rama sal tângte hnênah chuan mi thlen a. Chutichuan, ka inlârna hmuh chuan mi chhohsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, sal tângteho hnênah chuan Lalpa thil mi entîr zawng zawng chu ka sawi ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hel hmang chhûng, hmuhna tûr mit neia hmu si lo, hriatna tûr beng neia hre si lo zîngah i awm a ni, hel hmang chhûng an ni rêng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvângin, nang mihring fapa, sal tânnaa kal tûr angin i bungruate têl fel la, chhûn êngah an mit hmuh ngeiah kal chhuak rawh; an hmuh ngeiah i hmun ata hmun dangah i kal chhuak tûr a ni. Hel hmang chhûng an ni na a, an inngaihtuah phah mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, i bungrua chu chhûn êngah an mit hmuh ngeiah sal tâng kal tûr bungraw lâkin i la chhuak ang a, nangmah ngei pawh an mit hmuhah ram danga thawn bo tûr kalin i kal tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An mit hmuh ngeiah kulh bang chu tipawp la, tah chuan la chhuak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An mit hmuh ngeiah i kovah i pu ang a, thimah i kal chhuak tûr a ni; lei i hmuh loh nân i hmai i khuh tûr a ni; Israel chhûngte tân entîr lâwknaah ka siam che a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, thu mi pêk ang chuan ka ti a; ka bungrua chu sal tâng tûr bungrua angin chhûn êngah ka la chhuak a, ka kutin bang chu tlaiah ka tipawp a, thimah ka la chhuak a, an mit hmuh ngeiah ka pu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, zîngah chuan Lalpa thu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûng, hel hmang chhûngte chuan i hnênah, ‘Eng nge i tih le?’ an ti che a ni lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “He thupuan hi Jerusalem hotute leh Israel chhûngkaw pum pui an awmna mite chung thu tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In tân entîr lâwkna ka nih hi. Ka tih ang tak hian an chungah tih a ni ang; thawn bovin, sal tâng tûrin an la kal ang,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, an zînga hotu awm chuan thim hnuaiah a kovin a pu ang a, a kal chhuak ang. An lâk chhuah nân bang chu an tipawp ang a, a mitin ram chu a hmuh tawh loh avângin a hmai a khuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amah chu ka lênin ka khuh ang a, ka thanga âwk a ni ang. Kaldai rama Babulon-ah chuan ka rawn hruai ang a, tah chuan a thi dâwn na a, hmuh chu a hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah pui tûra a kianga awm ṭhînte leh a vêngtute zawng zawng chu ram tinah ka tidarh ang a, khandaih phawiin ka ûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hnamte zînga ka hnawh darha, ram tina ka tihdarh hunah chuan Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, khandaih te, ṭâm te, hripui te lakah chuan mi tlêm tê ka zuah ang; chûngte chuan an lo kalna rama hnamte hnênah chuan an tenawmna zawng zawng chu an puan nân; tin, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, i chaw chu khûr hlawk hlawk chungin ei la, i tui chu manganga khûr chungin in rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, rama mite hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan, Jerusalem-a chêngte chungchângah leh Israel ram chungchângah chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “An chawte chu ren takin an ei ang a, an tui chu mangang takin an in ang a, a ram chu a chhûnga chêngte pâwngnêkna avângin a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng lakah chuan tihramin a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, mi chênna khawpuite chu a ram ang a, a ram chu thlalêrah a chang ang; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” ’ tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel rama he thufing tawi in neih hi eng tihna nge ni - ‘Nikhua a lo reiin inlârna apiang a thlâwn leh mai ṭhîn,’ in tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvângin, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “He thufing tawi hi ka tibâng ang a, Israel ramah thufing tawiah an hmang tawh ngai lo vang; ni chu a hnai tawh a, inlârna tin thlen dik ni tûr chu,” tiin an hnênah sawi zâwk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel chhûngte zîngah inlârna lothlâwn rêng rêng leh, ṭhumvâwr ṭha lama sawisak derna rêng rêng a awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka ni si a, ka sawi ang a, ka thusawi chu hlen nghâl a ni ang a, khêk a ni lo vang. Aw hel hmang chhûngte u, in dam lai ngei hian thu ka sawi dâwn a, ka hlen dâwn si a,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ngai rawh, Israel chhûngtea mi chuan, ‘Inlârna a hmuhte chu nakina mi tûr a ni a, a sawi lâwkte pawh hla taka mi tûr a ni,’ an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ka thu eng mah hi khêk a ni lo vang a, ka thusawi apiang chu hlenin a awm zêl zâwk ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,’ tiin hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel zâwlnei, mahni thinlung mai ata sawi hmangte chungah chuan thu sawi la, ‘ Lalpa thu chu ngai rawh u!’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Zawlnei â, mahni ngaih dân zuia eng mah hmu si lote chu an chung a pik e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Israel, i zâwlneite chu khaw ram sihal ang chauh an ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa nia indonaa ding zo tûrin a râlṭi lai in tâwn ngam lo va, Israel chhûngte humhalhnaah in ṭangkai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘ Lalpa thuchhuak a ni!’ titu chuan eng mah lo mai leh sawi lâwkna lem mai an chang a, Lalpa tirh an ni lo rêng rêng a ni; an thu chu ni ngei tûr angin mite an rintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inlârna lothlâwn mai in hmuin thu sawi lâwk dik lo in sawi a ni lâwm ni? ‘ Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,’ in la ti lehnghâl si a, kei chuan ka sawi tawp si lo va.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Eng mah lo mai in sawia, dâwt mai in hmuh avângin, ngai rawh u, ka dodâl che u a ni, tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ka kut hian eng mah lo hmutute leh dâwt sawi lâwktute a dodâl ang a, ka mite inrâwn khâwmnaah an tel lo vang a, Israel chhûngte hming ziaknaah ziakin an awm hek lo vang; tichuan, Lalpa Pathian chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Muanna awm si lova, ‘A muanawm e!’ tia ka mite an hruai bo avâng leh, mi bang siama hawlrivâp an hnawih mai avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hawlrivâp hnawihtute hnênah chuan, ‘A tla leh mai ang, ruahpui a lo sûr ang a, nangni rial lian puite u, in lo tla ang a, thli nasa takin a tichhia ang,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ngai rawh u, bang chu a chim hnu chuan, ‘In hawlrivâp hnawih chu khawiah nge?’ an ti dâwn lo che u em ni?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ka thinurin thlipui nasa takin ka tichhe vek ang, ka thinurin ruahpui a lo sûr ang a, ka thinurin rial nasa tak a tiral tûrin a lo tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, hawlrivâp in hnawih vâr bang kha ka tichim ang a, lei thlengin a sawp ang a; chutichuan, a lungphûmte pawh a lang hial ang; a chim ang a, bang chimah chuan tihboralin in awm ang; tichuan, Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hetiang hian bang chungah leh hawlrivâp hnawihtute chungah ka thinur ka hrithla ang; tin, ‘Bang chu a awm tawh lo va, a beltute pawh an awm tawh hek lo,’ ka la ti ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu chu Israel zâwlnei, Jerusalem chung thu sawia, muanna awm si lova muanna hmuhsaktute ngei kha, an awm ta lo,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, nang mihring fapa, i mite fanute, an thinlung maia sawitute chu hmachhawn la, anmahni kalhin thu sawi rawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Hmeichhia, mite bâna thil buntîr leh, mi nunnate man beh nâna mi lian mite lû khuhna ṭhuitute chu an chung a pik e! Mahni nunna tûrin ka mite nunna in man ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Barli tlêm tê leh chhang them hmu tûra thi lo tûr tithi tûr leh, nung lo tûr tinung tûrin in dâwt sawi ka miten an awih avângin, ka mite zîngah ka hming in tibawrhbâng a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, mi nunna sava anga man tûra in thil buntîrte chu ka hua a ni; in bânte chu ka pawt chhum vek ang a, in mi man tûrate nunna chu ka chhuah vek ang; sava anga in man tûrate nunna ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In lû khuhnate pawh chu ka pawt thlêr ang a, ka mite chu in kut ata ka chhuah ang a, in man theih tûrin in kutah an awm tawh lo vang; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka tihlungngaih ni lovin, mi fel thinlung chu dâwtin in tina a; mi suaksual chu nungdama a awmna tûra a sualna kawng ata a inlamlêt lohna tûrin a kut in tichak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />chuvângin, eng mah lo mai, thusawi lâwk dik lo emaw chu in hmu tawh rêng rêng lo vang; tin, ka mite chu in kut ata ka chhan chhuak ang a, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,” a ti,’ tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel upa ṭhenkhatte chu ka hnênah an lo kal a, ka hmaah an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hêng mite hian an milemte chu an thinlungah an la lût a, an hmaah an khawlohna tlûkna chu an dah a ni; kei mi râwn tûr an ni teh rêng em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, anmahni bia la, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Israel chhûngkuaa mi tin an thinlunga an milim la lûta, an hmaa an khawlohna tlûkna daha, zâwlnei hnêna lo kal apiang, kei Lalpa hian an milim tamzia ang zêlin ka chhâng ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel chhûngte chu an milim avânga min lo hransan tâk avângin an thinlung takah ka man theih nân.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Israel chhûngte hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Lo kîr ula, in milimte lakah chuan lo kîr ula, in tenawmna zawng zawng chu hawisan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel chhûng zînga mi tu pawh emaw, mikhual Israel rama chêng ve emaw, ka laka intihranga, an thinlunga milim la lûta, an hmaa khawlohna tlûkna dah chunga an chungchânga mi râwn tûra zâwlnei hnêna kal chu, kei Lalpa ngei hian ka chhâng mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu mi chu ka hmachhawn ang a, mi mak tih atân kumkhaw tlaitluana hrilhfâk tûrin ka mite zîng ata ka tibo daih ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, zâwlnei chuan buma awmin thu sawi sela, kei Lalpa hian zâwlnei chu ka bum a ni a, a chungah ka kut ka lek ang a, ka mi Israel-te zîng ata ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an khawlohna chu an phur ang; zâwlnei khawlohna chu amah râwntute khawlohna ang mai a ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel chhûngte chu ka laka an bo tawh lohva, an bawhchhiatnate zawng zawnga an intihbawlhhlawh tawh loh nân, ka mite an nih tawh zâwka, an Pathian ka nih theih nân,” Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni,’ tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ram miten bawhchhiatna thil tia, ka chunga thil tisuala, keiin ka kut ka leka, an chaw, nunna bul chu ka tihchhiata, an chunga ṭâm ka thlentîra, mi leh sate ka rawn tihbo chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hêng mi pathum - Nova, Daniela leh Joba-te meuh pawh hi lo awm ta ang sela, an felnain anmahni nunna chauh an chhan him ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ram sakawlhte an ram ka fan chhuahtîra, ram chu an tihchhiata, a lo ṭiauva, ramsa avânga tu mah kal tlang tûr an awm loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hêng mi pathumte hi awm mah sela, a nuna ka nun chhûng chu,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni, “An fanute, an fapate an chhan him chuang lo vang; anmahni chauh chu chhanhimin an awm ang a, ram chu a chhe tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A nih leh, chu ramah chuan khandaih ka rawn leka, ‘Khandaih, che rawh,’ ka tih chuan mi leh sa chu ka râwt bo a ni ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />hêng mi pathumte hi awm mah sela, a nuna ka nun chhûng chu,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni a, “An fanute, an fapate an chhan him chuang lo vang a, anmahni nunna chauh chhanhimin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A nih leh, chu ramah chuan hripui ka rawn lêntîra, mi leh sa tibo tûra thisen chhuaha ka thinurna chu ram chunga ka rawn leih chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nova, Daniela leh Joba-te meuh pawh hi lo awm mah sela, a nuna ka nun chhûng chu,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni, “An fanu emaw, an fapa emaw an chhanhim lo vang a, an felnain anmahni nunna ngei a chhanhim chauh vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Jerusalem chunga ka rorêlna na tak pali - khandaih te, ṭâm te, ramsa kawlh te, hripui te, mi leh sa râwt bo vek tûra ka rawn thlen kim hunah chuan engtia nasa tak ni ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, ngai teh, chutah chuan awm chhun hruai chhuah tûrte chu hnutchhiahin an awm ang a, fanute leh fapate pawh: ngai teh u, in hnênah an lo chhuak ang a, an awm dân leh an thiltihte in hmu ang a; tin, Jerusalem chunga thil ṭha lo ka rawn thlen thûah chuan thlamuanin in awm ang a, a chunga ka rawn thlen tâk zawng zawng thûah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An awm dân leh an thiltihte in hmuh hunah chuan an thlamuan ang che u; a chunga ka thiltih tâk zawng zawng chu tih chhan nei lovin ka ti lo tih in hria ang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ngaw hnuaia thing zînga grêp hrui chu Thing dang aiin eng nge a nih le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thing chu thilsiam nâna hman a ni em? Bungbêl târ nân pawh tuin nge hmang ngai le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai rawh, meiah paih luh a ni ṭhîn a, fawhkaian; Meiin a kâng ral, a hmâwr tuakah, A kâng zo mai ṭhîn, a laiah chuan. A nei rêng em ni, ṭangkaina?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, a ṭangkai lo, a him lai mahin; A va ṭangkai dâwn lo ve, a kan hnuin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan hetiang hian a ti: ‘Ramhnuai thing zînga grêp hruite, Fawhkai atân meiah ka tuah mai ang chuan, Jerusalem luahtute chu ka siam ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anmahni chu ka hmachhawn ang a, Chhuak teh mah sela, mei ata chu, A kâng zo tho vang e, meiah chuan. Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang, Anmahni ka hmachhawn hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tichhe ngei dâwn e, an ram chu, Khawlohna an tih tâk avângin,’ Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Jerusalem chu a tenawmnate hriat chhuahtîr la, a hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan Jerusalem hnênah chuan heti hian a ti a ni: I chhuahna ram leh i pianna ram chu Kanaan mite ram a ni a, i pa chu Amor mi a ni a, i nu chu Hit mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, i pianna thûah chuan i pian niin i laihrui ah a ni lo va, tifai tûr chein tuia bual i ni hek lo; chi hnawih i tâwk lo va, tuam lum i ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lainat tûr chea i chunga hêng hi ti tûrin tu mit mahin a khawngaih lo che a; tâmlakah paih chhuah i ni ta zâwk a, i pian ni ata kha lungten i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Tin, i kianga ka lo kalin thisena tâlin ka hmu chia, i hnênah chuan, “Thisenah awm mah la, nung rawh,” ka ti chia, a ni, ka ti che a ni, “Thisenah awm mah la, nung rawh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram thil kuhmûm angin ka tiṭhang lian chia; tin, i ṭhang lian a, khua i mawi ta; i hnute a lo um a, i sam a lo ṭha a; ruak leh saruak mai i la ni tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, i kianga ka lo kala ka en chein, ngaih la tham i lo ni ta a, ka puan ka zâwn chia, i saruak chu ka khuh tawh a che. A ni, i hnênah chhia ka chham a, thuthlungah ka luhpui ta chia, ka ta i ni ta e,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, tuiin ka bual tawh chia, a ni, i thisen chu ka sil faisak var chia, hriak ka hnawih ta che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puan cheiin ka thuam chia, savun ṭha mi pheikhawk ka buntîr chia, puanzaisînin ka tuam chia, maimaw puan ka khumtîr che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cheimawinain ka chei chia, i kutah bânbun te, i nghâwngah rangkachak khaidiat te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />i hnârah hnârvuah te, i bengah bengbeh te, i lûah lallukhum mawi tak tein ka chei chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, rangkachak leh tangkaruaa cheimawi i ni ta a, i silhfênte chu puan zai sîn tak leh maimaw puan leh puan ṭhui mawi a ni a; i ei chu chhangphut dip leh khawizû leh hriak a ni. I mawi êm mai, lalnu pawh i tling ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I mawina chu hnamte zîngah a thang chhuak a, ka ropuinaa thuamin i famkim ta,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mahse, i mawina chu i ring lutuk a, i hmingthanna chu i hur phah a, mi veivâk nazawng hnênah i hurna chu i tlângphal a, a tua pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I silhfênte hlîpin bâwlhmunte i cheimawi a, tah chuan i inphalrai a, hetiang hi a awm leh tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka rangkachak leh ka tangkaraw bungbêl mawi tak tak ka pêk che kha i la a, mipa lem siam nân i hmang a, i hurpui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I silhfên ṭhui mawite chu i la a, anmahni i tuam a, ka hriakte leh ka rimtuite chu an hmaah i hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka chhang pêk che pawh kha chhangphut ṭha leh hriak leh khawizû, ka châwmna ṭhinte che kha rimtui atân an hmaah i hlui a; heti hi a lo ni ta, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chu lovah pawh i fanu i fapa, mi hrinsakte chu an hnênah inthawi nâna hman ral atân i pe a. I hurna hi thil namên a ni em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka fate i that a, meipuia paih lûta an hnêna i hlante hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I tenawmna leh i hurna zawng zawngah chuan, i naupan laia saruaka i awm leh i thisena i tâl mai mai laite kha i hre ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, hêng i suahsualna zawng zawng hnuah pawh heti hi a lo ni a (‘I chung a pik e! A pik e!’ Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />hmun langsârte i insiam a, kawtthlêr tinah hmun sângte chu i tân i sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kawtthlêr lû apiangah hmun langsârte chu i sa a, i mawina chu tenawmnaah i siam a, veivâk apiang hnênah i inhlîm lang a, i hurna chu a zual ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aigupta mi, i ṭhenawm, mi râwva tak mai nên chuan inngaihna sual i ti ta bawk a; mi tithinur tûrin i hurna chu a tizual ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai rawh, i chungah ka kut ka lek a, i chaw pângngai chu ka tikiam a, nangmah hawtu Philistia fanu, i hur dân zahpui êm êm ṭhîntu hnênah chuan duh duha a tihah ka pe tawh che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Assuria mite hnênah pawh i hur bo va, tâwk tih lêm nei hek lo che; a ni, an hnênah i inphalrai a, i la kham chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kanaan ramah, Kaldai mite hnêna i hurna i la tizual ta cheu va, i la kham chuang lo fo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I thinlung chu a khawlo ta mang e - i chêtziaah hmeichhe luhlul sual tak mai thil i ti a, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kawtthlêr lû apianga chânna bûk i siamah te, kawtthlêr tina hmun langsâr i siamah te hian hlawh i ûm loh avângin nawhchizuar mai pawh i ni lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nupui uirê, pasalte aia mi hrante duh zâwktunu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nawhchizuar hnênah chuan thil an pe ṭhîn a, nang erawh chuan i pe zâwk ṭhîn - a duhtu che hnênah, ram tin ata an lo kala, an mutpui theih nân che i tlawn zâwk ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tin, i hur thûa tu mân an pan lo che hi mi hur dang laka i danglamna chu a ni; nangmahin a man i pe zâwk a, tu mahin man an pêk loh che hi i danglamna chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw mi hurnu, Lalpa thu chu ngai rawh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘I tenawmna leih chhuah a niha, i ngaihte nên in inpâwlna lama i saruakna tihlan a nih avâng leh, i tenawmna milim zawng zawng avâng leh, an hnêna i pêk i fate thisen avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />ngai rawh, nangmah ngaitu i nuamtâwlpuite zawng zawng leh, i lo ngaih tâk zawng zawngte leh i huat zâwng zawng zawngte chu ka ko khâwm ang; i vêlah ka hruai khâwm ang a, i saruakna zawng zawng an hmuh theih nân an hnênah i saruakna chu ka tilang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, hmeichhia, pasal ṭhena mahni fa thisen chhuah chung thu an rêl angin i chung thu ka rêl ang che; thinurna leh thîkna chu i chungah ka rawn thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An kutah ka pe ang chia, i hmun langsârte chu an titlu ang a, i hmun sângte an tisawp ang; i silhfênte an hlîp ang a, i lunghlute an chhuhsak ang chia, saruak leh ruakin an kalsan ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />‘I lakah vântlâng an pun ang a, lungin an dêng ang chia, khandaihin an chhun tlang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />I inte chu meiin an hâl ang a, hmeichhe tam tak mit hmuhah i chungah rorêlna an hlen ang; i hur hi ka tireh ang a, hlawh pawh i pe tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tichuan, ka thinurna i chungah ka hrithla zo vang a, ka thîkna che chu a reh tawh ang a, ka ngawi hle hle ang a, ka thinur tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />I tleirâwl lai nite chu i hriat reng lohva, hêng thilahte hian mi tihvui tâk zâwk avângin ngai rawh, i chêtzia ang angin i chungah ka thlen ang,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni; tin, i tenawmna zawng zawng belhchhahin he hurna hi i ti tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngai rawh, thufing tawi hmang apiangin he thufing tawi hi an hmang ang, ‘A fanuin a nu a chhûn,’ tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />I nu, mahni pasal leh fate lungtentu fanu kha i ni a, inlaizâwnna lamah chuan, mahni pasal leh fate lungtentute laizâwn i ni; i nu chu Hit mi a ni a, i pa lah Amor mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />I laizâwn, i u chu Samaria, i vei lama chêng ṭhîn kha amah leh a fanute nên an ni; i laizâwn, i nau lah chu, i ding lama chêng ṭhîn kha Sodom leh a fanute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Mahse, anmahni awm dân chu i zawh lo va, an tenawmna ang i ti lo na a, i awm dân zawng zawnga i khawloh zâwkzia ngaihtuahin chûng chu eng mah tham a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />A nuna ka nun chhûng chu,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni, “Nang leh i faten an tih ang hi i laizâwn Sodom leh a fanute pawhin an ti hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />I laizâwn Sodom khawlohna chu hêng hi a ni: chapona te, ei puar lutuk te, amah leh a fanute nuamtâwlna mai mai te a ni a, mi retheite leh tlachhamte chu a pui chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tin, mi chapo tak an ni a, ka hmaa thil tenawm ti tawh an ni; tichuan, ṭha ka tih angin ka tibo hlawm tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Samaria lah chuan i sual chanve pawh a ti lo; anmahni aia thil tenawm i tih nasat zâwk avângin i laizâwnte chu i tilang fel ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />I laizâwnte dik zâwka i lantîr avângin nang ngeiin i mualphona chu i phur tûr a ni; anmahni aiin thil tenawm nasa zâwk te i ti a, i sualnate avângin anni chu nang aiin an fel zâwk a ni; a ni, i laizâwnte fel zâwka i lantîrnaah hian nang chuan kimkîin mualphona i chang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Tin, an awm dân, Sodom leh a fanu awm dân te, Samaria leh a fanu awm dân te, anmahni rualin nangma awm dân ngei pawh ka let ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />an tân thlamuanna i lo nih ṭhinnaa i thiltih tâk zawng zawng avânga i zah theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Tin, i laizâwn, Sodom leh a fanute, Samaria leh a fanute chu an awm dân hmasa angin an awm leh ang a; nang leh i fanute pawh in awm dân hmasa angin in awm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />I suahsualna hmuh chhuah a nih hmaa i intihropui nîahte khân, i laizâwn Sodom chu i kamchhe tleuhna a ni ṭhîn lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Tûnah zawng Suria fanu leh a vêla mi zawng zawng, Philistia fanute i vêla tinawmnahtu che khân an sawi chhiat tâk vak che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />I hurna leh i tenawmna i pu zêl a ni,” tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Thuthlung bawhchhiain thutiam i pawisak lohzia ang zêlin i chungah ka ti ve dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Nimahsela, i naupan laia i hnêna ka thuthlung chu ka hre reng ang a, i hnênah kumkhaw thuthlung ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tichuan, i laizâwnte, i u leh i naute i pawm hunah chuan i awm dân te i lo hre chhuak ang a, i inzahpui ang; anni chu i fanu atân ka pe chia, i thuthlung avâng erawh chuan ni lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />I hnênah ka thuthlung ka tinghet ang a, Lalpa ka ni tih in hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />I thiltih zawng zawngte ka ngaihdam vek hunah che chuan, i hriat renga i zah avânga kimkia i kâ i ân ngai tawh loh nân,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte hnênah chuan thu kherkhiap siam chhuak la, tehkhin thuin sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni, ti rawh: “Mupui lian tak, thla hlai pui, thla ki sei tak, ṭial buai, hmul bit tak Lebanon tlângah a thlâwk a, sidar thing zîk a la a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a ṭang zîk no ber chu a thliak a, mi veivahna ramah a thlawhpui a, sumdâwnna khawpuiah chuan a phun ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi ram thlai chi chu a la bawk a, lei ṭhaah chuan a kui ṭiak a, tui tam tak kamah chuan a phun ta a, tuipuisuthlah angin a phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a ṭhang a, grêp hrui ṭawi tak a lo ni ta a; a zârte chu a lo zâm lêt a, a zungte chu a hnuaiah a awm a; tichuan, grêp kûng a lo ni a, pêngte a rawn chhuah a, a ṭang chu a lo chawr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘ “Mupui lian tak dang a awm bawk a, thla hlai pui leh hmul bit tak a nei ve a; tin, ngai rawh, he grêp kûng hi ama lamah khân a zung a zâm a; a phunna hmun aṭang khân ama lamah pêngte a chawr chhuak ta a, amah chu tuiin a châwm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pêngte a chhuaha, grêp ṭha tak a nih theih nân tui tam tak kama lei ṭhaa phun a ni.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘A puitling hlen dâwn em? A vuai mai theih nân a rahte sât thlain, a zung chawpin a pawt chhuak dâwn lâwm ni? A hnah chawr thar zawng zawng pawhin a vuai phah ang; a zung chawpa pawt chhuak tûrin thiltihtheihna nasa tak emaw, mipui tam tak emaw a ngai chuang dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni, ngai rawh, phun mah ni sela, a puitling hlen dâwn em ni? Khawchhak thlîin a rawn nuai hunah chuan a vuai zo mai dâwn lâwm ni? A ṭona hmun ngeiah chuan a vuai mai ang,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hel hmang chhûngte hnênah chuan sawi rawh: he thil awmzia hi an hre lo vem ni? Hrilh rawh, ‘Ngai rawh u, Babulon lal chu Jerusalem-ah a lo kal a, an lal leh hotute chu a man a, ama hnênah Babulon-ah a hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />an lal thlah pakhat a man a, thuthlung a siampui a, thu a tiam luihtîr a, rama mi liante chu a hruai bo vek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a lalna ram a tlâwma, amaha a din chhuah theih tawh loh nân, a thuthlung vuan chung chauhva a din theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahse, sakawrte leh mi tam tak rawn tîr tûra dîl tûrin Aigupta ramah palai tîrin a chungah a hel ta a. A hlawhtling ang em? Chutiang titu chu a inchhan chhuak ang em? Thuthlung chu bawhchhe siin a chhuak tho vang em?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nuna ka nun chhûng chu,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni; ‘Lalber, lala siamtu chênna ngeiah chuan - a chhechhamte hmusit leha, a thuthlungte bawhchhetu chu, ama hnên ngeiah Babulon-ah chuan a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Indonaa mi tam tak tihhlum tûra mual pâwngte leh kulhte an siam hunah pawh, Pharaoa sipai rual leh pâwl ropui tak pawhin eng mah an tihsak thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuthlung bawhchhiain chhechham chu an hmusit ta si a; thu a intiam hnuah hêng thil zawng zawng hi a ti leh ta si a le, a chhuak awzâwng lo vang.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ka chhechham a hmusit a, ka thuthlung a bawhchhia a, a nuna ka nun chhûng chu, ama chungah ka ṭuan ngei ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lênin ka khuh ang a, ka thangah chuan a âwk ang a, Babulon-ah ka rawn hruai ang a, tah chuan a bawhchhiatna, ka chung ngeia a bawhchhiatnate avâng chuan amah ka bei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, a pâwl zawng zawnga tlânchheho zawng zawng chu khandaihin an thi ang a, a la bângte chu kâwlkil tinah an darh ang; tin, kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh tih in hre chhuak ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Sidar sâng tak zîk chu kei hian ka la ang a, ka phun ang; A ziding bera zîk no chu ka thliak ang a, Tlâng sâng langsâr takah ka phun ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israel sânna tlângah chuan ka phun ang a, Zârte a rawn chhuah ang a, a lo rah ang a, Sidar ropui tak a ni ang; A hnuaiah chuan chunglêng sava chi tinrêng an chêng ang a. A zâr hlimah te chuan an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ram thing zawng zawngte chuan, Kei Lalpa hian thing sângte ka tihniam a, Thing hniamte chu ka tisâng a, Thing hringte ka tiro va, Thing rote ka tiduah a ni, tih an hria ang; Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh a, ka ti tawh bawk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel ram chungchângah he thufing tawi an hman hi eng tihna nge, ‘Paten grêp thûr an ei a, an fate ha a ṭim e,’ tih hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nuna ka nun chhûng chu, Israel-ah he thufing tawi hi hman leh tih in nei tawh lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ngai rawh u, nunna zawng zawng ka ta vek a ni, pa nunna ka ta a ni ang bawkin fapa nunna pawh ka ta a ni; thil tisualtu apiang an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mahse, mi chu a fela, thiang leh dik chauh a tiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />bâwlhmunahte ei lova, Israel chhûngte milim lam hawi hek lova, a ṭhenawm nupui chunga thil tenawm ti hek lova, hmeichhe fel lo lai hnaih hek lova,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tu ma chunga thil tisual lova, leibatu thil dahkham pe kîr zâwka, tu mah rawk lova, riltâm hnêna ei tûr pea, saruak puan silhtîra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a pung ûm tûra pûktîr lova, a pung pawh la hek lova, thil sual ti tûra a kut sûma, mi leh mi inkâra rorêlna dik taka titlua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ka dân siamte zawha, dik taka tia, ka rorêlnate a vawn chuan - mi fel a ni a, a nung ngei ang!” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Mahse, fapa rûk hmang a hrina, thisen chhuahtu a niha, hetiang rêng rêng hi a tiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a tih tûr zâwk chu a tih lohva, bâwlhmunahte a ei zâwka, a ṭhenawm nupui a tihbawrhbâna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />rethei leh tlachhamte a tihduhdaha, a rawka, a dahkham a pêk kîr lohva, milimte lam a hawia, thil tenawm a tiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a pung ûma a pêka, a pung a lâk bawk chuan - a nung ang em? A nung tawp lo vang! Hêng thil tenawm zawng zawng hi a ti miau si a, a thi ngei ngei ang, ama thisen mawh chu a phur tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ngai rawh, fapa lo hring ve sela, a pa thil sual tih tawh zawng zawng kha a hmuha, a hlauhva, chutiang a tih ve lohva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />bâwlhmuna a ei lohva, Israel chhûngte milim lam hawi lova, a ṭhenawm nupui a tihbawrhbân lohva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tu ma chunga thil a tihsual lohva, dahkham eng mah la lova, tu mah rawk lova, riltâmte ei tûr pe zâwka, saruakte puan a silhtîra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />rethei laka a kut a sûma, a no leh a pung la lova, ka thupêkte hmanga ka dân siamte zawhtu a nih chuan, a pa khawlohna avângin a thi lo vang a, a nung ngei zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A pa erawh zawng râwng taka mi a hnehchhiaha, a unaupa rawkrâla beia, a mite zînga thil ṭha lo chu a tih avângin, ngai rawh, a khawlohna avângin a thi tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mahse, ‘Engah nge fapa chuan a pa khawlohna a tuar loh vang?’ in ti ṭhîn. Fapa chuan dân chu zâwma thil fel a tiha, ka dân siamte zawng zawng chu a vawna, a tih bawk chuan a nung ngei tûr alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil tisualtu chu a thi tûr a ni. Fapa chuan a pa khawlohna chu a tuar lo vang a, pa pawhin fapa khawlohna chu a tuar hek lo vang; mi fel felna chu amahin a têl ang a, mi sual sualna chu amahin a phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi sual chuan a thil sual tih zawng zawngte a hawisana, ka dân siamte a vawna, dân chu zâwma thil fel a tih chuan a nung ngei ang, a thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawhchhiatna a lo tih tawh rêng rêng kha chu hriatsak reng a ni tawh lo vang; a lo tih tawh a felna avângin a nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi sual thihnaah hian lâwmna rêng ka nei em ni? A kawngte chu a hawisana, a nunna zâwk lo chu?” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi fel chuan a felna kawng a hawisana, khawlohnate a tiha, mi sualte tih ang zêla thil tenawmte a tihin a nung dâwn em ni? A thil fel tih eng mah kha hriat reng a ni tawh lo vang a, a bawhchhiatna a bawhchhiatah leh thil sual a tihnaah khân, chumi ngeiah chuan a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mahse, ‘Lalpa tih dân hi a inang fo lo ve,’ in ti ṭhîn a. Israel chhûngte u, ngai rawh u khai, ka tih dân a inang fo lo vem ni? In tih dân chu a inang lo fo zâwk a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi fel chuan a felnate a hawisana, khawlohnate a tih chuan, tah chuan a thi ang a, khawlohna a tihah chuan a thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu, mi sualin a sualna a lo tih tawhte chu a hawisana, dân chu a zawma, thil fel a tih chuan a nunna a chhanhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A inngaihtuaha, a bawhchhiatna a lo tih tawh zawng zawng chu a hawisan avângin a nung ngei ang, a thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mahse, Israel chhûngte chuan, ‘Lalpa tih dân chu a inang fo lo ve,’ an ti a. Aw Israel chhûngte u, ka tih dânte hi a inang fo a ni zâwk lâwm ni? Nangni tih dânte erawh chu a inang lo fo zâwk a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Israel chhûngte u, mi tin, nangmahni tih dân ang zêlin ro ka rêl ang che u,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni. “Inlamlêt ula, in bawhchhiatna zawng zawngte chu hawisan rawh u; tichuan, khawlohna chu in tlûkchhiatna a ni dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In bawhchhiatna zawng zawng, in lo bawhchhiat tawhte chu paih bo vek ula, thinlung thar leh rilru thar insiam rawh u. Engah nge in thih ang le, aw Israel chhûngte u?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mî thihnaah chuan lâwmna ka nei hauh si lo va,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni. “Chuvângin, inlamlêt ula, nung rawh u.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Chu lovah pawh chuan Israel hotute chungchângah sûnna hla phuah la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I nu eng nge a nih le? Sakeibakneipui a ni; A no a châwm a, a bawk, sakeibaknei vânglaite zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A châwm tlei e, a no pakhat, sakeibaknei vânglai a lo ni ta e; A lo thiam e, sa seh, mihring a hmang chhûnrâwlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hnamten hriain, an dang thla e - an khur thûkah; Thîr kawl an bun, Aigupta ram an thlen e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A chûninun a nghâk thlâwn, bei lo dawng e; A siam leh e, a hraichawi dang, sakeibaknei vânglaian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lêng vêl e, sakeibakneite zîngah, Sakeibaknei vânglai a lo ni ta e; A lo thiam e, sa seh, mihring a hmang chhûnrâwlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A hrâwng vêl a, lal inte, khawpui a tiram e; A râwl lian vângin a chhe zo, ram leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hnam tin khuavêl lo pungin an bei chiam a, Lên hrui an zâr, an dang thla e, an khur thûkah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thîr kawl bunin bâwmah an khung, Babulon lal an hlân e. An rawn thlen ta kulhpui chhûngah, A thâwm daih nân - Israel tlâng lianah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I chûninun grêp huana tui châwm grêp a iang e, Siktui thiang châwm, rah ṭha chhuak a zâr luai e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A lal tiangah a ṭang zâr khauh lo chhuakin, Zâr dang zawng laiah a sâng ber a, A bukpui khûmin a chung lûr e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mahse, an thliak, thinlai rimin, An paih, chhimhlei tualah, Chhaktiang thlîin a nuai, a ṭîl, a rahte, A zâr khauh pawh a tliak thla, a uai zo ta, Senmeiin kâng ral ta e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kûngpui zawng an phun ta, thlalêr ram tui lovah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zâr ata senmei lo chhuakin a man e, A rahte zawng pawh a ei zo ta; Tichuan, zâr lêm a awm tawh lo, lal tiang tûrah pawh.” Hei hi sûnna hla a ni e, sûn nâna hman tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum sarihna, thla ngana, chumi thla ni sawm nîah chuan Israel upa tute emaw Lalpa râwn tûrin an lo kal a, ka hmaah an ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel upate chu bia la, an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Mi râwn tûra lo kal em in nih? A nuna ka nun chhûng chu, nangni râwnin ka awm lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I chachhuah dâwn lâwm ni? Mihring fapa, chachhuah ta che. An pate tenawmnate chu hriattîr rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Israel-ho ka thlan nia Jakoba chhûng ka thlante hnênah kut phar meuhva Aigupta rama an hnêna ka inhriattîra, an hnêna ka kut ka phara, “Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian chu ka ni e,” tia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chûng nia Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaka, an tâna ka ram hual, hnute tui leh khawizua luang ram, ram zawng zawnga mawi bera hruai lût tûra ka kut ka phar nîah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />an hnênah, “Mi tinin in mita hmuh thil tenawm chu paih bo ula, Aigupta rama milimte chuan intibawlhhlawh suh u, kei hi Lalpa in Pathian chu ka ni e,” tiin ka sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mahse, ka chungah an hel a, min ngaihsak rêng rêng lo va, mi tinin an mita hmuh thil tenawmte pawh chu an paih bo lo va, Aigupta milimte chu an hawisan hek lo. Tah chuan an chunga ka thinurna hrithla tûrin, Aigupta ram chhûngah ngei chuan ka thinurna ka leih nâng emaw, ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mahse, keima hming humhalh nân ka bei ta zâwk a, an awmna hnamte mit hmuhah Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuakin an hnênah ka inhriattîr a, chûng hnamte mit hmuhah chuan ka hming sawichhiata a awm loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, Aigupta ram chhuahsan tûrin ka ti a, thlalêrah ka hruai lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, ka dân siamte chu anmahni ka pe a, ka thurêlte chu ka entîr a, chu chu miin an zawm chuan an nunna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu bâkah, kei leh anmahni inkâra chhinchhiah nân ka Chawlhnite chu anmahni ka pe bawk a, kei hi Lalpa , anmahni serh hrangtu ka ni tih an hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mahse, Israel chhûngte chu thlalêrah khân ka chungah an hel a, ka dân siamte chu an zawh lo va, ka thurêlte miin a tiha a nunna tûr chu an paih thla a, ka Chawlhnite pawh nasa takin an bawhchhia a; tichuan, thlalêrah chuan anmahni tiboral tûrin ka thinrimna chu an chungah ka leih nâng emaw, ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hruai chhuah lai hretute hnam ngei mit hmuhah tihchhiata a awm loh nân, ka hming humhalhin ka bei ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, thlalêrah khân ka ram pêk, hnute tui leh khawizua luang ram, ram zawng zawnga mawi berah chuan ka hruai lût lo vang, bân phar meuhvin ka ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ka thurêlte an paih thlâ a, ka dân siamte an zawh lohva, ka Chawlhnite an bawhchhiat avângin; an thinlung chuan an milimte a âwn tlat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, tiboral lo tûrin ka mitin a hmuh hmaih ta a, thlalêrah pawh khân ka tiboral vek ta lo mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, thlalêrah chuan an fate hnênah, “In pate dân siam chu zâwm lo ula, an thurêlte zâwm lo ula, an milimte chuan intibawrhbâng hek suh u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kei hi Lalpa in Pathian chu ka ni a, ka dân siamte zawh ula, ka thurêlte vawng ula, zâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka Chawlhnite serh ula, kei leh nangni inkâra chhinchhiahna a ni ang a, Lalpa in Pathian chu ka ni tih in hriat theihna a ni dâwn nia,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahse, an fate chu ka chungah an hel a, ka dân siamte chu an zawh lo va, ka thurêlte, miin a tiha a nunna tûr chu, zâwm tûrin an vawng hek lo; ka Chawlhnite chu an bawhchhe ta a; thlalêrah khân ka thinurna hrithla tûrin an chungah ka thinrimna ka leih nâng emaw, ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mahse, ka kut ka sûm a, ka hruai chhuah lai hretute hnam ngei mit hmuha tihchhiata an awm loh nân, ka hming humhalhin ka bei ta zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu, hnamte zîngah anmahni ka tidarh ang a, ram tinah ka tiṭaiṭâm ang, thlalêrah khân kut phar meuhvin ka lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka thurêlte an zawm lohva, ka dân siamte an paihthlâka, ka Chawlhnite an bawhchhiata, an pate milim lam an hawi zâwk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chu lo pawh, dân siam ṭha lo chu ka pe a, an nun lohna tûra thurêlte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />an thil dawn, chhûl keutu zawng zawng meia an paihnaah chuan anmahni ka tibawlhhlawh a, ka tikhawhar a, a tâwpah Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hriatna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, mihring fapa, Israel-ho hnênah thu sawi la, an hnênah, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: In pate chuan hêngah hian mi la sawi chhe cheu a ni; ka chunga bawhchhiatna thil an tihahte hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kut phar meuhva anmahni ka tiam ramah hian ka rawn hruai luhin, tlâng sâng leh thing buk lian an hmuh apiangah an inthawinate an hlân a, an thilhlan thinurthlâk tak maite chu an pe a. An rimtuite an siam a, an in tûr thilhlante chu an bun chhuak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tichuan, keiin an hnênah, “Bâwlhmun in kal fonate hi eng in tihna nge ni?” ka ti a; chutichuan, a hming atân vawiin thleng hian Bama tih a ni ta e,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel chhûngte hnênah chuan sawi la, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “In pate ang zêlin mahni in intibawlhhlawhin an tenawmna kawngahte chuan in hur bo a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In thil dawn in hlanin, in fate meiah in paih a, vawiin thleng hian in milim zawng zawng chuan in intibawlhhlawh a ni lâwm ni? Nangni râwn tûr em ka nih, aw Israel chhûngte u? A nuna ka nun chhûng chu nangni râwnin ka awm lo vang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kan vêla hnam dang awze mite anga thingbul lungbul be tûr kan ni, in rilruin in ti na a, in ni tawp lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“A nuna ka nun chhûng chu, kut thahrui chak takin, bân phar chung leh thinrim chhuahin in chungah ka lal ngei ngei ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Hnamte zîng ata ka hruai chhuak ang che u a, tihdarha in awmna ram ata chu kut chak tak leh bân phar leh thinrim chhuahin ka hruai khâwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Awze mite thlalêr ramah chuan ka hruai lût ang che u a, inhmachhawnin kan inbei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Aigupta ram thlalêra in pate ka beih ang takin nangni pawh ka bei ang che u,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />“Tin, tiang hnuaiah ka luhtîr ang che u a, thuthlung khuahkhirhna hnuaiah ka hruai lût ang che u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />tin, in zîng ata mi helte leh ka chunga bawhchhetute chu ka thian fai ang a, an awmna ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak ang a; mahse, Israel ramah chuan an lût tawp lo vang. Tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Nangni pawhin, aw Israel chhûngte u,” Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ka thu in ngaihthlâk dâwn loh chuan tûn hnuah pawh in milim rawng chu bâwl ṭheuh mai ta che u; mahse, ka hming thianghlim chu in thilpêkte leh in milimtein in tibawlhhlawh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka tlâng thianghlim, Israel sânna tlângah chuan, tah chuan Israel chhûngte zawng zawng chuan an zavaiin, chu ramah chuan ka rawng an bâwl ang; tah chuan anmahni ka lâwm tawh ang a, tah chuan in thilhlante, in thilpêk ṭha ṭhate, in thil serh zawng zawngte ka duh tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hnamte zîng ata ka lâk chhuah hun che u leh, ram tina in darhna ata ka hruai khâwm hunah che u chuan, rimtui atân ka pawm tawh ang che u a, hnamte mit hmuhah chuan nangmahniah hian ka thianghlimzia a lang tawh ang,” Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tin, Israel ram, kut phar meuhva in pate pêk ka tiam ramah ka hruai luh hunah che u chuan Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, tah chuan in awm dânte leh in thiltih, in intihbawlhhlawhna zawng zawngte chu in hre tawh ang a; tichuan, in thil ṭha lo tih zawng zawngte avâng khân nangmahni mit hmuh ngeiah in inten tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, in awm dân ṭha lote ang ni lova, in thiltih khawlote ang ni hek lova, ka hming humhalh tûra ka tihpuitlin che u hunah chuan, aw Israel chhûngte u, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hre tawh ang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, chhim lam hmachhawn la, chhim lam hawiin i thu thlah la, chhim lam ngawpui lamah thu sawi la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />chhim lam ngawpui hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa thu hi ngai rawh, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh, nangmahah mei ka chhêm ang a, nangmaha thing hring zawng zawng chu a kâng zo vang a, thing ro apiang pawh; mei alh hluah hluah chu a rêm lo vang a, chhim aṭanga hmâr thlengin, eptu zawng zawngte chu a ût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawngin kei Lalpa hi mei chhuahtu ka ni tih an hmu ang a, a mit lo vang,” a ti e,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tichuan, kei chuan, “A! Lalpa Pathian, ‘Tehkhin thu sawitu mai alâwm,’ mi ti ang asin,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Jerusalem hmachhawn la, a hmun serhte lam hawiin i thu thlah la, Israel ram chungah thu sawi ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel ram hnênah chuan, ‘Heti hian Lalpa chuan a ti a ni: “Ngai teh, ka do che a ni, ka khandaih chu a pai ata ka phawi ang a, in zînga mi fel leh fel lo angkhatin ka râwt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, in zînga mi fel leh fel lo ka râwt dâwn avâng chuan ka khandaih chu a pai ata a chhuak ang a, chhim lam ata hmâr lam thlengin mihring zawng zawng a râwt ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawngin, kei Lalpa hian ka khandaih a pai ata ka phawi a ni tih an hria ang a, a inkhung leh tawh ngai lo vang.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, nang mihring fapa, rûm vawng vawng la, lungchhe takin an mit hmuhah rûm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ‘Engati nge i rûm?’ an tih che chuan, ‘Thu eng emaw avângin a lo thleng dâwn si a; tin, thinlung tinrêng a tuiral ang a, kut zawng zawng a zâwi ang a, rilru tinrêng a chau vang a, khûp zawng zawng chu tui angin a zâwi ang a, ngai rawh, a lo thleng e, a hlen ang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, thu sawi la, ‘Hetiang hian Lalpa chuan a ti a ni: Khandaih, khandaih, tah hriam a ni ta a, Tihtlêt a ni ta!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi sah nân tah hriam a ni ta, Tihtlêt a ni, kâwlphe angin! Kan la hlim cheu dâwn em ni? Ka faa tiangin a chhîng zo ve, thing tin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tihtlêt a ni, vai vêl atân, A ni, khandaih tah hriam tihtlêt a ni, Thattu kuta chuang tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihring fapa, ṭap la, chiau vawng vawng rawh, ka mite chunga thleng tûr a ni si; Israel mi lian zawng zawng chungah ngei chuan. Pêk an ni e, ka mite nên, chemsen hnuaiah; Chuvângin, mangang rawh, i mal bêngin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Fiahna a awm si a, engtin nge ni ang - Mi dang chhîngtu tiang chu awm suh sela?’ ” Tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Chuvângin, nang, mihring fapa, kut bêng hialin thu sawi rawh; Thih theihna chemsen lên zual la, a lêt thumin, A hual vêl e, mi ropui, thahna chemsen chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thinlung tuiral, an tlûkna a pun nân e, Chemsen tle tak kawngka tinah ka riah e, A! Kâwlphe iangin a tlê, thihna chemsen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Invilikin che vak ang che, ding lamah, Invilikin vei lamah pawh vai zêl la, I hma zâwn apiangah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei pawhin kut ka lo bêng ang a, Ka hlen ngei ang, ka thinurna, Kei Lalpan hei hi ka sawi tawh e, a ti, ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Babulon lal khandaih lo thlen theihna tûrin kawng pahnih lo siam rawh; chûng kawng hnihte chu ram pakhat aṭangin a lo chhuak tûr a ni. Kawng kawhhmuhna siam la, khawpui luhna kawtchhuahah chuan siam rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kawng chu Amon mite khua Raba-a khandaih lo thlenna tûrin ruat la, Judai ram laia Jerusalem kulhah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aien tûrin Babulon lal chu kawng pêngah chuan a ding a, kawng hnih infinna takah chuan; thalte chu a thing rawk rawk a, teraphim a râwn a, sa thin chu a en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A aiennaah chuan a kut ding lamah Jerusalem a lo chuang ta a, kulh sut chhiatna te, râl bei hawhawa au te, kawngka zâwna kulh sut chhiatna te, mual pâwng chhûn te, kulh siamte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aien thlâwn mai ang a ni a; mahse, mana an awmna tûra an khawlohna hriat chhuahna tûr chauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘In khawlohna hriat rengna tûra in siam tâk avângin in bawhchhiatnate a lang a; tichuan, in thiltih zawng zawngah in sualnate a lang reng a, hriat chhuah in lo nih tâk avângin kuta man in la ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, nang Israel hotu, mi sual thi tûra hliam pa, i sualna hremna tâwpkhâwk nî a lo thleng e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Hotu lukhum chu paihsak ula, lallukhum chu paihsak rawh u; hei hi a ngaiin a awm lo vang. Mi tlâwmte chawisâng ula, mi liante chu titlâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka letling ang, ka letling ang, ka letling ang. Hei pawh hi a ngaiin a awm lo vang, a neitu tak tûr a lo kal hma zawng amah chu ka pe ang.” ’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tin, nang mihring fapa, thu hril la, heti hian ti rawh: ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan Amon fate chungchângah leh an sawichhiatna thûah heti hian a ti: “Khandaih, khandaih phawi a ni ta, mi thah nân leh tihral nân kâwlphe anga tihtlêt a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Inlârna der an hmuhsak chia, dâwtin ai an ensak chia, khandaih chu mi sual thi tûra hliam, an sualna ni tâwpkhâwk lo thleng tûrte nghâwngah i rawlh dâwn, an tihah che hian an daw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A paiah khung rawh, i pian i mûrna ram ngeiah i thu ka rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />I chungah ka thinurna ka leih ang a, ka thinrimna mei i chungah ka chhêm ang, mi nun chhe tak, tihboral thiam tak kutah ka mantîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Meia tuah tûr i ni ang a, ram laiah chuan i thisen a bua ang a, hriat reng i ni tawh lo vang, kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh si a,” a ti,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tin, nang, mihring fapa, thisen chhuah hmang khawpui chu i khing dâwn em? I khing dâwn em? A tenawmna zawng zawng chu hriattîr rawh khai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Khawpui, a hun lo thlenna tûra ama chhûnga thisen chhuahtu leh, mahni intibawlhhlawh tûra milim siamtu chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I thisen chhuahnaah khân thiam loh i phur a, i milim siamah khân i intibawlhhlawh a ni; i hunte i tihnai a, i kumte a thleng ṭêp a; chuvângin, hnamte hnênah chuan sawichhiatah leh ram zawng zawng chêksawlh atân ka siam che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I bula mi leh i hlata mite chuan an chêksawlh ang che, nang, hmingchhiat phur leh buainaa khat mi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai rawh, Israel hotute mi tinin an thiltihtheihna ang zêla thisen chhuah mai tûrin mangmahah an awm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmahah chuan miin nu leh pate an hmusit a, nangmahah chuan mikhualte an hnehchhiah a, nangmahah chuan fahrahte leh hmeithaite an hnuaichhiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thil serhte i hmusit a, ka Chawlhnite i bawhchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangmahah chuan thisen chhuah tûra mi hêk hmangte an awm a, nangmahah chuan bâwlhmuna eite an awm a, nangmahah chuan hurna an chîng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmahah chuan an pate saruakna hlîmsak an awm a, nangmahah chuan hmeichhe fel lo lai mutpui an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, miin a ṭhenawm nupui chungah thil tenawm a ti a, mi dangin hur takin a mo a tibawlhhlawh a, mi dangin nangmahah chuan a farnu, a pa fanu ngei a tlâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmahah chuan thisen chhuah tûrin thamna an la a, a no leh a pung i la a; i ṭhenawm chu hnehchhiahin duhâm takin i hlêprûksak ṭhîn a; kei ngei pawh hi mi theihnghilh a, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, ngai rawh, i lo hlêprûkna thûah te, nangmaha thisen chhuak thûah te kut ka ben khum ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah ka beih nîah che chuan i thinlungin a tuar zovin i kut a chak thei dâwn em ni? Kei Lalpa ngei hian ka sawi tawh a, ka ti bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, hnam tin zîngah chuan ka tidarh ang chia, ram tinah ka tiṭaiṭâm ang che; nangmah aṭangin i bawlhhlawhnate ka tiral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hnamte mit hmuhah chuan mahni intibawlhhlawh i ni ang; tin, Lalpa chu ka ni tih i lo hria ang, a ti, ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte chu ka tân êkchhia mai an lo ni ta a; an zain rawh tuina mei laiah chuan dâr te, rângva te, thîr te, suan te an ni a, tangkaraw êkchhia mai a ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ekchhia mai in lo nih tâk avângin, ngai rawh u, Jerusalem laiah ka khâwm che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tangkarua te, dâr te, thîr te, suan te, rângva te rawh tuina meia an dah khâwma, titui tûra a chunga mei an chhêm angin ka thinurna leh ka thinrimnaah chuan ka khâwm ang che u a, tah chuan ka dah ang che u a, ka titui ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ni, ka khâwm ang che u a, in chungah ka thinurna mei ka chhêm ang a, a laiah chuan in tui zo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rawh tuina mei laiah tangkarua a tui angin nangni pawh, chumi laiah chuan in tui zo vang a, kei Lalpa hian in chungah ka thinurna ka leih a ni tih in hre tawh ang,’ ” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, a hnênah chuan sawi la, ‘Ram tlen fai loh i ni e, thinurna nia ruahtui chang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sakeibakneiin rûmin a sa seh a zawng ang maiin nangmahah chuan zâwlnei phiarnate a awm a ni; mi nunnate an ei zo va, rote leh thil hlute an lâksak a, a laiah chuan hmeithai tam tak an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A puithiamte pawhin nasa takin ka dân an bawhchhia a, ka thil serhte an tibawlhhlawh a ni, thil serh leh thil narân rêng rêng an thlei lo va, mite lah thil thianghlim leh thianghlim lo an thleitîr chuang hek lo; ka Chawlhnite chu an haider a, chuvâng chuan, an zîngah chuan tihhmingchhiatin ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A laia hotute chu chinghne koham ei tûr zawng ang mai an ni a, thisen chhuaha mi nunnate tiboralin hlemhle taka an hlêp theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, a zâwlneite chuan hawlrivâpin bang an bel a, inlârna dawha mai mai an hmu a, dâwtin ai an ensak a, Lalpan eng mah a sawi lo chung pawhin, “ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti,” an ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rama mipuite chuan hnehchhiah an hmang a, rawk an chîng a, a ni, mi rethei leh tlachhamte chu an hnuaichhiah a, dik lo takin mikhualte an hnehchhiah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ram chu ka tihchhiat loh nân an zîng ata dai theu tûr leh, ram chhana ka hmaa ṭang tûr mi ka zawng a, ka hmu si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chuvângin, an chungah ka thinrimna chu ka leihbaw ta a, ka thinurnain meiin ka hâl ral ta hlawm a ni; an awm dân ngei chu an chungah ka rawn thlen a ni, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, hmeichhe pahnih, nu pakhat fa an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aigupta ramah an hur bo va, an tleirâwl têta hur an ni a; chutah chuan an hnute an dek a, an tleirâwl hnute chu an hmehsak hrep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pakhat a upa zâwk hming chu Oholai a ni a, a laizâwn chu Oholibai a ni a; ka ta an lo ni ta a, fapate, fanute an hring a. Tin, an hmingah chuan Oholai chu Samaria a ni a, Oholibai chu Jerusalem a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Oholai chu ka ta a nih hnuin a hur bo leh ta a, a ngaihzâwng, a ṭhenawm, Assuria chu a hak hiam a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />awptute, rorêltute, tlangvâl îtawm tak hlîr, sakawr chung chuang mi, puan sen duka inthuamte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hêng Assuria tlangvâl ṭhate zawng zawng lakah hian an inphalrai a; tin, a hak hiamate milim zawng zawng chuan a intibawlhhlawh leh ta nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tleirâwl têt ata a hnutê an dehsak ṭhin leh, an mutpui ṭhin avângin Aigupta aṭang khân a hur a bâng chuang hek lo, anni pawhin an hurna chu a chungah an tlingtla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ngaihzâwngte, Assuria, a hak hiamte kut ngeiah ka mantîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêngte hian a saruakna chu an hlîm lansak a, a fanu leh a fapate an lâksak a, ani pawh chu khandaihin an that a, hmeichhiate zîngah insawiṭhaihna ber a lo ni ta, a chunga rêl ang chu an hlen ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, a laizâwn Oholibai chuan hei hi a hmu a; mahse, a u ai mahin a ngaihzâwng haknaah chuan a zual zâwkin, a hurna pawh chu a u hurna aiin a zual sauh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Assuria mi, a ṭhenawm ram awptu leh rorêltu tlangvâl îtawm tak hlîr, sakawr chung chuang mi, mawi taka incheite chu a hak hiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tihbawlhhlawhin a awm tih ka hmu a, an pahnihin kawng thuhmun an zawh mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a hurnate chu a tizualkai a, mipa lem banga chuang, Kaldai mite thla, sen lâr taka chei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a kâwnga kâwnghrên hrêng, diar mawi tak khim, an vaia lal hmêl pu tak, Kaldai ram, an pianna rama Babulon mite ang takte chu a hmuh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, anmahni a hmuh veleh a hak hiam a, an hnênah Kaldai thlengin mi a tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Babulon mite chu a hnênah, inngaihna khumah an lo kal a, an hurnain an tibawlhhlawh a, an intitenawm zo ta a, anmahni chu a ngei êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, a hurna a tilang a, a saruak a hlîm lang a, a laizâwnnuin mi ngei ang maiin ani pawh chuan mi ngei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mahse, a tleirâwl laia Aigupta rama a hur lai a hriat reng avângin a hur zual ta deuh deuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, a uirêtu, a tîsa sabengtung tîsa ang mai, a thil chhuak sakawrte thil chhuak ang mai chu a hak êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hetiang hian i tleirâwl lai hurna, Aigupta miten i tleirâwl lai hnutê an dehsak hrep lai che kha i hre chhuak leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Oholiba, hetiang hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: ‘Ngai rawh, a ngaitu che, i rilruin a ngei hle tawhte kha ka pun ang a, kil tin ata ka hruai khâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Babulon mite leh Kaldai mi zawng zawngte, Pekod te, Soa te, Koa te leh an hnêna Assuria mi zawng zawng nên; tlangvâl îtawm tak takte, awptute, rorêltute, an zain mi liante leh hmingthangte, an zain sakawr chung chuangin an lo kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, hriamhreite, indona tawlailîrte, tawlailîrte leh mipui pung khâwmin an rawn bei ang che; phaw lian leh phaw tê, dâr lukhumte nên i vêlin an hual ang che; tin, an hnênah rorêlna ka kawltîr ang a, an thurêl ang zêlin i chungah an hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, i chungah ka thîkthu ka thlen ang a, thinrim takin an bei ang che, i hnârte leh i bengte an hlep ang a, a la damte chu khandaihin an thi ang a, i fanu leh i fapate an lâksak ang chia, a la damte chu meiin a kâng hlum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I silhfênte an hlihsak bawk ang chia, i incheina mawi tak takte chu an la bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I hurna leh Aigupta ram aṭanga i nawhchizawrhna chu an tihbânsak ang chia; chutichuan, an lamah i mit i lên tawh lo vang a, Aigupta ram chu i hre reng tawh hek lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: ‘Ngai rawh, i huat tak, i rilrua i mi ngei zâwng takte kut ngeiah chuan ka mantîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Huat tak têin an hua ang chia, i thawh rim rah zawng zawng an lâksak ang chia, saruakin, a lâwng maiin an hnutchhiah ang che; i nawhchizawrh saruakna, i hurna leh i nawhchizawrhna ngei chu tihlanin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hêng thilte hi i chungah a lo thleng ang, hnam dangte ûma i hur bova, an milimtea i intihbawlhhlawh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />I laizâwnnu kawng i zawh ve a; chuvângin, a no chu i kutah ka pe ang che.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘I laizâwnnu no tung lian pui mai chu i in ang a, Nuihsan leh chêksawlhin i awm ang; a dawng hnem nasa a ni!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ruihna leh lungngaihnain i khat ang a, Mak tihna leh chhiatna no, I laizâwnnu Samaria no nên chuan i in fai kêlh ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />I in ang a, a no pawh chu i fâwp fai vek ang, I hnutête i ham thlêr ang; Keiin ka sawi tawh si a,’ tih hi, Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Mi theihnghilha mi hnuchhawn avângin i hurna leh i nawhchizawrhna mawh chu i phur mai tûr a ni.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Lalpan ka hnênah a sawi leh a: “Mihring fapa, Oholai leh Oholibai chu i khing dâwn em? An tenawmnate chu an hnênah puang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An uire ta si a, thisen chu an kutah a kai a, an milim hnênah chuan an uire ta a ni; an fapate ka tâna an hrin chu an hnêna kâng ral tûrin meiah an paih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Chu lovah pawh chuan, ka hnênah hei hi an ti a ni; anni vêkin ka hmun thianghlim chu an tibawlhhlawh a, ka Chawlhnite pawh an bawhchhia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />An milimte tâna an fate an thah hnuah, anni vêk chu ka hmun thianghlim tibawlhhlawh tûrin an lût si ṭhîn a; tin, ngai rawh, hetiang hian ka in chhûngah ngei an ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tin, chu lo pawh chu, hla taka mi lo kal tûrin in chah a, mi in tîr a, ngai rawh, an lo kal a, anmahni elin i inbual fai a, i mit i hnawih a, cheimawina dangte i inbel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Khum ropui takah i lo ṭhu a, a hmaah dawhkân i buatsaih a, ka rimtui leh ka hriakte tah chuan i hlui ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, tah chuan mipui nuamtâwl thâwm hriat a ni a, mi narân chang lo pawh thlalêr aṭangin zu ruite an rawn hruai a, an pahnihin bânbunte an bun a, lukhum mawite an khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, ‘Uire tar hnu hi an pâwl duh dâwnin anin a peih dâwn em ni aw?’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, nawhchizuar hnêna an kalin a hnênah an lût ta tho va; tichuan, hmeichhe hur Oholai leh Oholibai hnênah chuan an lût ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mahse, mi felte chuan uirenute leh thisen chhuah chîng hmeichhiate ro an rêl angin an rêlsak ang, uirenute an niha, an kutahte thisen a kai avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan hetiangin a ti si a: An chungah mipui ka pun ang a, ka rawktîr ang a, ka sawisaktîr hrep ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Pung khâwmho chuan lungin an dêng ang a, an khandaihin an sât hlum ang a, an fanute, an fapate an that ang a, an inte an hâlsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hetiang hian hurna chu ram ata ka tibo vang a, hmeichhia zawng zawngin in hurna hi chîn tawp loh tûr a ni tih in hriat nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tin, in chungah in hurna chu an thungrûl ang a, in milim sualnate chu in tuar ang; tin, kei hi Lalpa Pathian ka ni tih in hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum kuana, thla sâwmna, chumi thla, ni sâwm nîah chuan Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ni hming, vawiin ni hming ngei hi ziak rawh; hemi nî ngei hian Babulon lal chuan Jerusalem a rawn bei ṭan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, hel hmang chhûng hnênah chuan tehkhin thu sawi la, an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Saso bêl chhuang la, chhuang reng la, a chhûngah tui chhûng la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sa hrangte thlâk la, a sa ṭha zawng zawng te, a bawp te, a dâr te, a ruhkawl ṭha deuh deuhtein tikhat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ran rualte zînga a ṭha ṭha la la, a hnuaiah thingfâk rawlh ṭeuh la, so bawrh bawrh se; a ni, a ruhkawlte chu mun ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Thisen chhuah hmang khawpui, saso bêl a chhûng kâng khir, a khir la reh ngai lo chu a chung a pik e! Thlang chuang lovin, a sa hrang khat khatin thur rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thisen chhuah chu ama chhûngah a awm si a, vaivuta vûr theih nâna leia leihbuak tâk aruangin lungpui ro chungah a leih ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Phuba la tûra thinurna a lo thawh theih nân vûr lovin a thisen chhuah chu lungpui ro chungah ka leih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Thisen chhuah hmang khawpui chu a chung a pik e! Keimah ngeiin ka chhep hluah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thing chhep ṭeuh ula, mei tuah sâ ula, sa te chu chhûm hmin kawi ula, sa tui chu ngâ takin, a ruhte pawh kâng ral rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, bêl chu a ruakin meivâm chungah chhuan ni reng sela, a lo sa ang a, a dâr chu a lo ling ang a, a bawlhhlawhna chu a lo tui ral ang a, a kâng khir chu a kan ral theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ning khawpa beih pawhin a kâng khir chu a fai chuang lo va, mei pawhin a kâng fai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I bawlhhlawhna chu hurna a ni a, ka thian chia, i fai chuan loh avângin, i chungah ka thinurna ka hrîkthlâk vek hma loh chuan, eng tikah mah i bawlhhlawhna ata chu tlen fai i ni tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh a ni, a lo thleng ngei ang, keiin ka ti dâwn si a, ka hnungtawlh lo vang a, ka zuah hek lo vang a, ka inlamlêt hek lo vang; i awm dânte leh i thiltih ang zêlin ro ka rêlsak ang che,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, ngai teh, thâwk leh khatah i mit tlaina ber chu ka lâksak ang chia, i sûn tûr a ni lo va, i ṭap tûr a ni hek lo, i mittui pawh a tla tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A rûk têin rûm la, mitthi sûnna rêng rêng chu nei suh ang che; i diar khim la, i pheikhawk bun la, i hmui hup suh la, mite chaw pawh ei suh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, zîng lamah chuan mipuite hnênah thu ka sawi a, tlai lamah chuan ka nupui a thi ta mai a; tin, a tûk zîng lamah chuan thu mi pêk ang chuan ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan ka hnênah, “Hetiang i thiltihte hi kan tân eng nge a nih min hrilh dâwn lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, kei chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa thu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel chhûngte hnênah chuan sawi la, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Ngai rawh u, ka hmun thianghlim, in chakna chhuan ber, in mit tlaina ber, in ngainat zâwng tak chu ka tibawlhhlawh dâwn a ni; tin, in fanute, in fapate, hnung lama in kalsante chu khandaihin an tlu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka tih ang chiah hian in ti ve dâwn a ni; in hmui in hup lo vang a, mite chaw in ei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In diarte in khim ang a, in pheikhawk pawh in bun ang; in sûn lo vang a, in ṭap hek lo vang; in khawlohnaahte chuan in thâmral ang a, in inṭah tawn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hetiangin Ezekiela hi in tân entîrna a ni ang a, a tih zia ang zêlin in ti tûr a ni; hei hi a lo thlen hunah chuan Lalpa Pathian chu ka ni tih in hria ang,’ a ti a ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “Nang mihring fapa, an hnên ata an chakna te, an ropui lâwmna te, an mit tlaina ber te, an lungkham ber te, an fanu leh an fapate ka lâk bosak nîah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />chumi ni ngeiah chuan a tlân chhuak chu i hnênah a lo kal ang a, a rawn hriattîr dâwn lo che em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan tlân chhuak hnênah chuan i kâ i âng ang a, i ngawi bo mai lo vang a; tichuan, an tân entîrna i ni ang a; tin, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Amon fate chu hmachhawn la, an chungchâng thu sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Amon fate hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian thu hi ngaithla rawh u, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni; Ka hmun thianghlim chu tihbawlhhlawha a awma, Israel ram tihṭiauva a awma, Juda chhûngte chu sala hruaia an awm lai khân, “I hi!” i lo tih avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ngai rawh, khawchhak lam mite hnênah an neih atân ka pe dâwn che a ni; nangmahah chuan bûk an sual ang a, bu an khuar ang; i thei rahte an ei ang a, i hnute tuite an in ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Raba khua chu sanghâwngsei inah ka siam ang a, Amon fate hmun chu ran rual bawh hmunah ka siam ang; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: Israel ram chungah i kut i bena, i ke i pera, rilru zawng zawnga a chhiatna chunga i lâwm avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ngai rawh, i chungah ka kut ka lek a, hnamte hnênah râllâk atân ka mantîr dâwn che a ni; mite lak ata ka râwt ang chia, chûng ram ata chu ka tiboral daih ang che, ka tichhia ang chia; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih i hria ang,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Moab leh Seir chuan, ‘Ngai rawh, Juda chhûngte chu hnam dang ang mai an ni e,’ an tih avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab ramri vênna khawpuite chu râl ka beihtîr a, khawpui ropui ber Beth-jesimoth te, Baal-meon te, Kiriathaim te pawh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />khawchhak lam fate neih atân Amon fate nên ka pe ang a, Amon fate chu hnamte zînga hriat reng an nih tawh loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Moab ram chungah thurêl chu ka hlen ang a; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a: “Edom chuan Juda chhûngte chungah phuba lain nasa takin thil a lo tisual a ni, ama thu maia an chunga phuba a lâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti e: Edom chungah ka kut ka lek ang a, a lak ata mi leh sate ka râwt bo vek ang; Teman aṭangin ka tiṭiau ang a, Dedan thlengin khandaihin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka mi Israel-te kutin ka phuba lâkna chu ka thlen ang a, Edom chungah chuan ka thinurna ang zêl leh ka thinrimna ang zêlin an ti ang a, ka phuba lâkna chu an lo hria ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Philistia miten phuba laa, kumkhaw inhmêlmâknain, mi tihboral duhna rilru chhia pua phuba an lâk avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni, “Ngai rawh, Philistia mite chungah chuan ka kut ka lek ang a, Kereth khaw mite chu ka râwt vek ang a, tui kama mi la awm chhunte chu ka tiboral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, thinur taka zilhhauvin an chungah phuba ka la ang a, chutia an chunga ka phuba lâkna ka thlen hunah chuan Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hre tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, kum sâwm leh kum khatna thla ni hmasa berah chuan heti hi a ni a, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Tura chuan Jerusalem chung thûah, ‘Ihi! Hnamte kawngkhâr chu a chhe ta, ka lamah a inhawng a, a lo tlâkran tâk vek avângin kei ka changtlung tawh ang,’ a tih avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Ngai rawh, aw Tura, ka do che a ni; tuifinriatin a fâwn a vawrh chhoh ang maiin i chunga lo kal tûrin hnam tam takte ka rawn tîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Tura kulhte chu an tichhia ang a, kulhbîng sângte chu an tichim ang; an lak ata lei zawng zawng ka ziat fai lêng ang a, lungpui ro maiah ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipui laia lên pho rona hmun a ni mai ang, keiman ka sawi tawh si a, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni; tichuan, hnamte tân râllâk a ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, a fanu rama awmte chu khandaiha tihhlum an ni ang a; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Ngai rawh, Tura chungah chuan Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara, lalte lal chu hmâr lam aṭangin, sakawrte nên, sakawr chung chuang mite nên, a pâwl leh mipui tam tak mai nên ka rawn hruai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I fanute an that ang, ramah, khandaihin; Kulh a siam ang, nangmah dan nân, Nangmah do nân a siam ang, mual pâwngte, I chungah ka phawsial a sîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kulh sut chhiatna a siam, i kulh ṭhiat nân, I kulhbîng sâng a tichim ang, hreipuiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sakawr tam avângin a khuh ang che, vaivutin, Khawpui chhiata mite an lût ṭhîn angin, I kawngka an luh ve hunah chuan, I kulhpui a nghîng ang- Sakawr chung chuangte thâwm leh indo tawlailîr thâwmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sakawr rual kein a chîl chhia ang, i kawtthlêr zawng, I mite a that zo vang, khandaihin, I chakna bang sâng suar ang a chim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I ro thil râllâkin an la ang, I bungrua zawng zawng an rawk zo vang, I kulh bang suar ang a tichim ang, I rûn in nuam an tichhe zo vang, I thing, lung, hlumte an paih ang, tuipui laiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tibâng zo vang, i zai thâwmte, I ṭingṭang ri pawh a dai hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lungpui ro maiah ka siam ang che. Lên pho ronaah i lo chang ang, Din i ni leh tawh lo vang, Keimah Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh si,” Tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan Tura khaw hnênah heti hian a sawi a: ‘I chhûngah chuan inthahnate a awm huna, mi hliamte an rûm hunah chuan i tlu thâwmah chuan tuipui kam ramte a nghîng dâwn lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuipui chunga hotute zawng zawng chu an ṭhutthlêng ata an chhuk ang a, an puan ropuite an dah ang a, an chei mawite an hlîp tawh ang; khurhnain an inthuam zâwk ang a, leiah an ṭhu ang a, an khûr an khûr ang a, mak an ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, nangmah sûnna hla an phuah ang a, i hnênah - ‘Khawpui hmingthang, tuipui chunga chak, Tui thiam mite hlîr chên ṭhinna chu, Amah leh a chhûnga chêngte zawng zawng, Mi veivâkten an ṭih ṭhin che nên, I chhiatna chu a va nasa êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I tlûkna nîah an nghîng, thliarkârte, Tuipui thliarkâr an zâm ang, i bo nîah,’ an ti ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: “Khawpui ram, tu ma luah loh khawpui anga ka siam hunah che chuan, tui thûk takah ka tipil ang chia, tui nasa takin a chîm ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />hmasâng mi, khur thûka kal tawhte hnênah ka tîr thla ang chia, lei hnuai lamah, hmâna ṭiau tawh khur thûka kal tawhte hnênah ka chêntîr ang chia, tu mahin an luah loh nân che leh mi nungte zînga ropuina i hmuh tawh hauh loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tiboral daih ang chia, i awm tawh lo vang, miten zawng che mah sela, an hmu tawp lo vang che,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang, mihring fapa, Tura khaw sûnna hla phuah la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tura khaw hnênah chuan - Aw nang, tuipui kama chêng ṭhîn, Tuipui kam ram tam takte hnêna sumdâwngtu, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti che a ni: Aw nang Tura, ‘Ka mawi famkim’ i ti maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I ramin tuipui lai chu a chhun e, I siamtuten an timawi chungchuang ngei che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I thing hmanrua Senir fârin an siam e, I lawng ngul atân an la, Lebanon thing ril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Basan sasua i vaichaah an siam e, Saingho chhûngphûm i lawng chhuatah Tufâr thing, Tuipui ram Kittim ata chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I lawng puanzâr Aigupta nêmte puan ṭial, Nangmah chhinchhiah nân a lo chuang e, I tân hliapzâr dumpâwl, sen duk, Elisa tui kam ram ata chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I lawng kartu Zidon, Arvad mi an ni, I lawng khalhtute zawng chu, aw Tura, I mi fingte an ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Gebal upa leh mi themthiam, I lawng tuahremtu an lo ni e, Tuipui lawng zawng leh a miten, Nangmah dâwrin an pan che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I râl tu mi i sipai rual, Persia, Lud, Put an ni; An sialphâw leh an dâr lukhum an bâng a, Nangmah cheimawitu an lo ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I sipai rual Arvad mi nên an chuang, i kulhpui chungah, I kulhbîng Gammad-ho râl vêngin, An sialphaw an bâng e, i kulhpui vêlin, Nangmah cheimawitu an lo ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I ngah vângin, sum leh pai ro thil tinrêng, Tarsis chu dâwrtu che a lo ni a, I bungrua leiin a hlân che Tangkarua, thîr, rângva leh suante pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Javan, Tubal, Mesek, nang dâwrtu che hian, Sal leh dâr bungbêlin an dâwr che, i bungraw neih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Beth-togarmah chuan sakawr, indo sakawr leh sabengtung hlânin I bungrua an lei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Dedan mite i dâwrtute an ni a, Tui kam hmun tin i sumdâwn hmun a lo ni, Saingho leh eboni an hlân che - dawvânkai nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bungrua i ngah avângin, Edom chu i dâwrtu a lo ni a, Emerald lung, puan sen duk, puan cheimawi, Puanzaisîn, ṭhival, rubi lungtein an dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda leh Israel-te pawh a dâwrtu che an ni a, Minnith buh leh Pannag, khawizû, Hriak leh thing hnaiin an dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I ngah vângin sum leh pai ro thil tinrêng, Damaska i dâwrtu a lo ni a, Helbon uain leh berâm hmul vârin an dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Uzal uain chu rawn lain an lei, i bungruate, Thîr tle tak, thakthîng leh fûte i sumdâwnna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sakawr chung phah puantein Dedan chuan a dâwr che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arabia leh Kedar lalte nangmah dâwrtute an ni vek, Berâmnote, berâmpate, kêlpatein an dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Seba leh Raamah sumdâwngtute chu a dâwrtu che an lo ni; Rimtui ṭha berte, lunghlu chi tin leh rangkachaktein an dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Haran, Kanneh leh Eden, Seba, Assuria leh Kilmad sumdâwngtute chu A dâwrtu che an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûngte chu an ni, dâwrtu che, Silhfên ṭha mi, puan dumpâwl leh puan cheimawi, Chhuat phah ze mawi nên, Hruihrual nghet taka cherin, Hêng hian an dâwr che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tarsis lawngte chu i bungraw phur dual dualtute an ni, I lo mukin tuipui chungah i lo ropui ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I lawng khalhtun tuipui fâwnah a khalh lût chia, Khawchhak thlîin a nuai ral che, tuipui laiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I sum leh pai, i bungruate, i sumdâwn thil, I lawng mite, lawng khalhtu, tuah remtute, I hlân vêltu leh râl tu mite, nangmaha awm, I chhûnga awm zawng zawngte nên, In pil bo vang, tuipui laiah, i chhiat niin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I lawng khalhtute au thâwmah, I vêla mite an khûr e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lawng kar ngul vuantute zawng zawng, lawng mite leh, Tuipuia khalhtute zawng zawng chhukin, An ding, vau kamah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I chung thûah an aw hriat thamin an chhuah ang, Lungchhe takin an ṭap ang a, An lûah vaivutte phulin, an tâl ang, vut zîngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Nangmah vânga inziat kâwngin, an fêng ang, saiip puan, Lungchhe vânkaia ṭapin an sûn ang che, nasa takin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangmah sûnin an chham ang, an ṭah hla, Tu nge Tura ang awm le - Tuipui laia dairial chang ta hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />I bungruate tuipuia chhuakin, Mi tam tak a hrai tlai ṭhîn, Lei lalte zawng i tihausa, I sum leh pai tam, i bungruain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuipui thûkah i chhiat ni khân, I sumdâwn thil, i mi zawng zawng, Rial ang an ral ta, nangmah nênin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tui kam mi zawng zawngin râpthlâk an ti che, An lalte lah hlauvin an thlabâr, An sakhmêl pawh a dang zo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mite zînga sumdâwngtuten an chek khum che, Mi tân ṭihkhaiah i lo chang ta, I lang leh tawh ngai lo vang le, Tiin an ṭah khum che.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Tura hotu hnênah chuan sawi la, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: I rilru a chapo va, pathian ka ni a, tuipui laia pathian ṭhuthmunah ka ṭhu - i ti a; mahse, mihring mai i ni a, pathian i ni lo va, pathian rilru ang puah inngai mah la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Daniela aiin i fing zâwk a, i lakah thurûk rêng rêng a awm thei lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />i fin leh i remhriatnain i lo intihausa a, i ro bâwmah tangka leh rangkachak i khung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />i finna nasa tak leh i sumdâwnnain sum i tipung a, i hausak êm avângin i rilru a lo chapo ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Pathian rilru ang pua i inngaih avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ngai rawh, awze mi, hnam ṭihbaiawm tak i hnênah ka rawn tîr dâwn a ni; i finna rah mawi chungah an khandaih an vilik ang a, i ropuina an tikhawlo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khur thûkah an tîr lût ang chia, tuipui laia an thahte thihin i thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thattu che hmaah chuan, “Pathian ka ni,” i la ti cheu dâwn em ni? A hliamtu che kutah chuan pathian i ni lo va, mihring mai i ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Awze mite kutah serhtan loh thihin i thi ang; ka ṭawng tawh si a,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Tura lal sûnna hla phuah la, a hnênah, ‘Heti hian Lalpa PATHIAN-in a ti: Ṭha famkim tak, finnaa khat, mawina tinrêng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian huan Eden-ah i chêng; Lunghlu tinrêng i inbel a, Sardion, topaz lung leh diamond, Berul, onuks, jaspi, sapphir, smarakdin, karbankul, A phûm nghehna leh a ziak mawina rangkachaka siamte, Nangmah siam nia buatsaih tawhte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang chu vêngtu cherub hriak thih i ni; Pathian tlâng thianghlimah ka awmtîr chia, Mei vâm iang lung zîngah i lêng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I ṭha famkim, siama i awm ni ata, nangmaha khawlohna a awm hma rêng zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I sumdâwnna a pung tual tual, A tikhat che, pâwngnêkin, Sualah i lo tlu e, Pathian tlâng hnâwmhnea’n ka hnâwl che, Vêngtu cherub-in a hnawt chhuak che, Mei vâm iang lung zîng ata.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I mawina vânga lo chapovin, I ropuinain i finna tikhawlovin, Leiah ka paih chia, Lalte hmaah mualah ka pho che - ennawmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I sumdâwn fel lohnateah, i khawlohna avângin, I hmun thianghlimte i tibawrhbâng a; Chuvângin, mei ka chhuah, i chhûng ata, A kâng ral che, leiah vaivutah ka chantîr che; A hmu ṭhîn che zawng zawng hmuha’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mite zînga a hria apiang che mak tiha’n. Ṭihkhaiah i lo chang ta, I awm ngai rêng rêng tawh lo vang le,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Sidon hmachhawn la, a chung thu sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti: “Ka dodâl che a ni, aw Sidon; Ka tilang ang, ka ropuina, nangmahah; Lalpa ka nihzia an hria ang a, Amahah ro ka rêl hunah chuan, Ka entîr ngei ang, ka thianghlimna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kawtthlêrah thisen leh hripui ka thlen ang, A chhûngah hliam tuar an tlu ang a Hmun tin kil tin ata chemsenin; Tin, Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel chhûngte tân chhuntu tûr hnimhlîngnei a awm lo vang a, a vêla anmahni hmusittute zîngah tinatu tûr hlîng a awm tawh lo vang; tin, kei hi Lalpa Pathian ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: “Israel chhûngte chu an darhna ram mite zîng ata ka hruai khâwm leh hunah, hnamte mit hmuhah anmahniah ka thianghlimna ka entîr hunah chuan, Jakoba hnêna ka pêk, an ram ngeiah chuan an chêng tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tichuan, him takin an awm tawh ang; a ni, inte an sa ang a, grêp huante an siam ang a, him takin an awm ang, an vêla hmusittu zawng zawngte chunga ro ka rêl hunah chuan, kei hi Lalpa an Pathian chu ka ni tih an hria ang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum sâwmna, thla sâwmna, chumi thla ni sâwm leh ni hnihnaah chuan Lalpa thu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta lal Pharaoa hmachhawn la, a chungah leh Aigupta mi zawng zawng chungah thu sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawi la, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Ngai rawh, Aigupta lal Pharaoa, luipuite laia awlepui ropui tak, Ka luipui hi ka ta a ni, keimah ngeia tân ka siam a ni,’ titu, ka do che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I khabeahte nghakuaiin ka man ang chia, luipuia sanghate chu i phuhlipah ka tibet ang a, luipui lai ata i phuhlipah sangha zawng zawngte nên chuan ka pawt chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, thlalêrah ka paih ang chia, nang leh i luipuia sangha zawng zawngte pawh; tâmlakah i tla ang a, i ruang hlâwm a ni lo vang a, phûm i ni hek lo vang; ram sakawlhte leh chunglêng savate hnênah chaw atân ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel chhûngte tân luang tiang mai an lo nih tâk avângin, Aigupta rama chêng zawng zawngte chuan kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kutin an vawn chein i lo tliak a, an kokîah i chhun thlêr a; an rinchhan chia, i tliak a, an kâwngte chu a sai dawt dawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Ngai rawh, i chungah khandaih ka rawn thlen ang a, i lak ata mi leh sa ka râwt bo vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ram chu ram ṭiau leh khaw ram a ni mai ang a, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang, ‘Luipui hi ka ta a ni a, ka siam a ni,’ a tih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka do chia, i luipui pawh; Suene kulh aṭangin Ethiopia ramri thlengin Aigupta ram chu ram ṭiau leh khaw ramah ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihring kein a chîl ngai lo vang a, sate pawh an kal ngai hek lo vang; kum sawmli chhûng pawhin luahin a awm hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta ram chu ram ṭiaute zînga pakhatah ka siam ang a, a khawpuite chu khawpui ramte zîngah kum sawmli a ṭiau vang; Aigupta mite chu hnamte zîngah ka tidarh ang a, ram tinah ka tidarh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: ‘Kum sawmli hnuah chuan an darhna mite lakah chuan Aigupta mite chu ka khâwm leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta mite awm dân ka let ang a, an pianna ram, Pathros ramah ka kîrtîr ang; tin, tah chuan tlâwm takin an lal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalna ram tlâwm ber a ni ang, hnamte zîngah a intilal tawh hek lo vang; hnam dang chunga thu a neih tawh loh nân anmahni ka titê dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An lam hawi apiangin an khawlohna an hriat chhuah ṭhin avângin, Israel-te rin pui an ni tawh lo vang; tin, Lalpa Pathian chu ka ni tih an hria ang, a ti,’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum sawmhnih leh kum sarihna, thla khatna, chumi thla ni khat nîah chuan Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara chuan Tura chungah hna ropui tak thawk tûrin a sipai rual chu a ti a, mi tin chhîpte chuan a kawlh phah a, mi kokîin a pilh phah bawk a; mahse, amah leh a sipai rualte pawhin an hnathawhah chuan Tura lakah hlâwkna eng mah an hmu chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ngai rawh, Aigupta ram chu Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara hnênah ka pe dâwn a, a thil ngah rei ruite chu a la bo vang a, a rawk ang a, râllâkah a lâksak ang; chu chu a sipai rualte hlawh chu a ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka rawng an bâwl avângin Aigupta ram hi an hlawhah ka pe a ni,’ Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Israel chhûngte tân kî ka chawr chhuahtîr ang a, an zîngah chuan i kâ ka ântîr ang; tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, thu sawi la, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Chiau vak vak rawh u, Ehei, chu nî tak chu!’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nî a hnai e, Lalpa nî chu a hnai e, Chhûm zîn ni, awze mite chhiatna tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lo thleng dâwn, chemsen, Aigupta chungah, Thinlai natna, Ethiopia chungah; Aigupta-ah mi thah an tlûkin, A ngah rei ruite lâksakin, a nghahchhan suar ang chim e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ethiopia, Put leh Lud, hnam tin lêng za chu, Kub leh ram fa tel vete zawng zawng, An tlu ang, chemsenin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Aigupta tung dingtute pawh kha an tlu ang, a chakna chhuan ṭhin pawh chu a tlâwm ang; Migdol aṭangin Suene thlengin khandaihin an tlu vek ang, Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ram tihṭiau tawhte zînga pakhat a ni ang a, a khawpuite pawh chu khawpui ram tawhte zînga mi a ni mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta ramah mei ka chhuah a, a puitute zawng zawng ka tihchhiat hunah chuan Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan Ethiopia mi inring lohote tizâm tûrin ka hnên ata mi tirh lawngin an kal ang a; tin, Aigupta ni ang bawkin thinlung manganna tak an chungah a thleng ve ang; ngai rawh, a lo thleng mêk e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Babulon lal Nebukadnezzara kutin Aigupta thil ngah rei ruite chu ka tibo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ram tichhe tûrin amah leh a hote, hnamte zînga ṭihbaiawm takte chu hruai thlen an ni ang, Aigupta chungah an khandaih an lek ang a, ram chu mi ruangin an tikhat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, luipuite chu ka tikang ang a, ram chu mi sualte hnênah ka hralh ang; a ram leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng chu awze mite kutin ka tiṭiau vang. Kei Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Milimte chu ka tichhia ang a, Noph khua ata milimte ka tibo vang, Aigupta-ah hotu rêng rêng an awm tawh lo vang; tin, Aigupta ramah chuan hlauhna ka awmtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathros chu ka tiṭiau vang a, Zoan-ah chuan mei ka chhuah ang a, No khuaah chuan ka hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta kulh Sin khaw chungah ka thinrim ka hrithla ang a, No khuaa mipuite chu ka râwt bo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta-ah chuan mei ka chhuah ang a, Sin khua chu mangang takin a awm ang a, No khua pawh a chim vek ang; Noph khua chuan chhûnah hmêlma a nei fo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aven leh Pi-beseth khaw tlangvâlte chu khandaihin an tlu ang a, chûng khuate chu sala hruaiin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aigupta nghâwngkawl ka tihtliaha, a chakna a chapopui ṭhin ka tihtâwp hunah chuan, Tehaphnehes khuaah chuan ni a thim ang; amah zawng chhûmin a hliah ang a, a fanute chu sala hruaiin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hetiang hian Aigupta ramah thu ka hlen ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum sâwm leh kum khatna, thla khatna, chumi thla ni sarih nîah chuan Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta lal Pharaoa bân chu ka titliak a; tin, ngai rawh, khandaih keng tûra a chak leh nân damdawi hnawih leh tuam a hlawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Ngai rawh, Aigupta lal Pharaoa chu ka do a ni; a bân ṭha lam leh a tliak tawh hnu lam pawh chu ka titliak ang a; tin, a kut ata khandaih chu ka titla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chu hnamte zîngah ka tidarh ang a, ram tinah ka tiphirsî vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal bânte chu ka tichak ang a, a kutah khandaih ka kentîr ang a; Pharaoa bânte erawh chu ka titliak ang a, a hmaah chuan thihpui khawp hliam rûmin a rûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, Babulon lal bânte chu ka tichak ang a, Pharaoa bânte erawh chu a uai thla ang; tin, Babulon lal kutah ka khandaih ka kentîr a, Aigupta lal chunga a lek hunah chuan kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, Aigupta mite chu hnamte zîngah ka tidarh ang a, ram tinah ka tiphirsî vek ang a; tin, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,’ ” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum sâwm leh kum khatna, thla thumna, chumi thla ni khat nîah chuan Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta lal Pharaoa leh a khua leh a mite hnênah sawi la: ‘Ropuinaah tu nge i an le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai rawh, Lebanon zâr mawi leh Buk, hlim chhah, sâng mawi, A zîk chhûm kâra lêng i iang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siktui thiang châwm, lipui siama ṭhang tual tual, A phunna luiten an luan vêl a, Ram thing tin châwm nân a luantîr e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutin ram thing zawng hnehin a sâng zual e, A zâr a ṭhang, a ṭang a sei, Tui tam tak châwm, hnianghnârin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bu an khuar e, a zârah, chunglêngten, A zâr hnuaiah sa tinrêngi no an nei, A hlim hnuaiah hnam ropui zawng an chêng e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutin a mawi, a ropuina, a zâr sei zêlin, A zung tân tui zawng a hnianghnâr e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian huana sidar thingten an chhîng lo ve, A zâr fâr thingin a iang zo lo, A ṭang pawh thingsiain a iang hek lo, A mawinaah Pathian thing a chhîng zo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ṭang titamin ka siam mawi a, Pathian huana Eden thing zawngten an îtsîk e,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘A lo sân êm êma, chhûmte zînga a zîk a lêna, a thinlungin a sânzia chu a chapopui avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />hnamte zînga mi chak tak kutah ka mantîr ang; a suahsualzia ang zêlin a hrem ang a, ka hnawt chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, awze mi hnamte zînga ṭihbaiawm takte chuan an kit ang a, an hluihlâwn ang: tlângahte, ruamahte a ṭang a tla rem rum ang a, chu ram tuiluankawr zawng zawngahte a zârte chu a tliak rem rum ang; khawvêl mi zawng zawngte chu a hlim ata an chhuak ang a, amah chu an kalsan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A chhiatnaah chuan chunglêng sava zawng zawngte an chêng ang a, a ṭang chungahte chuan ramsate an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng hi tuia châwm thing zawng zawng an intihsân lohva, an zîk chhûm kâra lêng lova, tuia châwm thing rêng rêngin an sânzia an chhuan hek lohna tûr a ni; lei hmun hnuaihnung bera khuarkhuruma chhuk ta mihring fate zînga kal tûrin, thihnaa mantîr an ni vek tawh si a.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Seol-a a chhuk nîah chuan tui thûk tak chu amah ka sûntîr a, a luite ka chawlhtîr a, tui tam takte chu an luang lo va; Lebanon amah ka sûntîr bawk a, ram thing zawng zawngte amah avângin an chau zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hnamte pawh a tlu thâwmah chuan ka tikhûr a, khuarkhuruma chhuk tawhte hnêna Seol-a ka paihthlâk ni chuan; Eden thing zawng zawngte, Lebanon-a thing ṭha ṭhate, tuia châwm zawng zawngte chu lei hnuaihnung berah chuan thlamuanin an awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khandaiha thahte hnênah chuan Seol-ah an chhuk ta bawk a; a ni, hnamte zînga a hlim hnuaia chêng ṭhîn, a kutkete ngei pawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Eden thingte zîngah ropuina leh lennaah tu nge nang ang awm? Mahse, Eden thingte nên chuan lei hmun hnuaihnung berah paihthlâk i ni ang; khandaiha thah, serhtan lohte zîngah i mu tûr a ni. Hei hi Pharaoa leh a khua leh tuite chu an ni,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum sâwm leh kum hnihna, thla sâwm leh thla hnihna, chumi thla ni khat nîah chuan Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta lal Pharaoa sûnna hla phuah la, a hnênah: Hnamte zînga sakeibaknei vânglai anpui chu! Tuipui awlepui i iang zâwk e; I hnâra tuite tiphuanin, i kein i chawk nû, I luite i tibawlhhlawh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: Ka lênin ka khuh ang chia, mi tam tak nên, Ka lênin an man ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hluihlâwn ang chia, khawmualah, Ka paih ang che, tâmlakah; Chunglêng zawng zawng ka ko khâwm ang, i chungah, Ka titlai ang lei pum pui ramsa, nangmahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlâng tinah i sa ka hlui ang a, I ruangin ruamte ka tikhat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I chênna ram tlâng thlengin ka bual ang, i thisenin. Kawr tin a khat bawk ang, nangmahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tihchimih hunah che chuan, Vân ka khuhin arsi ka tithim ang, Nî ka hliah bo vang, chhûmin, Thlain a êng a chhuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vân êng zawng ka tithim ang, i chungah, I ramah thim ka lêntîr ang, Tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,” ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I hriat loh rama hnamte zînga i chhiatna ka thlen hunah chuan mi tam takte thinlung ka tichi-ai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni, mi tam tak nangmahah mak tiin ka siam ang a, an hmaa ka khandaih ka vilik hunah chuan, nangmah avângin an lalte pawhin râpthlâk an tiin an hlau êm êm ang; i tlûk nîah chuan mi tinin an nun chân hlauvin an khûr an khûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti si a: Babulon lal khandaih i chungah a lo thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I mite ka tlûktîr ang, râlhrât mite khandaih, Hnamte zînga ṭihbaiawm berte an ni, An tichhia ang. Aigupta mite ropuina, A mipui zawngte an boral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tui tam tak kam ramsa zawng a tiboral ang, Mî kete chuan a pal nu tawh lo vang a, Ramsa kete pawhin a pal nu tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chutin tui ka tifîm ang a, Ka luantîr ang, luite chu, hriak angin, Tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta ram ka tihṭiau chhiata, A nghahna zawng zawngah saruakin, A chhûnga chêngte ka râwt bo hunah chuan, Kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hre ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hei hi an ṭah hla tûr chu a ni; hnam tin fanuten hei hian ṭapin Aigupta leh a mi zawng zawngte an sûn ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kum sâwm leh kum hnihna, chumi thla ni sâwm leh panga nîah chuan Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Aigupta mipuite chu ṭah vak vak la, amah leh hnam hmingthang tak fanute chu, khuarkhuruma chhuk tawhte hnênah, lei hnuaihnung lamah chuan paih thla rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mawinaah tu nge i khûm le? Chhuk la, serhtan lohte zîngah chuan zâl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khandaiha thah tawhte zîngah chuan an tlu ang a, khandaih hnênah pêk an ni tawh a, amah leh a mi zawng zawngte chu hnûk bo rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Seol-a awm râlhrât mi chak takte chuan amah leh a ṭanpuitute an bia ang; an chhuak a, an mu reng a, khandaiha thah, serhtan lohte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutah chuan Assur leh a hote zawng zawng an awm a, an thlânte chu ama vêlah a awm a, an zain thah, khandaiha tlu vek an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An thlânte chu khuarkhurum thûk berah a awm a, a thlân vêlah chuan a hote an awm a; an zain khandaiha thah vek an ni a, mi nung ram tirâlṭitute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutah chuan Elam leh a thlân vêlah a hote an awm a, an zain thah, khandaiha tlu, lei hnuaihnunga serhtan loh va chhuk, mi nung ram tirâlṭitute, an mualphona khuarkhuruma chhukpuitute an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi thahte zîngah amah leh a hote mutna an siamsak a, an thlânte chu ama vêlah a awm a, an zain serhtan loh, khandaiha thah an ni; an hlauhawmna chu mi nung ram râlṭitna a ni ṭhîn a, khuarkhuruma chhuk tate nên chuan an mualphona an phur a, mi thahte zîngah chuan an awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chutah chuan Mesek leh Tubal, an hote nên an awm a, an thlânte chu ama vêlah a awm a, an zain serhtan loh, khandaiha thah an ni a; an hlauhawmnain mi nung ram a tirâlṭi ṭhîn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Serh tan loh, mi chak tlute, indo hriamhrei nêna Seol-a chhuk tate, an khandaih lukhama, an ruhte chunga an phawte awm hnênah chuan an mu lo vang; anni zawng mi nung rama mi chak tirâlṭitute an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang chu serhtan lohte zîngah bung rem rumin i awm ang a, khandaiha thite hnênah i mu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutah chuan Edom, a lalte leh a hotute zawng zawng an awm a; an chak teh na a, khandaiha thahte zîngah an zalh a ni; serhtan loh, khuarkhuruma chhuk tawhte hnênah an mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutah chuan hmâr lam hotute, an vaiin, Sidon mi zawng zawng, thahte zînga chhuk tawhte chu an awm a, an chaknain mi a tirâlṭi ṭhîn na a, an zak a, serhtan lohvin, khandaiha thahte zîngah an mu a, khuarkhuruma chhuk tawhte nên chuan an mualpho tlâng ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pharaoa chuan a lo hmu ang a, a mite zawng zawng chu a thlamuan phah ang, Pharaoa leh a sipai rual zawng zawng, khandaiha thahte ngei pawh chu, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi nung ramah chuan râlṭitna ka lêntîr a, serhtan loh, khandaiha thahte zîngah a mu ang, Pharaoa leh a mi zawng zawngte ngei chu, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, i hnam fate hnênah chuan thu sawi la, an hnênah, ‘Ram chunga khandaih chu ka rawn thlen chuan, ram mite chuan an zîng ata mi pakhat an thlan chhuaha, enthlatua an dah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />anin ram chunga khandaih lo thleng a hmuh chuan tawtawrâwt a hâm ang a, mipuite chu a inrâlrintîr ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tichuan, tu pawh tawtawrâwt ri hriaa pawisa lotu chu, khandaih lo thlengin boral phah ta mah sela, a thisen mawh chu amah ngeiin a phur tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt ri a hriata a pawisak loh avângin a thisen mawh chu a phur mai tûr a ni. A lo pawisak erawh chuan a nun a humhim dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, enthlatu chuan khandaih lo thleng chu a hmuha, a tawtawrâwt a ham lohva, mipuite chu an inrâlrin lohva, khandaih chu a lo thlena, an zînga mi tu emawin a boral phah chuan, a khawlohnain a boral a ni ang a, a thisen phuba chu enthlatu lakah ka la ang,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutiang chuan nang, mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte tân enthlatuah ka siam che a ni; chuvângin, ka kâa thuchhuak hi ngaithla la, ka hnên ata inrâlrinna tûr thu chu an hnênah hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi suaksual hnênah chuan, ‘Aw mi suaksualpa, i thi ngei tûr a ni,’ ka tihin, mi suaksual chu a awm dân kalsan tûra i hrilh loh chuan, mi suaksual chu a khawlohnaah a thi ang a, a thisen phuba erawh chu i lakah ka la ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi sual chu a awm dân kalsan tûra i hrilha, a awm dân a kalsan si loh chuan, a khawlohnaah a thi ang a, nang erawh chuan i nun i humhim a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mihring fapa, nangin Israel chhûngte hnênah thu sawi la, ‘Hetiang hian in ti a, kan bawhchhiatnate leh kan sualnate chuan min delh a, chûng avâng chuan ka rîral a ni, engtin nge kan nun theih rêng ang?’ in ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An hnênah chuan, ‘A nuna ka nun chhûng chu, mi suaksual thihnaah hian lâwmna rêng ka nei lo va, mi suaksualin a awm dân a kalsana, a nun hi ka lawm zâwng a ni zâwk. In awm dân ṭha lo aṭang chuan kîr ru, kîr ru. Aw, Israel chhûngte u, engah nge in thih ang le, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,’ tiin sawi rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, nang, mihring fapa, i hnam fate hnênah chuan sawi la, ‘Mi fel felna chuan a bawhchhiatna nîah chuan amah chu a chhanhim lo vang a, mi suaksual sualna pawhin a suahsualna a hawisan nîah chuan a titlu lo vang a, mi fel lah chu a sualna nîah chuan a felnain a nung thei bîk hek lo vang.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi fel hnênah chuan, ‘I nung ngei ang,’ tih ka sawiin, a felna ringa thil a tihsual chuan a thil fel tih pakhat mah hriat reng a ni lo vang; a thil lo tihsualnaah chuan a thi zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, mi sual hnênah, ‘I thi ngei ang,’ ka tih leh thungin, a sualnate a hawisana a thiang leh a dik a lo tiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mi sual chuan mi dahkhamte a pêk kîra, a thil rûkte a pêk leha, nunna dânte a zawha, khawlohna eng mah a tih loh chuan a nung ngei ang a, a thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sualna a lo tih tâk eng mah kha hriat reng a ni tawh lo vang a, a thiang leh a dik chu a lo ti tawh a, a nung ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, i hnam fate chuan, ‘Lalpa thiltih dân hi a rual lo ve,’ an tihin, anmahni tih dân a fel lo zâwk a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi fel chuan a felna a hawisana, thil sual a lo tih chuan, chumi avâng chuan a thi mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mi sualin a sualna a hawisana, a thiang leh a dik chu a tih chuan, chumi zârah chuan a nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mahse, ‘Lalpa tih dân hi a rual lo ve,’ in ti a. Aw, Israel chhûngte u, mi tin mahni tih dân ang zêlin ka rêlsak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kan sal tân kum sâwm leh kum hnihna, thla sâwmna, chumi thla ni nga nîah chuan Jerusalem ata tlân chhuak mi pakhat ka hnênah a lo kal a, “Khawpui chu hneh a ni ta,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chu mi tlân chhuak chu a lo kal hma tlai lamah chuan Lalpa chuan ka chungah a kut a nghat a, zîng lama ka hnêna a lo kal chuan ka kâ mi lo ântîr hman a; tichuan, ka kâ chu ka âng a, ṭawng thei lovin ka awm ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel rama hmun ram tawh hnua awmte chuan, ‘Abrahama chu pakhat a ni a, ram chu a luah a, keini erawh chu tam tak kan ni a; ram chu rochun tûra pêk a ni tawh ang chu,’ tiin a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chuvângin, an hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: “Sa thisen in ei a, in milimte lamah in mitte in lên chho va, thisen in chhuah a, nangnin ram chu in chang ang maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In khandaih in ring a, thil tenawm in ti a, mi tinin ṭhenawmpa nupui in tikhawlo va, nangnin ram chu in chang ang maw?”’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hetiang hian an hnênah i sawi tûr a ni, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “A nuna ka nun chhûng chu, hmun ram tawh hnua awmte chu khandaihin an tlu ngei ngei ang a, tâmlaka awmte chu sakawlh hnênahte ei zawh atân ka pe ang a, kulh nghet leh pûka awmte chu hripuiin an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, ram pawh chu ka tiṭiauvin, râpthlâk takah ka siam ang a, a thiltihtheihna, a chapopui chu a kin tawh ang; Israel tlângte chu thlalêrah a chang ang a, tu mah an veivâk tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thil tenawm an tih avânga ram chu ka tihchhiata, râpthlâk taka ka siam hunah chuan kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.”’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, nang, mihring fapa, bang bulah kawngkâahte i hnam fate chuan an sawi huai huai ang chia, mi tinin an unaute hnênah, ‘Hawh teh u khai! Lalpa hnên ata thuchhuak i ngaithla ang u,’ an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, a hlawp hlawpin i hnênah an lo kal ang a, ka mite ang maiin i hmaah an ṭhu ang a, i thu an ngaithla ang a; mahse, an zâwm chuang lo vang; an kâin hmangaihna nasa tak an tilang ang a, an thinlung erawh chuan hlêpna lam a pan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, nang chu an tân chuan hmangaihna hla, mawi taka sak leh tum ang i ni ang; i thute chu ngaithla mah se, an zâwm chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hei hi a lo thlen hunah (ngai rawh, a lo thleng mêk e), an zîngah zâwlnei a awm tih an hre dâwn nia, a ti e, ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel berâmpute hnenah thu sawi rawh; thu sawi la, an hnênah, ‘Berâmpute hnên ngeiah chuan, heti hian Lalpa PATHIAN-in a ti a ni: “Israel berâmpu, mahni inchâwm maite chu an chung a pik e! Berâmpute chuan berâm chu an châwm lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thaute chu in ei a, a hmulin in inthuam a, a thau thaute chu in talh a, berâmte chu in châwm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Natna tuarte in tichak lo va, damlote in tidam lo va, ruh tliakte in tuam lo va, hnawh bote in rawn hruai hek lo, a bote chu in zawng hek lo; khauh tak leh na takin in thunun ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Berâmpute an awm loh avângin tihdarhin an lo awm ta a, an lo darh a, ram sakawlhte chaw mai an lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka berâmte chu tlâng tin leh mual tinah an vâk bo va; a ni, ka berâmte chu lei chung zawng zawngah an lo darh ta; ngaihsaktu leh zawngtu rêng an awm lo, tiin sawi rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ ‘Chuvângin, berâmpute u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“A nuna ka nun chhûng chu,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni, “Berâmpu an awm lohva, berâmputen ka berâmte an zawn lohva, berâmputen ka berâmte an châwm lohva, anmahni an inchâwm zâwk avângin ka berâmte chu ram sakawlhte chaw mai an lo ni a, ka berâmte chu sa seh mai an lo ni ta ngei a.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, nangni berâmpute u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, berâmpute chu ka do a ni; an kut ata ka berâmte ka chhuh ang a, ka berâmte an enkawlna ka titâwp ang a, berâmpute pawh anmahni an inchâwm tawh hek lo vang; an ângchhûng ata ka berâmte ka la chhuak ang a, an tân ei tûr an nih tawh loh nân,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti si a: “Ngai rawh u, kei, keimah ngei hian ka berâmte ka zawng ang a, ka zawng chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Berâmpuin a berâm darhte zînga a berâm rualte a zawn lai angin ka berâmte ka zawng chhuak ang; khawdur ni leh thim hnuaia an darhna zawng zawng ata ka zawng chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, mite zîng ata ka la chhuak ang a, ram tin ata ka khâwm ang a, an ram ngeiah ka hruai lût ang; Israel tlângahte, tuikawr ruamahte, mi chênna hmun zawng zawngahte ka tlattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlobet ṭha tak hmunahte ka tlattîr ang a, an huang chu Israel tlâng sângahte a awm ang. Huang ṭha tak chhûngah an bawk ang a, Israel tlâng chunga hlobet dâwng hmunahte an tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keimah ngeiin ka berâmte chu ka châwm ang a, ka bawhtîr hle hle ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Bote chu ka zawng ang a, hnawh bote chu ka hruai kîr ang a, ruh tliakte chu ka tuam ang a, damlote chu ka tichak ang; a thau leh a chakte chu ka tibo vang a, dik takin ka châwm ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, nangni thûah zawng, aw ka berâm rualte u, heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, ka berâmte kâr thu ka rêlsak ang a, berâmpate, kêlpate pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ran tlatna hmun ṭha tak chunga tlat chu in tân thil tênau anga langin, in tlatna neih chhun chu in chîl chhe mai mai zâwk a ni maw? Tin, tui fîm takte chu in in zawhin in pal nu mai mai a ni maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka berâmte erawh chuan in rah hnu an ei a, in pal nut hnu an in a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan an hnênah a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, kei, keimah ngei hian ran chêrte leh ran thaute kâr thu ka rêlsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chak lote chu in dâr leh in pangtein in nêk a, in kîtein in pir a, in tidarh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />chuvângin, ka berâmte chu ka chhanhim ang a, sa seh mai an ni tawh lo vang a, berâmte kâr thu ka rêlsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, an chungah berâmpu pakhat ka dah ang a, ka rawngbâwltu Davida ngei chu; ani chuan anni chu a châwm ang; ani chu an vêngtu a ni ang a, anni chu a châwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, kei Lalpa hi an Pathian ka ni ang a, ka rawngbâwltu Davida chu an chunga hotu a ni ang; kei Lalpa ngei hian ka sawi tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, anmahni nêna remna thuthlung ka siam ang a, sakawlhte chu ram ata ka tibo vang; tin, thlalêrahte pawh him takin an chêng ang a, ngaw hnuaiahte an muhîl chiah chiah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Anmahni leh ka tlâng vêl hmunte chu mal ka sâwm ang a, a hun têah ruah ka sûrtîr ang a, malsâwm ruahte a sûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, rama thing chuan rah a chhuah ang a, leiin a hlâwkna a chhuah ang a, an ramah chuan him takin an awm ang; an nghâwngkawlte ka tihtliaha, bâwiha siamtute kut ata ka chhan chhuah hunah chuan kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hnam dangte sahmîm tipuar mai an ni tawh lo vang a, rama sakawlhte ei ral mai an ni tawh hek lo vang; him takin an awm tawh zâwk ang a, tu mân an tihlau ngai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thil phun hmingthang tak ka siamsak ang a, chu ramah chuan ṭâmin a tiral tawh lo vang a, hnam dangte hmuhsitna an tuar tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, kei Lalpa an Pathian hi an hnênah ka awm tih an hriain, anni Israel chhûngte pawh ka mite an ni tih an hria ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />‘Nangni ka berâmte, ka ran tlatna hmuna berâmte chu mihring in ni a; tin, kei hi in Pathian ka ni,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Seir tlâng hmachhawn la, a hnênah thu sawi la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a hnênah, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh, aw Seir tlâng, ka do che a ni; i chungah ka kut ka lek ang a, thlalêrah, râpthlâk takah ka siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I khawpuite chu ka tiram ang a, thlalêrah i chang ang; tin, Lalpa chu ka ni tih hi i hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An bawhchhiatna hremna hnuhnûng bera an chhiat nia Israela chhûngte chu khandaih thiltihtheihnaa i hlana, i tai reng avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a nuna ka nun chhûng chu, thisen atân ka buatsaih ang chia, thisenin a ûm ang che; thisen i huat loh avângin thisen chuan a ûm ang che,” ’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hetiang hian Seir tlâng chu râpthlâk taka siamin thlalêrah ka siam ang; a chunga mi veivâk ṭhînte chu ka titâwp vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tlângte chu ama mi thahtein ka tikhat ang; i tlângahte, i kawr leh i tuikawr ruamahte khandaiha thahte chu an tlu rem rum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tiṭiau hlen daih ang chia, i khawpuite chu luahin a awm lo vang; tin, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chu a awm reng na a, hêng hnam pahnihte leh ram pahnihte hi ka ta a ni a, ka nei mai ang,’ i tih avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a nuna ka nun chhûng chu,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni, “I thinrimna ang zêl leh i huatna avânga îtsîkna i tihlan ang zêlin ka che dâwn a ni; i chung thu ka rêl hunah chuan an zîngah ka intilang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Tihṭiauvin an awm ta a, ka hnênah pêkin an awm ta,’ tia Israel tlângte i sawichhiatna zawng zawng chu kei Lalpa hian ka hre vek tih i la hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka chungah i kâa intilianin ka chungah thu i tuitam a, ka hre vek mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: ‘Lei pum pui lâwm nân ka tiṭiau ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel-te rochun a ṭiau avânga i lâwm ang bawkin i chungah ka ti ang; aw Seir tlâng leh Edom zawng zawng, a pumin a ṭiau vang! Tichuan, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang.’
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, nang mihring fapa, Israel tlângte hnênah thu sawi la, Nangni Israel tlângte u, Lalpa thu hi ngaithla rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: I chungah i hmêlmate chuan, ‘Chei! Hmasâng bâwlhmun zawng zawngte chu kan ta a ni ta,’ an tih avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thu sawi la, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Hnam la awm chhunte ta tûra kil tina an ei chia, an tihṭiau che avâng leh, mi kamtamte tîtî leh sawichhiata an awmtîr che u avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nangni Israel tlângte u, Lalpa Pathian thu hi ngaithla rawh u, Lalpa Pathian chuan tlângte, mualte, tuikawrte, ruamte leh hmun lo ram tawhte, khawpui ṭiau tawh, a vêla hnam la awm chhunte sahmîm tipuar mai leh nuihzatbûrte hnênah heti hian a ti a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Hnam la awm chhun leh Edom zawng zawng, rilru lâwm taka ka ram neih lo inruat chawpa, mi hmusit taka râllâka siam tumtute chungah chuan thinur êm êmin thu ka sawi ngei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel ram chungchâng thûah chuan thu sawi la, tlângte, mualte, tuikawrte leh ruamte hnênah chuan, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Ngai rawh u, hnam dangte chêksawlhna in tuar avângin thinur tak leh thinrim takin thu ka sawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: I vêla hnamte chuan anmahni mualphona an phur ngei ang, tiin ka kut ka lek e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni erawh chuan, aw Israel tlângte u, zâr in chhuah ang a, ka mi Israel-te tân rah in chhuah ang; an lo kal mai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai rawh u, in lama ṭang ka ni si a, in lam ka hawi ang a, rih dûrin in awm ang a, chi tuhin in awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In chungah mihring ka tipung ang a, Israel chhûngte zawng zawng, an vai pawhin; hmun ramte chu siam ṭhatin a awm ang a, khawpuite chu luahin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In chungah mi leh sa ka tipung ang a, an pungin an hmuingîl ang; in awm dân hmasa ang khân ka luahtîr ang che u a, a tîra in awm dân ai maha ṭhain ka siam ang che u; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni, in chungah mi ka lêntîr ang a, ka mi Israel-te ngei chu; an luah ang chia, an rochan i ni ang a, tûn achinah an fate i chântîr ngai tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: Nang mihringte ei raltu, i mite chân ṭhîntu i ni an tih ṭhin che avângin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mihringte i ei ral tawh lo vang a, i mite pawh i chân ngai tawh hek lo vang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Awze mite hmuhsitna ka tuartîr tawh lo vang chia, mite sawi chhiat i tuar ngai tawh hek lo vang a, i mite i chân ngai tawh hek lo vang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni, ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Israel chhûngte chu anmahni rama an chên lai khân an awm dân leh an thiltihtein an tibawlhhlawh a; ka hmaa an awm dân chu hmeichhe fel loh laia a thianghlim lohna ang mai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chuvângin, ram chungah thisen an chhuaha, an milimtea an tihbawlhhlawh avângin an chungah ka thinrimna chu ka hri thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hnamte zîngah ka tidarh a, ram tinah an darhsarh ta a; an awm dân leh an thiltihte ang zêlin an chung thu ka rêlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An va kalna hnamte hnên an thlenin ka hming thianghlim an tibawrhbâng a, miten, ‘Hêngte hi Lalpa mite an ni a, ram ata an lo chhuak a nih hi,’ an lo tih ṭhinah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mahse, Israel chhûngten an va kalna hnamte zînga an tihbawrhbân, ka hming thianghlim chu ka lainat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel chhûngte hnênah, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Aw, Israel chhûngte u, nangmahni ka lainat avâng ni lovin, in va kalna hnamte zînga in tihbawrhbân, ka hming thianghlim ka lainat avâng zâwkin hei hi ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka hming ropui tak, hnamte zînga bawrhbâng, an zînga nangmahni ngeiin in tihbawrhbân chu ka tithianghlim dâwn a ni; tichuan, an mit hmuha nangmahnia tihthianghlima ka awm hunah chuan Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hnamte zîng ata ka hruai chhuak ang che u a, ram zawng zawng ata ka khâwm ang che u a, in ram ngeiah ka hruai lût dâwn si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, in chungah tui fîm ka theh ang a, in lo thianghlim ang a, in bawlhhlawhna zawng zawng leh in milimte lak ata ka tlêng fai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thinlung thar ka pe ang che u a, in chhûngah thlarau thar ka dah ang; in tisa ata thinlung, lung anga sak chu ka la bo vang a, thinlung, tisa anga nêm ka pe zâwk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, in chhûngah ka thlarau ka dah ang a, ka dân siamah ka lêntîr ang che u a, ka thupêkte chu in vawng ang a, in zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />In pute hnêna ram ka pêkah chuan in chêng ang; tin, nangni chu ka mite in ni ang a, kei in Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />In bawlhhlawhna zawng zawng ata ka chhan chhuak ang che u a; tin, buh chu thu ka pe ang a, ka tipung ang a, in chungah ṭâm a tla tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thing rahte ka tipung ang a, thlawhhma ka tihlâwk ang a, ṭâm avânga hnamte zînga mualphona in tuar tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tichuan, in dân sualte, in thiltih ṭha lote chu in lo hre tawh ṭhîn ang a, in tenawmna leh in khawlohna avâng chuan nangmahni mit hmuh ngeiah in ten tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangmahni vânga hei hi ti ka ni lo tih lo hre mai rawh u, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni. Aw, Israel chhûngte u, in awm dân avâng chuan zak ula, kimki rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: In khawlohna zawng zawng ata ka tlen fai che u nîah chuan, khawpuite chu ka luahtîr leh ang che u a, hmun ram tawhte chu ka siam ṭha leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tin, ram lo chhe tawhte chu an let ang, tûn hmain mi veivâkte mit hmuha chhe tawh hnu ni mah sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, ‘He ram chhe tawh hnu hi Eden huan ang mai a lo ni leh ta; khawpui chhiaa, lo ram tawhte chu luah leh kulh neiin a awm leh ta,’ an la ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, in vêla hnam la awmte chuan kei Lalpa hian hmun chhiate chu ka siam ṭha leh a, ram lo chhe tawh chu ka tiduah leh ta tih an hria ang. Kei Lalpa hi ka ṭawng tawh a, ka ti ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Chu lovah pawh hei hi Israel chhûngte chu ka la dîltîr ang: ran rual ang maia an mite tipung tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Inthawina tûr ran rual, kût ni vângthlaa Jerusalem ran rualte ang maiin; chutiangin khawpui ram tawh hnu chu mipui tam takin a la khat ang; tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa kut chu ka chungah a awm a, Lalpa thlarau chuan mi hruai chhuak a, ruam lai takah mi dah a; chu ruam chu ruh hlîrin a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, an zîngah chuan mi hruai vêl ta a; tin, ruamah chuan a lo awm rem rum mai a! Tin, ngai teh, a ro vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, hêng ruhte hi a nung thei ang em?” a ti a. Tin, kei chuan, “Aw Lalpa Pathian, nangin i hre zâwk ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hêng ruhte hnênah hian thu sawi la, an hnênah, ‘Aw, nangni ruh rote u, Lalpa thu hi ngai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hêng ruhte hnênah hian Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, nangmahniah thaw ka luhtîr ang a, in nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, nangmahniah thahrui ka dah ang a, tisain ka tuam ang che u a, vunin ka khuh ang che u; tin, in chhûngah thaw ka awmtîr ang a, in nung ang. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,” ’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, thu mi pêk ang chuan ka sawi ta a; tin, ka han sawi chuan thâwm a lo awm a, ngai teh, a ri ta rum rum a, ruhte chu mahni zawmpui ṭheuhvah a inchuktuah khâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ka han en chuan, ngai teh, anmahniah thahrui a lo awm a, tisain a tuam a, vunin a khuh ta a; thaw erawh chu anmahniah a la awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Thli hnênah thu sawi la, mihring fapa, sawi ngei la, thli hnênah chuan, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Aw, thaw, kâwlkil li aṭangin lo kal la, hêng mi thahte chungah hian thaw rawh, an nun theih nân,” ’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, thu mi pêk ang chuan ka sawi a, thaw chu anmahniah a lo lût a, an nung ta a, mahni ke ṭheuhvin an ding a, sipai rual ropui tak an lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, hêng ruhte hi Israel chhûngkaw pum pui an ni a. Ngai teh, anni chuan, ‘Kan ruhte a ro zovin, kan beisei a bo zo ta a, râwt bovin kan awm ta,’ an ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, thu sawi la, an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, in thlânte ka hawng ang a, aw, ka mite u, in thlân ata ka chhuahtîr ang che u; tin, Israel ramah chuan ka hruai lût ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, in thlânte ka hawna, in thlân ata ka chhuahtîr che u hunah chuan, aw, ka mite u, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmahniah ka Thlarau ka dah ang a, in nung ang a, in ram ngeiah ka dah ang che u. Tichuan, kei, Lalpa hian ka sawi tawh a, ka ti ngei bawk a ni tih in hria ang,” ’ tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nang, mihring fapa, tiang pakhat la la, a chungah chuan, ‘Juda leh a pâwlpui Israel fate tan,’ tih ziak rawh; tiang dang pawh la la, chutah chuan, ‘Josefa, Ephraima tiang leh a pâwlpui Israel chhûngte zawng zawng tan,’ tih ziak bawk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, tiangte chu zawm la, i kutah pakhat a nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Hêng hi eng tihna nge ni, min kawhhmuh dâwn lâwm ni?’ i hnam faten an tih che chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, Josefa tiang, Ephraima leh a pâwlpui Israel chite kuta mi chu ka la ang a, chûng chu Juda tiang nên ka zawm ang a, pakhatah ka siam ang a, ka kutah pakhat a lo ni ang,’ ” i ti dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tiang, a chunga i ziaknate ngei kha an mit hmuh ngeiah i kutah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh u, Israel-te chu hnam, an va kalnate zîng ata ka hruai ang a, kil tin ata ka khâwm ang a, an ramah chuan ka hruai lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, chu ram, Israel tlângahte chuan hnam pakhatah ka siam ang a, lal pakhat chu an zaa lal a ni ang; tin, hnam pahnih an ni tawh lo vang a, lalna ram hnihah ṭhen a ni ngai tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An milimte, an thil tenawmte, an bawhchhiatnatein an intibawlhhlawh ngai tawh hek lo vang; an tlûka an sual ṭhinna zawng zawng ata ka chhan chhuak ang a, ka tlêng fai ang. Tichuan, ka mite an ni ang a, kei an Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka rawngbâwltu Davida chu an chunga lal a ni ang a, an zaa chungah berâmpu pakhat a awm ang; ka thupêkte an âwih ang a, ka dân siamte an zâwm ang a, an hmang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka rawngbâwltu Jakoba hnêna ka ram pêk, in pute lo chên ṭhinnaah chuan an chêng ang; chutah chuan kumkhuain an chêng ang a, anmahni leh an fate, an fate fate pawh; ka rawngbâwltu Davida chu kumkhuain an hotu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu anmahni hnênah remna thuthlung ka siam ang a, an tân kumkhaw thuthlung a ni ang a, an hnênah ka pe ang a, anni chu ka tipung ang a, an zîngah chuan kumkhuain ka biak bûk ka dintîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka bâwktê pawh an hnênah a awm ang a, an Pathian ka ni ang a, anni chu ka mite an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, an zîngah kumkhua atân ka biak bûk a din hunah chuan kei hi Lalpa , Israel tithianghlimtu chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” ’ ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu ka hnênah a lo thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mihring fapa, Magog rama mi, Ros leh Mesek leh Tubal hotu ber Goga hmachhawn la, a chungah thu sawi la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Ngai rawh, aw Goga, Ros leh Mesek leh Tubal hotu ber, ka do che a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka lehhawitîr ang chia, i khabeah nghakuaiin ka kuai ang chia, ka khai chhuak ang che; i sipai rual zawng zawngte, sakawr leh a chung chuang mite, râlthuam famkima inthuam zawng zawngte, pâwl ropui tak, phaw lian leh phaw tê hmanga khandaih keng ṭheuhte nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Persia, Kus, Put-te nên, an vaia phaw leh thîr lukhum neite chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer leh a sipai rual zawng zawngte; Togarma chhûngte, hmâr tâwpa mi leh a sipai rual zawng zawngte, i hnêna mi tam takte nên pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Inrâlring la, a ni, lo inpeih rawh, nang leh i hnêna awm khâwm, i pâwlpui zawng zawngte nên; tin, an vêngtu lo ni ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni tam tak hnuah chuan koh khâwm i ni ang a, kum hnuhnûngahte chuan khandaih laka chhan chhuah, hnam tam takte lak ata lâk khâwmte awmna ram, Israel tlâng ṭiau reng ṭhînte chu i rawn bei ang; hnamte zîng ata hruai chhuaha, tûna an vaia thlamuang taka an awmna ram chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, i chho vang a, thlipui ang maiin a lo thleng ang a, chhûmin ram a tuam mup mup ang mai hi i ni ang, nang leh i hnêna sipai rual zawng zawng leh i hnêna mi tam takte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: Chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, i rilruah thil a lo lût ang a, thil ṭha lo i suangtuah ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tichuan, ‘Kulh nei lo khuate ram chu ka rûn ang a, mi him taka awm hle hle, an zaa kulh lova chêng, kulh kawngkhâr leh a kalhna thîr nei lohote chu ka bei ang,’ i ti rilru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Râllâk sum leh bungruate la tûr leh hmun ṭiau hnu luah lehtute leh, hnamte zîng ata hruai khâwm tawh ran rual leh bungruate ngaha, lei lailuma chêngte chungah i kut lek i tum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Seba leh Dedan leh Tarsis sumdâwngte leh an sakeibaknei vânglai zawng zawngte chuan i hnênah, ‘Râllâk la tûrin i lo kal em ni? Mi rawk tûrin i pâwlte chu i rawn khâwm a ni maw? Tangkarua te, rangkachak te, ran rual leh bungruate, nasa tak chhuhsaka la bo tûr i ni maw, an ti ang che,’ tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, mihring fapa, thu sawi la, Goga hnênah chuan, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Chumi ni, ka mi Israel-te him taka an awm hun tûr chu i hre lo maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hmâr lam ram tâwp rêt, i hmun aṭang chuan i lo kal ang, nang leh i hnêna mi tam tak, sakawr chung chuang ṭheuh, pâwl ropui tak, sipai rual nasa tak mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhûmin ram a tuam mup mup ang mai hian ka mi Israel-te chungah i lo kal ang; heti hi a ni ang a, ni hnuhnûngahte chuan ka ram do tûrin ka hruai ang chia, hnamte chuan mi hria ang, aw Goga, an mit hmuha nangmaha tihthianghlima ka awm hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Hmasânga ka rawngbâwltu Israel zâwlnei, chûng laia kum tam tak chhûnga thu lo sawi ṭhîntuten, anmahni bei tûra ka rawn hruai tûr thu an sawi ṭhina kha i ni em, ti rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Israel ram bei tûra Goga a lo kal hunah chuan ka thinrimna chu ka hnâr khu chhuah hluah hluah ang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thin a rima ka thin a ur lai takin, ‘Chumi nîah chuan Israel ramah lîr nasa takin a nghîng ngei ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />chutichuan, tuipui sanghate, chunglêng savate, ramsate, lei chunga vâk rannung zawng zawng, lei chunga mihring zawng zawngte ka hmaah an khûr ang a, tlângte tihhniamin a awm ang a, kulh bang tin leiah a tlu ang,’ tiin ka sawi a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tlâng zawng zawngahte amah beihna tûrin khandaih ka lam ang, mi tin khandaih chuan a unaupa a do vang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tin, thisen chhuah leh hripuiin amah ka bei ang; amah leh a sipai rualte leh a hnêna mi tam takte chungah chuan, ruahpui vânâwn leh rial nasa tak leh mei leh kâtte ka sûrtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, ka ropuizia leh ka thianghlimzia ka tilang ang a; tin, hnam tam takte mit hmuhah ka intilang ang. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tin, nang, mihring fapa, Goga chungah thu sawi la, ‘ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Ngai rawh, aw Goga, Ros leh Mesek leh Tubal hotu ber, ka do che a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka lehhawitîr ang chia, ka hruai zêl ang chia, hmâr tâwp rêt ata ka hruai chhuak ang chia, Israel tlângahte chuan ka thlen ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, i kut vei lam ata i thal ngul chu ka titliak ang a, i kut ding lam ata i thalte chu ka tithla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel tlângahte chuan i tlu ang a, nang leh i sipai rual zawng zawng leh i hnêna mipui awmte nên; sava, sa hel ei chi tinrêngte hnên leh ram sakawlhte hnênah ei zawh atân ka pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tâmlakah i tlu ang; keiin ka sawi tawh si a,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,’ ti rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Magog leh tui kam rama him taka chêng ṭhînte chungah chuan mei ka chhuah ang. Tichuan, kei hi Lalpa ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ka mi Israel-te zîngah chuan ka hming thianghlim tihbawrhbân leh chu ka phal tawh hek lo vang. Tichuan, hnamte chuan kei hi Lalpa , Israel Mi Thianghlima chu ka ni tih an hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ngai rawh u, a lo thleng e! Hlenin a awm ngei ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni. “Hemi ni hi a ni, ka lo sawi tawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, Israel khawpuia chêngte chu an chhuak ang a, hriamhreite chu an tuah ang a, a kâng ral ang; phaw lian leh phaw tête, thal leh a ngulte, fei leh tiang zumte chu kum sarih chhûng an tuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram thing an phur lo vang a, ngaw thingte an kit hek lo vang, hriamhreite chu thingtuah atân an hmang dâwn si a; râllâka latute chu râllâka lâk an ni ve ang a, a rawktute chu an rawk ve thung ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tin, chumi nîah chuan heti hi a ni ang a, Goga tân Israel ramah phûmna hmun ka ruat ang a, tuipui chhak, Abarim ruam ngei chu; chu chuan khualzinte chu a dang ang, Goga leh a hote chu an phûm dâwn avângin. Tichuan, chu ruam chu Hamon-gog ruam an vuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Israel chhûngte chuan an ram thian faiin thla sarih chhûng an phûm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ni, rama mi zawng zawngin an phûm ang, chawimawia ka awm ni chu an tân hmingthanna a ni ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tin, an ram then fai nân, ruang phûm lohte zawng chhuaka phûm tûrin hnaa nei tûr mi an ruat hran ang, thla sarih tâwp hnuah an zawng ṭan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram fangtute chuan an fanin, mihring ruhte an hmuh chuan chhinchhiahna an siam ang a, Hamon-gog ruama phûmtuten an phûm hma chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, Hamonah chu khawpui hming a ni ang. Chutiang chuan ram an thian fai ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Tin, nang, mihring fapa, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Sava chi tinrêngte leh sa tinrêngte hnênah thu sawi la, “Pung khâwm ula, lo kal rawh u, sa in eia thisen in in theih nân Israel tlânga inthawina ropui tak, in tâna ka siam vêlah chuan rawn inkhâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi ropui sate in ei ang a, leia hotute thisen in in ang a, berâmpate, berâmnote, kêlte, Basan rama bâwngpa châwm thau zawng zawngte thisen nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In tâna inthawina ruai ka ṭheh thau chu puar ṭeuhvin in ei ang a, a thisen chu rui khawpin in in ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tichuan, sakawrte, tawlailîr hnûk mite, mi ropuite leh râl tu mi zawngtein ka chawhluiah in tlai ang,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />‘Tichuan, hnamte zîngah chuan ka ropuina ka dah ang a, hnam zawng zawngte chuan ka thurêl tihtlûk tawhte leh, an chunga ka kutthlâkte chu an hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi ni achinah chuan Israel chhûngten kei hi Lalpa an Pathian chu ka ni tih an hre tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, hnamte chuan Israel chhûngte chu an khawlohna avângin an tâng a ni tih an hria ang; ka laka an rinawm loh êm avângin anmahni lakah ka hmêl ka thup a; tichuan, an hmêlmate kutah ka pe a, khandaihin an tlu ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An thianghlim lohna ang zêl leh an bawhchhiatna ang zêlin an chungah ka ti ve a, an lakah ka hmêl ka thup a ni.’ ”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Chuvângin, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘Tûnah chuan Jakob-ho awm dân ka let ang a, Israel chhûngkaw pum pui chungah zah ka ngai ang, ka hming thianghlim chu ka humhalh tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tu mah tihlautu awm lova an rama him taka an chên hunah pawh an bawhchhiatna zawng zawng, ka chunga an bawhchhiatte leh an mualphona chu an phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mite zîng ata ka hruai chhuah leha, an hmêlmate ram ata dah khâwma, anmahnia hnam tam takte mit hmuha tihthianghlima ka awm hunah chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />hnamte zînga sala ka tântîra, an ram ngeia ka hruai khâwm leh dânah kei hi Lalpa an Pathian ka ni tih an hria ang; chutah chuan an zînga pakhat mah ka hnutchhiah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An lakah ka hmêl ka thup tawh lo vang, Israel chhûngte chungah ka thlarau ka leih tawh si a,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kan sal tân kum sawmhnih leh pangana, chumi kum bul thla ni sâwmna, khawpui chhiat hnu kum sâwm leh palina, chumi ni ngeiah chuan Lalpa kut chu ka chungah a lo awm a, chutah chuan mi hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian inlârnaah chuan Israel ramah mi hruai a, tlâng sâng takah mi dah a, chumi chhim lamah chuan khawpui din tawh ang mai a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutah chuan mi hruai a, ngai teh, mi pakhat a lo awm a, a hmêl lan dân chu dâr ang mai a ni a, la zai leh tehna tiang a keng a, kawngkaah chuan a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, mi chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, i mit khân en la, i beng chhi la, ka entîr tûr che lamah i rilru nghat tlat rawh; chu ka thil entîr tûr che atân chuan hetah hian rawn hruai i ni si a. I hmuh zawng zawngte chu Israel chhûngte hnênah chuan puang ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, in vêlah chuan kulh bang a lo awm a; tin, mi chuan tehna tiang, tawng ruka sei a keng a, a tawng khat chu tawng khat leh kutphah bêng ṭheuh a ni; tin, kulh bang chhah lam chu a teh a, tiang tlûk khat a ni a, a sân lam pawh tiang tlûk khat a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, chhak lam chhawng kawngka inah a lo kal a, a rahkaah chuan a chho va; tin, kawngka in luhna pindan chu a teh a, tiang tlûk khata zau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, vênna pindante chu a dung lam tiang tlûk khat, a vâng lam tiang tlûk khat ṭheuh a ni; vênna pindan inkâr chu tawng nga ṭheuh a ni a; tin, in pui lam kawngka in, sumhmun lama kawngka in, luhna pindan chu tiang tlûk khat a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In pui lam sumhmun pawh chu a teh a, tawng riat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A bangpêngte chu tawng hnih ṭheuh a ni a, kawngka sumhmun chu in pui lamah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, chhak lam kawngka ina vênna pindante chu lehlam lehlamah pathum ve ve a ni a, a pathum chuan a intiat vek a ni; tin, bangpêngte pawh kha a lehlam lehlama mi chu a intiat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kawngka in luhna vâng lam chu a teh a, tawng sâwm a ni a; kawngka in kal tlangna vâng lam chu tawng sâwm leh pathum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, vênna pindan hmaah chuan daidanna lehlam lehlamah tawng khata chhah ve ve a awm a; tichuan, vênna pindante chu lehlam lehlamah tawng ruk ve ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, kawngka in chu a teh a, vênna pindan pakhat chung aṭanga a lehlam chung thleng chuan tawng sawmhnih leh pangaa zau a ni, kawngkhâr leh kawngkhâr inzawm ṭheuhvin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, sumhmun pawh chu a teh a, tawng sawmruk a ni a; kawngka in sumhmun pâwn chu hung chhûng chu a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, kawngka in pâwnta ber aṭanga kawngka in sumhmun chhûngril ber thleng chuan tawng sawmnga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, kawngka in chhûng lamah chuan a vêlin pindanahte chuan tukverh hawn theih loh a awm a, a inkâra banahte pawh; a sumhmunahte pawh, a chhûng lamah pawh a vêlin tukverh a awm a, a banahte chuan tûm thing lem a awm ṭheuh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûng pâwnta zâwkah chuan mi hruai a; tin, ngai teh, pindante a awm a, hung chhûng chu a vêlin lung rem a ni a; tin, lungremah chuan pindan sawmthum a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, lungrem chu kawngka in aṭanga rem a ni a, kawngka in chen bawk tûra rem a ni a, chu chu lungrem hnuaihnung zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tichuan, kawngka in hnuai zâwk zâwn aṭang chuan hung chhûngnung zâwk pâwn lam thleng chuan a teh a, a zauzia chu tawng za a ni, a chhak lam leh a hmâr lam pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûng pâwnta zâwk kawngka in hmâr lampanga mi chu a dung leh a vâng pawh a teh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, vênna pindante chu lehlam lehlamah pathum ve ve a awm a, a bangpêngte leh a kawngka in sumhmunte pawh a hmasa ang vek a ni; a dung chu tawng sawmnga a ni a, a vâng chu tawng sawmhnih leh panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tukverhte, a sumhmuntea tûm thing lemte chu chhak lam kawngka ina mi ang vek a ni; rahka pasarih a awm chho va, a sumhmun chu a chhûng lamah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hung chhûngnung zâwk luhna tûr kawngka in chu kawngka in dang zâwnah khân a awm zêl a, hmâr lamah leh chhak lamah pawh; tin, kawngka in leh kawngka in inkâr chu a teh a, tawng za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chhim lamah mi hruai leh a; tin, ngai teh, chhim lam kawngka in chu a lo awm a; tin, a teh dân pângngaiin a bangpêngte leh a sumhmun chu a teh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chutah chuan a dangte ang bawkin a vêlin tukverhte a awm a, a sumhmunah pawh; a dung chu tawng sawmnga a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, rahka pasarih a awm chho va, sumhmun chu a chhûng lamah a awm a; tin, lehlam lehlamah bangpêngahte chuan tûm thing lem a awm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, chhim lamah chuan hung chhûngnung luhna tûr kawngka in a awm a, chhim lam kawngka inte inkâr chu a teh a, tawng za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, chhim lam kawngka ina hung chhûngnung zâwkah chuan mi hruai lût a, tehna pângngaiin chhim lam kawngka in chu a teh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />vênna pindante, a bangpêngte, sumhmunte chu tehna ngai vekin; chutah chuan tukverhte a awm a, a sumhmunah pawh a vêlin; a dung lam tawng sawmnga a ni a, a vâng lam tawng sawmhnih leh tawng nga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a vêlah chuan sumhmunte a awm a, a dung lam tawng sawmhnih leh panga, a vâng lam tawng nga a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A sumhmunte chuan hung chhûng pâwnta zâwk lam a hawi a; a bangpêngahte chuan tûm thing lem a awm a; a chhohna chuan rahka pariat a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, chhak lamah chuan hung chhûngnung zâwkah mi hruai a, a tehna pângngaiin kawngka in chu a teh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a vênna pindante, a bangpêngte, a sumhmunte tehna ngai vekin; chutah chuan tukverhte a awm a, sumhmunah pawh a vêlin; a dung lam chu tawng sawmnga a ni a, a vâng lam chu tawng sawmhnih leh panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A sumhmunte chuan hung chhûng pâwnta zâwk lam a hawi a, a bangpêngahte chuan lehlam lehlamah tûm thing lem a awm a; a chhohna chuan rahka pariat a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, hmâr lam kawngka inah chuan mi hruai leh a, a tehna pângngaiin a teh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a vênna pindante, a bangpêngte, a sumhmunte. Chutah chuan a vêlin tukverhte a awm a; a dung lam tawng sawmnga a ni a, a vang lam tawng sawmhnih leh panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A bangpêngte chu hung chhûng pâwnta zâwk lamah a awm a; a bangpêngahte chuan tûm kûng lem a inziak a, a chhohna chuan rahka pariat a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kawngka in sumhmun aṭanga luh theihin pindan a awm a, chutah chuan hâlral inthawina tûr an sil ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kawngka in sumhmun lehlam lehlamah chuan dawhkân pahnih ve ve a awm a; hâlral inthawina te, sual vânga inthawina te, thiam loh vânga thilhlante talhna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hmâr lam kawngka in luh chhohna pâwn lam sîr khatah chuan dawhkân pahnih a awm a; tin, kawngka in sumhmun lehlamah pawh chuan dawhkân pahnih a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tichuan, kawngka in sîr lehlampangah chuan dawhkân pali a awm a, a lehlampangah dawhkân pali a awm bawk a; inthawina talhna ṭhin chu dawhkân pariat a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tin, hâlral inthawina atân dawhkân pali, lung chhera siam, a dung lam tawng khat leh a chanve, a vâng lam tawng khat leh a chanve, a sân lam tawng khat a awm a; chutah chuan hâlral inthawina leh thilhlan talhna tûr hriamhreite an dah ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, a chhûng lamah chuan a vêlin thil kawm, kutphah bênga sei an vuah a, dawhkân chungahte chuan thilhlante sa a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûngnung zâwkah chuan mi hruai lût a; tin, ngai teh, hung chhûngnung zâwkah chuan pindan pahnih a la awm a, pakhat chu hmâr lam kawngka in bulah, chhim lam hawiin a awm a, pakhat chu chhim lam kawngka in bulah hmâr lam hawiin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “He pindan chhim lam hawi hi, a in vawngtu puithiamte awmna a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />pindan hmâr lam hawi chu maichâm vawngtu puithiamte awmna a ni; hêngte hi Zadoka fate, Levia fate zînga a rawngbâwl tûra Lalpa rawn hnaih ṭhîntute chu an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûng chu a teh a, a dung lam tawng za, a vâng lam tawng za, inbial vêl a ni; tin, maichâm chu kawtlai takah chuan a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Tin, a in pui sumhmunah chuan mi hruai ta a, sumhmun bangpêngte chu a teh ṭheuh va, a lehlam lehlamah tawng ngaa chhah ve ve a awm a, a luhna chu tawng sâwm leh tawng lia zau a ni, a sîr tuaka kawngka bangpêngte chu tawng thum ve ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A sumhmun chu a dung lam tawng sawmhnih, a vâng lam tawng sâwm leh tawng hnih a ni a, luh chhohnaah chuan rahka sâwm a awm a, bangpêng bulah a lehlam lehlamah chuan ban lian a awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, biak inah chuan mi hruai lût a, a bangpêngte chu a teh a, a sîr tuakah tawng ruka chhah ve ve a awm a, chu chu biak bûk vâng lam chen a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a luhna chu tawng sâwma zau a ni a, a sîr tuakah bangpêngte chu tawng nga ve ve a ni a; tin, a chhûng chu a dung tawng sawmli, a vâng tawng sawmhnih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, pindan chhûngnungah chuan a lût a, a luhna bangpêngte chu tawng hniha chhah ve ve a ni a, a luhna chu tawng ruka zau a ni a, a luhna bangpêngte chu tawng sarih ve ve a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, pindan chhûngnung chu a teh a, a chhûngpui bâkah a dung lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a vâng lam pawh tawng sawmhnih a ni; tin, ka hnênah, “Hei hi hmun serh ber chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, a in pui bang chu a teh a, tawng ruka chhah a ni a; tin, a sîr tinah chuan pindan tawng lia zau ṭheuh a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A vêla a sîr pindante tâna bang an siam chu rinchhanin, a in pui chu rinchhan lovin, in pui bang nghêng lovin chu lam chu a nghêng zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, a sîr pindante chu a lo sâng deuh deuhvin a zau deuh deuh zêl a; a bangte chu a zuih chhoh zêl avângin, a in vêlin a chhûngpui kha a hnaih deuh deuh zêl a ni. Tichuan, pindan hnuai ber aṭanga a chung ber thlenga kal tûrin a laita chu kal tlang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, in pui vêlah chuan lungrem pâwng awmin ka hmu a, a sîr pindan lungphûm chu tehna tiang, tawng ruk zeta sâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sîr pindan pâwn bang chu tawng ngaa chhah a ni; a sîr pindan pâwn bang bâkah chuan tawng nga a la âwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In pui lungrem pâwng leh hung chhûng pindante inkâr chu a vêlin tawng sawmhniha zau a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A sîr pindan kawngkhârte chu hmun âwl lama hawn a ni a, pakhat chu hmâr lam hawi a ni a, pakhat chu chhim lam hawi a ni; a vêla hmun âwl chu tawng ngaa zau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, thlang lama in pui kawmchâr hmun âwl piaha in chu tawng sawmsariha zau a ni; chu in bang chu a vêlin tawng ngaa chhah vek a ni a, a dung chu tawng sawmkua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, in pui chu a tehin tawng zaa sei a ni; in pui kawmchâr hmun âwl leh chumi in bang chhah lam chhiar telin tawng za a ni bawk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a in pui kawt hmun âwl chu tawng zaa zau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, in pui kawmchâr hmun âwl piaha in dung lam chu a teh a, a sîr tawna bangte huamin tawng za a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a chhûngpui te, hmun serh ber te, pâwn lam sumhmun te chu thing phelin an thuah a, a pathum chuan a vêlin hawn theih loh tukverh leh chhawrvêl a nei a, a in pui chu luhna kawngka thlengin a chhuat aṭanga tukverh thlenga a puma thing phela thuah a ni a (tukverh pawh chu thuah a ni bawk).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kawngka lû chung te, pindan serh ber te leh a pâwn lam nên, bang zawng zawng chu a chhûng lam leh a pâwn lam teh vekin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng chu cherub lemte leh tûm thing lemtea chei a ni a, cherub leh cherub inkârah tûm thing a awm zêl a; tin, cherub chuan hmai pahnih an nei ṭheuh va:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />mihring hmêl ang chuan lehlama tûm thing lam chu a hawi a, sakeibakneituai hmêl ang chuan lehlama tûm thing lam chu a hawi bawk a. Hêng hi in pum pui vêlah chuan an ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A chhuat aṭangin kawngka chung thlengin cherub leh tûm thing lema chei vek a ni; in pui bang chu chuti vek chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chhûngpui kawngka biangte chu a inbial a ni a, Hmun Thianghlim Ber hmaa mi nên a inang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutah chuan thinga siam maichâm a awm a, tawng thuma sâng, tawng hniha sei, tawng hniha zau a ni. A kil te, a mawng te leh a pang te chu thinga siam vek a ni; tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hei hi Lalpa hmaa dawhkân chu a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A chhûngpui leh Hmun Thianghlim Ber chuan kawngkhâr pahnih ve ve a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kawngkhâr chuan phel hnih a nei ve ve a, a phel khat chu a thlep thei ṭheuh a ni; kawngkhâr pakhatah phel hnih, a dangah phel hnih bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Banga an ziak ang bawk khân chhûngpui kawngkhârahte chuan cherub leh tûm thing lem an ziak ṭheuh bawk a; sumhmun pâwnah chuan thing phel chhah tak tak an zâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, sumhmun bang tuakahte leh thing phel zârahte chuan, tukverh hawn theih loh leh tûm thing lem chu a awm bawk a, a in pui sîr pindan leh thing phel zâr chu chutiang bawk chu a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûngnung zâwk hmâr lampangah chuan mi hruai chhuak a; hmun âwl zâwn hmâr lam kulh ban eptu pindanah chuan mi hruai lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hmâr lampanga pindante chu tawng zaa sei, tawng sawmngaa zau a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hung chhûngnung zâwk hmun âwl tawng sawmhnih lam hawi leh, hung pâwnta zâwk lungrem lam epin chhawrvêl chhâwng thum a awm ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pindante inkârah chuan tawng sâwma zau, tawng zaa sei kal tlangna a awm a, a kawngkhârte chuan hmâr lam a hawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pindan chungnungte chu a zîm zâwk a, in chhâwng hnuai zâwk leh a laitate ai chuan a chhawrvêlte chuan a la hek zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhâwng thumin sak a ni a, hung chhûng bante ang chuan ban a nei si lo va; tichuan, a laita ai chuan a chungnung ber chu a chêp a, a laita pawh chu a hnuaihnung ber ai chuan a chêp bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, pindan sîr pâwn lamah chuan, hung chhûng pâwnta zâwk lam epah bang tawng sawmngaa sei a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hung chhûng pâwnta zâwka pindante chu tawng sawmngaa sei a ni si a; tin, in pui hrûla mi chu tawng zaa sei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, chûng pindan hnuaiahte chuan chhak lampangah, hung chhûng pâwnta zâwk aṭanga luhna a awm a, pâwn lam bang inṭannaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhim lamah pawh chuan hmun âwl zâwna kulh bang epah chuan pindante a awm leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a hmaa kalna pawh chu hmâr lam pindante kalna ang bawk a ni, a dung leh a vângte pawh, a chhuahna te, a rem vêl dân te, a kawngkhârten chhim lam a hawi tih chauh lo chu thuhmun vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chûng pindante luh nân chuan kal tlangna tâwp chhak lam bang bulah chuan kawngkhâr a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Chhim lam leh hmâr lam pindan, hmun âwl rawn chhawngtute hi pindan serh an ni a, Lalpa rawn hnaihtu puithiamhoten thil serh berte an eia, thil serh berte an dah khâwma, ei tûr hlanna te, sual vânga inthawina te, thiam loh vânga inthawina te an hlanna tûr a ni; a hmun chu hmun serh a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuta puithiamte an luh phawt chuan, hmun serh aṭangin hung chhûng pâwnta zâwkah chuan an chhuak tûr a ni lo; chutah chuan an rawngbâwlna silhfênte chu an dah zâwk ang, silhfên serh a ni si a; silhfên dang inbel chauhvin vântlâng zîngah an che thei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />In pui chhûngnung zâwk a teh zawh chuan, chhak lam hawi kawngkaah chuan mi hruai chhuak a, a vêlin a teh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tehna tiang chuan chhak lampang chu a teh a, tawng zanga a ni a; a tehna tianga tehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmâr lampang a rawn teh leh thung a, tawng zanga a ni a, a tehna tianga tehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chhim lampang a teh leh a, tehna tianga tehin tawng zanga bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, thlang lam a rawn teh leh a, a tehna tianga tehin tawng zanga bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A sîr li chuan a teh a; a dung lam tawng zanga, a vâng lam tawng zanga a ni a, a vêlin kulh bang nei a ni a, chu chu hmun serh leh serh loh daidanna tûra siam a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, kawngkaah mi hruai a, chhak lam kawngkaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, ngai teh, Israel Pathian ropuina chu chhak lam aṭangin a lo thleng a. A thâwm chu tui tam tak ri ang a ni a, lei chu a ropuinain a ên vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inlârna ka hmuha a lan dân chu, khawpui tichhe tûra a lo kal leh Kebar lui kama inlârna ka hmuh ang bawk a ni a; tin, bawkkhupin ka tlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, khawchhak lam hawi kawngkaah chuan a in pui chhûngah Lalpa ropuina a lo lût a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, Thlarau chuan mi chawi kâng a, hung chhûngnung zâwkah chuan mi hruai lût a; tin, ngai teh, Lalpa ropuina chuan a in chu a tikhat ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, mi pakhat ka kianga a din laiin mi tuin emaw mi biain ka hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, hei hi ka lalṭhutthlêng awmna hmun, ka kephah nghahna, Israel fate zînga kumkhuaa ka chênna tûr hmun a nih hi. Ka hming thianghlim chu Israela chhûngten anmahniin emaw, an lalten emaw, an hurna leh an lalte ruang phûm nân hmangin an tibawrhbâng tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An kawngka chu ka kawngka bul taka siamin, an kawngka biang chu ka kawngka biang hrûla dahin, anmahni leh keima inkârah bang chauh awmtîrin an thiltih tenawmte chuan ka hming thianghlim chu an tibawrhbâng a; chuvângin, ka thinurnain anmahni chu ka tiboral ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûn aṭang hian an hurnate, an lal ruangte chu ka lak aṭanga hla takah dah bo sela; tin, an zîngah kumkhuain ka chêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tin, nang mihring fapa, a in pui lem chu Israel chhûngte hnênah entîr rawh, an thil tihsual chu an zahpui theih nân, a ruahman dân pawh lo teh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an thiltih zawng zawngte an zahpui chuan a in pui awm dân te, a chhuahna te, a luhna te, a rîruang te, a hman dân te, a vawn dân te entîr la, an mit hmuh ngeiah ziak rawh; a dân pum pui leh a hman dân zawng zawng an vawna, an zawm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hei hi a in pui tâna dân tûr chu a ni: tlâng chhîp chung zâwl vêl zawng zawng chu hmun serh theihtâwp tûr a ni; ngai teh, hei hi in pui tâna dân chu a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, tawnga tehin hei hi maichâm len lam chu a ni (tawng khat tih chu tawng khat leh kutphah bêng a ni), a nghahchhan chu tawng khata sâng, tawng khata hlai, a tlâng chu a vêla khâp khata pâwng zêl a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, maichâm sân lam chu hetiang hi a ni: leia a nghahchhan aṭanga a chhawrdawh hnuaihnung zâwk chu tawng hnih a ni a, a zau lam tawng khat; a chhawrdawh tê zâwk aṭanga a chhawrdawh lian zâwk chu tawng li a ni a, tawng khata zau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A maichâm chung zâwl chu tawng lia sâng a ni leh a, maichâm chung zâwl aṭang chuan ki pali a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maichâm chung zâwl chu a dung leh a vâng tawng sâwm leh pahnih ve ve a ni a, a inbial a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A chhawrdawh chu a dung leh a vâng tawng sawm leh pali ve ve a ni a, a inbial a, a tlâng chu tawng chanve a ni; a nghahchhan chu a vêlin tawng khat a ni; a kailâwn chuan khawchhak a hawi a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: ‘An siam zawh huna maichâm hman dân tûr chu hetiang hi a ni: hâlral inthawina tûr te, thisen thehna tûr te a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Levia chi puithiam Zadoka thlaha mi, rawng mi bâwl tûra mi rawn hnaih ṭhîntu hnênah chuan, sual vânga inthawina atân bâwngpatuai i pe tûr a ni,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘A thisen chu i la ang a, maichâm kî palite leh a chhawrdawh kil lite a tlâng vêlin i luan ang a; chutiang chuan maichâm chu i tlêngin i thian dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sual vânga inthawina bâwngpatuai chu i la ang a, hmun thianghlim pâwn lama, chumi atâna in ruatah chuan hâl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a ni hnihnaah chuan kêlchal, hmêlhem lo, sual vânga inthawina atân hlan tûr a ni; tichuan, maichâm chu bâwngpatuaia an then ang bawk khân then tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Maichâm then chu in tih zawh hunah bâwngpatuai hmêlhem lo leh, berâmchal hmêlhem lo, a rual zînga mi i hlân dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah i hlân ang a, puithiam chuan chi a phul ang a, Lalpa hnênah hâl ral atân a hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu ni tin sual vânga inthawina atân kêlchal i hmang tûr a ni; bâwngpatuai leh berâmchal, a rual zînga mi, hmêlhem lo an hmang bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maichâm then leh tlen faina chuan ni sarih a awh ang a; tichuan, maichâm chu serh a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, chûng nite an tlingtlâk zawh chuan, a ni riat ni aṭangin puithiamten in hâlral inthawinate leh remna inthawinate an maichâmah an hlân ang a; tin, ka lo pawm ang che u,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, hmun thianghlim kawngka pâwnta zâwk, khawchhak lam hawi lamah chuan mi hruai lêt a, khâr a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “He kawngka hi a inkhâr reng ang; a inhawng lo vang a, tu mah an lût hek lo vang! Lalpa , Israel Pathian chu a lo luh tawh avângin a inkhâr reng dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal erawh zawng Lalpa hmaa chaw ei tûrin chutah chuan a ṭhu chauh vang; sumhmun kawngkaah a lût ang a, chumiah vêk chuan a chhuak leh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, hmâr lam hawi kawngkaah chuan in pui kawtah mi hruai a; tin, ka han en a, ngai teh, Lalpa in chu Lalpa ropuinain a khat vek mai a; tin, bawkkhupin ka tlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, Lalpa in hman dân leh a dân zawng zawng i hnêna ka sawi chungchângah chuan i beng chhi la, i mit lên la, i rilruah chhinchhiah ṭha tê rawh khai! A in pui luh dân te, a hmun thianghlim ata chhuah dân te chu i rilruah chhinchhiah ngun ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, hel hmang, Israel chhûngte ngei hnênah chuan heti hian i sawi tûr a ni: Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Aw, nangni Israel chhûngte u, in tenawmna zawng zawng belhchhah tûra awze mi, thinlung leh tîsa serhtan loh - ka chhang te, thau te, thisen te in hlan laia ka hmun thianghlim, ka in ngei tibawrhbâng tûra in hruai luha, ka thuthlung in bawhchhiatah khân in tenawmna zawng zawng chu lo tâwp tawh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ka thil serhte nangnin in vawng lo va, hêng awze mite hi ka hmun thianghlimah in aia vawngtuah in ruat ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: Awze mi tu mah, thinlung leh tîsa serhtan loh chu, Israel fate zînga chêng pawh ni se, ka hmun thianghlimah an lût tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Levia chi, Israel-te milim ûma an vah bo laia ka laka hla taka kal tawhte erawh chuan an khawlohna an phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hmun thianghlimah chuan rawngbâwltuah an ṭang ang a, in pui kawngkhârte an vêng ang a, in pui chhûngah chuan rawng an bâwl ang; hâlral inthawina te leh mipui tâna inthawinate an talh ang a, mipui rawngbâwlsak tûrin an hmaah an ding ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An milimte hmaah an rawng an bâwlsak a, Israel chhûngte tân khawlohnaa tlûkna an nih ṭhin avângin an chungah ka kut ka lek a, an khawlohna chu an phur ngei ang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tichuan, ka hnênah puithiam hna thawk tûrin min rawn hnaih ngai lo vang a, ka thil serhte, thil serh berte an rawn hnaih ngai hek lo vang; an mualphona leh an thil tenawm tih tâkte chu an phur zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A in pui enkawltuahte ka siam ang a, rawngbâwlna zawng zawng leh tih tûr awm apiangte ti tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Puithiam Levia chi, Zadoka fa, ka laka Israel fate an vah bo laia ka hmun thianghlim vawngtute erawh chuan ka rawngbâwl tûrin min rawn hnaih chauh vang; thau leh thisen hlân tûrin ka hmaah an ding ang, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hmun thianghlimah chuan an lût ang a, rawng mi bâwlsak tûrin ka dawhkân an rawn hnaih ang a, mi enkawltuah an ṭang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûngnung zâwk kawngkaahte an luhin kawrfual zai sînin an inthuam ang a; hung chhûngnung zâwk leh in chhûng lama rawng an bâwl chhûngin sahmul puan an inbel tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Diar zai sîn an khim ang a, puan zai sîn kekawr an ha ang a, thlan tisa thei rêng rêng chu an inbel tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, hung chhûng pâwnta zâwk, vântlâng hnêna an lo chhuah chuan an rawngbâwlna silhfênte chu an hlîp ang a, pindan serhah chuan an dah ang a, silhfên dang an inbel ang; mipuite chu an silhfênin mi serhah a siam ve loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An lute an ziat kawlh tûr a ni lo va, an sam an zuah sei tûr a ni hek lo, an mêt chauh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Puithiam chuan hung chhûngnung zâwk an luh chuan uain an in tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmeithai emaw, mâk hnu emaw nupuiah an nei tûr a ni hek lo; Israel chhûngte chi, nula thianghlim emaw, puithiam thihsan hmeithai emaw an nei zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mite chu thil serh leh serh loh danglamzia an zirtîr tûr a ni a, thil thiang leh thiang lo an thliar hrantîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thubuai te pawh an rêl tûr a ni a, ka rêl dân ang zêlin an rêl ang. Ka kûtni vângthla zawng zawngah chuan ka dânte leh ka dân siamte an zâwm tûr a ni a; ka Chawlhnite pawh an serh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mahni intibawrhbâng tûrin mi ruang an hnaih tûr a ni lo; amaherawhchu, nu emaw, pa emaw, fanu emaw, fapa emaw, unaupa emaw, farnu pasal nei lo emaw tân chuan an intibawrhbâng thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tin, a inthen fai hnuah a tân ni sarih chhiarsak leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hung chhûngnung zâwka hmun thianghlima rawngbâwl tûra hmun thianghlima a luh nîah chuan, sual vânga inthawina ama tân a hlân tûr a ni, tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ro chan eng mah a nei lo vang; a ro chan chu keimah ka ni ang. Israel-ah chan eng mah in pe tûr a ni lo, an chan chu keimah hi ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ei tûr hlan te, sual vânga thilhlante, thiam loh vânga thilhlan te an ei ang a, Israel zînga thil serh apiang chu an ta tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rah hmasate zînga a ṭha ber apiang te, in thilhlan tinrênga a ṭha ber, in thilhlan zawng zawnga mi chu puithiamte ta tûr a ni; in ina malsâwmna a châm hlen theihna tûrin, chhangphut hmeh hlâwm ṭha ber chu puithiam hnênah in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Puithiam chuan sa tlaw rêng rêng - sava emaw, ramsa emaw, kut tuar emaw, amaha thi emaw an ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chu lovah chuan ro chan tûra ram in sem hunah chuan ram bung serh, Lalpa hnênah ram zuat in hlân tûr a ni; a dung lam chu tawng sînghnih leh sângnga, a vâng lam chu tawng sînghnih, a pumin ram serh a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hemiah hian hmun serh atân a dung leh a vâng tawng zanga ve ve, inbial a ni ang a; tin, a vêlin tawng zangaa zau hmun âwl a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, hemi teh sa aṭang hian a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga leh a vâng tawng sîngkhat i teh chhuak ang a, chumiah chuan hmun thianghlim serh ber chu a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram bung serh chu puithiam, hmun thianghlima rawngbâwltu, a rawngbâwl tûra Lalpa hnaih ṭhîntute tân a ni ang a, an in hmun atân leh hmun thianghlim atâna ram serh a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmun dang, a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga, a vâng tawng sîngkhat, Levia chi in puia rawngbâwltute pualah, an chênna khawpui atân a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram bung serh hlan tawh hrûlah chuan khawpui chan, a vâng tawng zanga leh a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga in ruat tûr a ni a, chu chu Israel chhûngkaw pum pui tân a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chan chu ram serh hlan tawh leh khawpui chan sîr tuak ve ve, ram serh hlan tawh hma lam leh khawpui chan hma lamah, thlang lama mi thlang lam hawiin, chhak lama mi chhak lam hawiin a awm tûr a ni; a dung chu thlang lam ramri aṭanga chhak lam ramri thlengin, ram bung dang chen bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chu chu Israel rama ama chanpual a ni tûr a ni; tin, ka lalte chuan ka mite an hnehchhiah tawh lo vang a, Israel chhûngte chu an hnam hran zia ang zêlin ram an pe zâwk ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Aw, Israel lalte u, tâwk tawh rawh se! Pâwngnêkna leh inramna chu bânsan daih ula, fel taka rêl leh dik taka tih chîng tawh ula, ka mite hnawh chhuah ṭhin chu bânsan tawh rawh u,’ tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bûkna leh bûk lung dik tak hman ṭheuh tûr a ni. Epha pawh, bath pawh a dik tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Epha leh bath hi a intluk chiah tûr a ni. Homer aṭanga teh tûr, hetiangin: epha sâwmin bath sâwm a tluk a, chu chu homer khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In bûk lung chu hetiang tûr hi a ni: gera sawmhnih leh sekel khat a intluk ang a, sekel sawmruk chu mina khat a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hei hi thilhlan in hlan tûr a ni ang; buh homer khat zêlah epha hmun ruka ṭhena hmun khat leh, barli homer khat zêlah epha hmun ruka ṭhena hmun khat in pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hriak hlan dân tûr chu kor khat zêlah bath hmun sâwma ṭhena hmun khat; kor chu bath sâwm a ni, homer tluk bawk a ni; homer khat chu bath sâwm a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel ran tlatna hmun ṭha ata berâm rual zînga mi zahnih zêlah a no pakhat, ei tûr hlan atân te, hâlral inthawina atân te, remna thilhlan atân te, anmahni then faina siamna tûrin an hlân tûr a ni,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Rama mi zawng zawngte chuan Israel lal hnênah he thilhlan hi an pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, kûtah te, thla tharah te, Chawlhniah te, Israel kûtni vângthla zawng zawngah hâlral inthawina te, ei tûr hlan te, in tûr hlan te lal chuan a ngaihtuah ang a; sual vânga inthawina te, ei tûr hlan te, hâlral inthawina te, remna thilhlante chu Israel chhûngte inthen fai nân anin a tumsak tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Thla khatna, chumi thla ni khat nîah chuan bâwngpatuai hmêlhem lo i hmang ang a, hmun thianghlim chu i thian fai tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, puithiam chuan sual vânga inthawina thisen chu a la ang a, in pui kawngka biangah te leh maichâm chhawrdawh kil liahte leh, hung chhûngnung zâwk kawngka in bangpêngahte a tât ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, chumi thla ni sarih nîah chuan tihpalh emaw, hriat lohna avâng emawa thil tisualtute tân pawh chutiang bawk chuan i ti ang a, chutiang chuan in pui thenna i siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thla khatna, chumi thla ni sâwm leh ni li nîah chuan Kalhlên Kût in serh ang; tin, ni sarih chhûng chu chhang dawidim telh loh in ei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chumi nîah chuan lalin amah leh a rama mi zawng zawng tân, sual vânga inthawi nân bâwngpatuai a tum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kûtni ni sarih chhûng zawng chuan, bâwngpatuai hmêlhem lo pasarih leh berâmpa pasarih zêl Lalpa tân hâlral inthawina tûrin a tum ang, sual vânga inthawina tûrin ni tin kêlpa pakhat nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, chhang hlan atân bâwngpa pakhat zêlah epha khat, berâmpa pakhat zêlah epha khat, leh epha khat zêlah hriak hin khat a tum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thla sarihna, chumi thla ni sâwm leh ni nga nia kûtah chuan ni sarih chhûng chu chutiang bawk chuan a ti ang a, sual vânga inthawina te, hâlral inthawina te, chhang hlan te leh hriakte tum vekin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Heti hian Lalpa Pathian chuan a ti a ni: “Hung chhûngnung zâwk kawngka chhak lam hawi chu hnathawh ni, ni ruk chhûng chu a inkhâr ang a, Chawlhniah leh thla thar nîah erawh chuan a inhawng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lal chu kawngka in sumhmunah a lût ang a, kawngka in bangpêng bulah a ding ang a, puithiamte chuan a hâlral inthawina leh remna thilhlante chu an buatsaihsak ang a, luhna kawngka in pindanah chuan Pathian a bia ang; tichuan, a chhuak ang a, kawng erawh chu tlai lam thlengin khâr loh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vântlâng erawh chuan Chawlhni leh thla tharahte chuan chu kawngka in luhna bulahte chuan Lalpa hmaah Pathian chibai an bûk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chawlhnia lalin Lalpa hnêna hâlral inthawina a hlan tûr chu, berâmno hmêlhem lo paruk leh berâmpa hmêlhem lo pakhat a ni ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tin, berâmpa pakhat zêlah chhang hlan epha khat, berâmnotêah chuan a pêk theih ang ang leh, epha khatah hriak hin khat zêl a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thla thar nîah chuan bâwngpatuai hmêlhem lo pakhat, berâmno paruk leh berâmpa pakhat a ni ang a, hmêlhem lo an ni vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chhang hlan a buatsaih ang a, bâwngpatuaiah epha khat, berâmpaah epha khat, berâmnotêah a theih ang ang, leh epha khat zêlah hriak hin khat a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lal chu a luh lamin kawngka in sumhmunah a lut ang a, chutah vêk chuan a chhuak leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vântlângte erawh chu kûtni vângthlaa Lalpa hmaa an lo kal chuan, Pathian chibai bûk tûra hmâr lam kawngka ina lo lût chu chhim lam kawngka inah an chhuak ang a, chhim lam kawngka ina lo lût chu hmâr lam kawngka inah an chhuak thung ang; an luhna kawngka inah chuan an kîr tûr a ni lo va, a hma lamah an kal zêl zâwk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, an luh chuan lal chu an zîngah a lût ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kût nite leh kûtpuiahte chuan chhang hlan chu bâwngpatuai pakhatah epha khat, berâmpa pakhatah epha khat, berâmnotêah a pêk theih ang ang, epha khatah hriak hin khat zêl a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, lalin duh thûa thilhlan a hlan dâwn chuan hâlral inthawina emaw, remna thilhlan emaw Lalpa hnêna duh thûa thilhlan anga a hlan dâwn chuan, khawchhak lam hawi kawng chu a hawnsak ang a, Chawlhnia tih ang bawkin hâlral inthawinate leh remna thilhlante chu a buatsaih ang; tichuan, a chhuak ang a, a chhuah hnuah kawng chu an khâr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni tinin Lalpa hnêna hâlral inthawi nân berâmno kum khat mi, hmêlhem lo i hmang ang a, tûk tinin i hmang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, tûk tinin chhang hlan i buatsaih ang a, epha hmun ruka ṭhena hmun khat leh hriak hin khat hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat, chhangphut dip tak tihhnâwn nân. Chu chu kumkhuaa Lalpa hnêna chhang hlan dân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hetiang hian hâlral thil hlân fo tûrin berâmnotê te, chhang hlan te, hriak te tûk tinin an buatsaih tûr a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Lalin a fapate, tu hnênah pawh, ro chan eng pawh a pêk chuan a fapate ta a ni ang a, an roluah a ni mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mahse, a ro chana mi chu a rawngbâwltu tu emaw hnêna a pêk chuan, bâwih chhuahna kum thlengin a nei ang a, chutah chuan lal hnênah a pe kîr tûr a ni; ama ro pângngai erawh chu a fapate ta tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu lovah pawh, lalin mite ro chan a chhuhsak tûr a ni lo va, an in leh lo ata a hnawt chhuak tûr a ni hek lo; ama ta ngeia mi chu a fapate hnênah ro chan a pe tûr a ni, mahni in leh lo ata mite an vah darh loh nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, kawngka in sîra puithiamte tâna pindan serh hmâr lam hawiah chuan mi hruai lût a; tin, ngai teh, a kawmchâr khawthlang lampangah chuan hmun a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “Hei hi puithiamten thiam loh vânga thilhlan leh sual vânga thilhlan an chhumna hmun, chhang hlan an urna hmun a nih hi; hung chhûng pâwnta zâwkah an ken chhuaha, mite chu mi serha an siam loh nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tin, hung pâwnta zâwkah chuan mi hruai chhuak a, hung chhûng kil hrûlah chuan mi kaltîr a; tin, ngai teh, a hung chhûng kil ṭheuhvah chuan hung a awm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hung chhûng kil liah chuan hung, bang nei, a dung tawng sawmli, a vâng tawng sawmthum a lo awm a; chûng a kila mi palite chu a intiat vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng hmun li chhûng lamah chuan a vêlin lung an rem tlar a, chumi tlar hnuaiah chuan a vêlin chhumna tûr thuk a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Hêngte hi chhumna in, in pui rawngbâwltuten mite inthawina sa an chhumna tûrte chu a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, in pui kawngkhârah chuan mi hruai lêt a; tin, ngai teh, in pui kawngka bul hnuai aṭang chuan chhak lam hawiin tui a lo luang chhuak a, in pui chu chhak lam hawi a ni si a; tin, tui chu maichâm chhim lam in pui sîr ding lam hnuai aṭangin a lo luang thla a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, hmâr lam hawi kawngka inah chuan mi hruai chhuak a, pâwnah chuan chhak lam hawi kawngka in pâwnta zâwk thlengin mi hruai a; tin, ngai teh, ding lampangah chuan tui a lo luang chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu mi chuan tehna hrui kenga chhak lam hawia kalin tawng sângkhat a teh a; tin, tui chu mi dai kaitîr a, kheimit thleng a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawng sângkhat a teh leh a, tui chu mi dai kaitîr leh a, tui chu khûp thleng a ni a. Tawng sângkhat a teh leh a, mi dai kaitîr leh a, tui chu kâwng thleng a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tawng sângkhat a teh leh a; tin, ka dai kai rual loh, luipui a lo ni ta a; tui chu a lo sâng zêl a, a daia dai kai rual loh, a hleuhva hleuh tham luipui a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Mihring fapa, hei hi i hmu em?” a ti a. Tin, luikam hrût tûrin mi hruai kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ka han kîr chuan, ngai teh, vaukam tluan chuan vaukam tawnin thing tam tak a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan ka hnênah, “He tui khawchhak ram lama luang hi Araba ramah a luang lût ang a, tuipui tui al chu tui thianghlimah a chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a lo ni ang a, luite chu an luanna apiangah rannung tinrêngin an dam phah ang a, sanghate an awm huai huai ang; tuipui tui a thianghlimna tûr leh a luanna apiangah rannungten an nun phahna tûrin hêng lui hi a lo luang a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, a kamah chuan sangha mantute an ding ang; En-gedi aṭanga En-eglaim thlengin lên denna hmun a ni ang. A sangha chu an chi ang zêlin, tuipui lian sangha ang maiin an tam êm êm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chirhdûp leh dûmte erawh chu an thianghlim ve lo vang a, chi khur atân hnutchhiah a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A lui kamah chuan a kam tuakin thei kûng tinrêng a ṭo vang a, chûngte chu a hnah a vuai ngai lovin a rah lo ngai hek lo vang; hmun thianghlim aṭanga lui lo luang chhuak châwm a nih avângin a thlakipin a rah ang. A rah chu ei atân a ni ang a, a hnah chu tihdam nân a ni ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chuan heti hian a ti a ni: “Hei hi Israel hnam sâwm leh hnam hnih zînga ram inṭhen dân tûr chu a ni e. Josefan chan hnih a chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Inang rengin in chang tûr a ni; in thlahtute hnêna pêk tûra chhia ka chham tawh kha, he ram hi in ram chanah a tlu dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hei hi a ram pum ri tûr a ni: hmâr lamah chuan Tuipui lian aṭangin Hethlon kaltlangin Hamath luhna ruamah Zedad a thleng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Berotha te, Damaska leh Hamath inrina laia awm Sibraim te, Hauran ramri bula awm Hazer-hattikon thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, ramri chu Tuipui lian aṭangin Damaska ramri bula Hazar-enan thlengin a ni ang a, hmâr lamah chuan Hamath ramriin a ri ang. Hei hi hmâr lam ramri chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, chhak lamah chuan Hauran leh Damaska inkârah Gilead leh Israel ram inkâra Jordan lui dung a zawh ang; hmâr lam ramri aṭangin khawchhak tuipuiah Tamar a thleng ang. Hei hi chhak lam ramri a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chhim lamah chuan Tamar aṭangin Meriba-kadesh tuite thlengin Aigupta lui zawhin Tuipui lian a thleng ang. Hei hi chhim lam ramri tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thlang lamah chuan Tuipui lianin a ri ang a, chhim lam ramri aṭangin Hamath luhna ruam zâwn thlengin. Heti hi thlang lam ramri a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, he ram hi Israel hnam athuin in zîngah in sem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, in ram chan tûr leh in zînga hnam dang chêng, nupui fanau nei tawhte ram chan tûr chu in sem tûr a ni. Anni chu Israel faa piang rêng ang an ni tûr a ni a, Israel hnamte zîngah nangmahni angin chan an nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni ang a, tu hnam zîngah pawh hnam dang lo khawsa sela, chutah chuan a ram chan tûr in ruatsak tûr a ni,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hêng hi an hnam hmingte chu a ni: hmâr lam ramri Tuipui lian aṭanga Hethlon kaltlangin Hamath luhna ruamah, Damaska ramria Hamath kiang hmâr lampang Hazar-enan thlengin, chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Dan-ho chan a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Aser-ho chan a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aser-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Naphtali-ho chan a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Naphtali-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Manase-ho chan a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Manase-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Ephraim-ho chan a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ephraim-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Reuben-ho chan a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Reuben-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Juda-ho chan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Juda-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin, ram zuat in hlan tûr chu a vâng tawng sînghnih leh sângnga a ni ang a, a dung chu chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan dang ang bawk a ni a, a laia hmun serh awmin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram zuat Lalpa hnêna in hlan tûr chu a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga, a vâng tawng sînghnih a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hetiang hian puithiamte tân ram serh zuat tûr a ni ang: hmâr lam zâwngin a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga leh, thlang lam zâwngin a vâng tawng sîngkhat leh, chhak lam zâwngin a vâng tawng sîngkhat, chhim lam zâwngin a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga a ni tûr a ni, a laia Lalpa hmun serh awmin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puithiam serh tawh, Zadoka fa ka thu vawngtute tân a ni ang. Chûngte chu Israel fate an vah bo laia, Levia chite an vâk bo ve ta mai anga vâk bo ve lote kha an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ram zuat pum pui ata an tâna zuat bîk, hmun serh ber a ni ang a, Levia chi chan nêna inriin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Puithiam chan zûl zêlah chuan Levia chiten chan an nei ang a, a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga, a vâng tawng sîngkhat a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, an hralh tûr a ni lo va, an thleng tûr a ni hek lo; a ram ṭha ṭha pawh mi dang hnênah pêk tûr a ni lo, Lalpa tâna serh a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A vâng tawng sînghnih leh sângnga bâka tawng sângnga chu vântlâng chan, khawpui dinna tûr, chênna in tûr leh daifêm atânte a ni ang; khawpui chu a lai takah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a teh vêl dân chu hetiangin a ni ang: a hmâr lampang tawng sângli leh zanga, a chhim lampang tawng sângli leh zanga, a chhak lampang tawng sângli leh zanga, a thlang lampang tawng sângli leh zanga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A khawpui chuan daifêm a nei ang a, hmâr lampang chuan tawng zahnih leh sawmnga, chhim lampang tawng zahnih leh sawmnga, chhak lampang tawng zahnih leh sawmnga, thlang lampang tawng zahnih leh sawmnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dung lam la chuang ram zuat serh tawh hrûla mi chu chhak lamah tawng sîngkhat, thlang lamah tawng sîngkhat a ni ang. Ram zuat serh tawh hrûl zêl a ni tûr a ni a; tin, chuta thil chhuakte chu khawpuia hnathawktute ei tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Khawpuia hnathawktu Israel hnam zawng zawnga mite chuan a lei an let ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ram zuat pum pui chu a dung tawng sînghnih leh sângnga, a vâng tawng sînghnih leh sângnga a ni ang. Ram zuat serh tawh, kil li bial, khawpui chan nên in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A bâk ram zuat serh tawh leh khawpui chan sîr tuak ve ve chu lal chan a ni ang a, chhak lam zâwngin ram zuat tawng sînghnih leh sângnga bâk leh, thlang lam zâwngin tawng sînghnih leh sângnga bâk, ram bung dangte hrûl zêl chu lal chan a ni ang; tichuan, ram zuat serh tawh leh in pui hmun serh chu a lai takah a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Levi-ho chan leh khawpui chan chu lal chante inkârah a awm ang a, lal chan chu Juda-ho chan leh Benjamin-ho chan nên a inri ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hnam la awmte chungchâng thûah chuan, chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Benjamin-ho chan a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Benjamin-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Simeon-ho chan a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeon-ho nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Isakar-ho chan a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Isakar-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Zebulun-ho chan a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zebulun-ho chan nêna inriin chhak leh thlang zâwngin chan khat chu Gad-ho chan a ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gad-ho chan chhim lampang ramri chuan, Tamar aṭangin Meriba-kadesh tuite thlengin Aigupta lui zawhin Tuipui lian a thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hei hi Israel hnamte ro chan tûra ram insem dân tûr leh an ram bung hrangte chu a ni,” tih hi Lalpa Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Hêngte hi khawpui ata chhuahnate chu a ni. Hmâr lampang tawng sângli leh zangaah chuan kawngka pathum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />khawpui kawngkate chu Israel hnam hming ang zêla vuah tûr a ni a; hmâr lama kawngka pathum chu: Reuben kawngka pakhat, Juda tân kawngka pakhat, Levia tân kawngka pakhat a ni ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />chhak lampang tawng sângli leh zangaah chuan kawngka pathum: Josefa tân kawngka pakhat, Benjamina tân kawngka pakhat, Dana tân kawngka pakhat a ni ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />chhim lampang tawng sângli leh zangaah chuan kawngka pathum: Simeona tân kawngka pakhat, Isakara tân kawngka pakhat, Zebuluna tân kawngka pakhat a ni ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />thlang lampang tawng sângli leh zangaah chuan kawngka pathum: Gada tân kawngka pakhat, Asera tân kawngka pakhat, Naphtalia tân kawngka pakhat a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A vêlin tawng sîngkhat leh sângriat a ni ang a, chumi ni aṭang chuan khawpui hming chu, ‘ Lalpa Awmna Hmun ’ tih a ni tûr a ni.”
  </para>
</usx>
